}, {'abstract': 'The partnership unites Chrysler and “Motown: the Musical” about Berry Gordy and Motown, the record label he founded in Detroit.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/01/business/a-shared-history-in-detroit-is-an-ad-inspiration.html', 'snippet': 'The partnership unites Chrysler and “Motown: the Musical” about Berry Gordy and Motown, the record label he founded in Detroit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE Chrysler Group is bringing to life the advertising theme for its Chrysler brand, “Imported from Detroit,” through an innovative partnership with a coming Broadway show that bears the Detroit-inspired name of one of the most famous brands in music.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/01/business/Adco/Adco-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1155, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/01/business/Adco/Adco-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1155}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/01/business/Adco/Adco-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 533, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/01/business/Adco/Adco-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1065, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/01/business/Adco/Adco-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/01/business/Adco/Adco-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, '