riod artwork, an elegiac fiddle-heavy soundtrack (composed by Patrick Derivaz) and caricaturesque talking heads to tell the stories of four figures instrumental in a fictitious forgotten battle: a gay West Point alumnus and opium addict; an elderly Chinese mystic-soldier-launderer; a former slave and brilliant engineer; and a one-armed prostitute seeking revenge on her former pimp.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/01/arts/01RDP_BATTLE/FILMROUNDUP2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 799, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/01/arts/01RDP_BATTLE/FILMROUNDUP2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 799}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/01/arts/01RDP_BATTLE/FILMROUNDUP2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 769, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/01/arts/01RDP_BATTLE/FILMROUNDUP2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1538, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/01/arts/01RDP_BATTLE/FILMROUNDUP2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/01/arts/01RDP_BATTLE/FILMROUNDUP2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/01/arts/01RDP_BATTLE/FILMROUNDUP2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'