: 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1857d1e6-831f-5b63-aced-e3b7bf694770', 'word_count': 592, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1857d1e6-831f-5b63-aced-e3b7bf694770'}, {'abstract': 'Prosecutors said that lawyers for Officer Gilberto Valle had been offering a distorted view of him, centered on the idea that his communications were only fantasy role playing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/01/nyregion/prosecutors-try-to-bolster-core-idea-in-cannibal-case.html', 'snippet': 'Prosecutors said that lawyers for Officer Gilberto Valle had been offering a distorted view of him, centered on the idea that his communications were only fantasy role playing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Federal prosecutors worked vigorously on Thursday to rehabilitate the notion that the actions of a New York police officer accused of plotting to kidnap, kill and eat women were real and not fantasy. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Prosecutors Try to Bolster Core Idea in Cannibal Case', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Prosecutors Try to Bolster Core Idea in Cannibal Case', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Valle, Gilberto', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cannibalism', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Bureau of Investigation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Kidnapping', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-01T03:58:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Weiser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'W