': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/01/how-will-india-pay-for-the-perks-in-the-new-budget/', 'snippet': 'Additional spending adds up to $42 billion.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Characteristic of a party headed for the polls, the Congress party’s budget Thursday morning had a lengthy list of handouts from increased spending on healthcare, education, rural and tribal welfare to a tax benefit for first-time home buyers and women’s development funds. Yet with all the additional spending adding up to a staggering 2.3 trillion rupees (about $42 billion), the minister projects that the country’s closely-watched fiscal deficit will be reined to 4.8 percent in 2013-14. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'How Will India Pay for the Perks in the New Budget?', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Budgets and Budgeting', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Indian Rupee (Currency)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mines and Mining', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Indian National Congress', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Delhi (India)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-01T08:10:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Akanksha Awal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Akanksha', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Awal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3b7df166-7b3a-5a6a-94f1-d744b8df0210', 'word_count': 697, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3b7df166-7b3a-5a6a-94f1-d744b8df0210'}, {'abstract': 'Alber Elbaz creates a collection that reflects the tastes of many women, and not merely one lady bountiful with erratic mood swings.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/01/lanvin-breaking-away/', 'snippet': 'Alber Elbaz creates a collection that reflects the tastes of many women, and not merely one lady bountiful with erratic mood swings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Alber Elbaz was all over the place at Lanvin. There was no theme or through-line in his show on Thursday night. Why, the jumbled format of the show was like something from the past.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Lanvin: Breaking Away', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dresses', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Flowers and Plants', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Models (Professional)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Elbaz, Alber', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCarthy, Melissa', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lanvin', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Bridesmaids (Movie)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-01T08:24:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cathy Horyn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cathy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Horyn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/37593556-2789-5513-bdc4-62c09602ecf6', 'word_count': 390, 'uri': 'nyt://article/37593556-2789-5513-bdc4-62c09602ecf6'}, {'abstract': 'Violent clashes erupted across Bangladesh on Thursday after a tribunal handed down a death sentence to an Islamic leader for crimes against humanity committed 42 years ago.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/02/world/asia/death-toll-from-bangladesh-unrest-hits-42.html', 'snippet': 'Violent clashes erupted across Bangladesh on Thursday after a tribunal handed down a death sentence to an Islamic leader for crimes against humanity committed 42 years ago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DHAKA, Bangladesh — The death toll from violent clashes between protesters and security forces in Bangladesh reached at least 44 on Friday, one day after a special war crimes tribunal handed down a death sentence to an Islamic leader for crimes against humanity committed 42 years ago, during the country’s 1971 war of independence from Pakistan.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/01/world/bangladesh1/bangladesh1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 807, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/01/world/bangladesh1/bangladesh1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 807}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/01/world/bangladesh1/bangladesh1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 762, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/01/world/bangladesh1/bangladesh1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1524, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/01/world/bangladesh1/bangladesh1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/01/world/bangladesh1/bangladesh1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'