rest rates at its next meeting.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — The unemployment rate in the euro zone edged up in January to another record, official data showed on Friday, as the ailing European economy continued to weigh on the job market.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/02/business/subEurozone/subEurozone-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/02/business/subEurozone/subEurozone-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/02/business/subEurozone/subEurozone-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/02/business/subEurozone/subEurozone-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Euro Zone Reports Record Joblessness and Low Inflation', 'kicker': 'Euro Watch', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Euro Zone Reports Record Joblessness and Low Inflation, Pressuring Central Bank', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Unemployment', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jolly, David', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Central Bank', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Inflation (Economics)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Euro (Currency)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'valu