.com/2013/03/01/the-tab-is-on-me/', 'snippet': 'Against Portugal’s new sales regulations? Pretend you’re the prime minister when you shop.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LISBON — Raquel and I had finished our drinks, and as the waiter was preparing our check at the counter he asked Raquel for her taxpayer I.D. number. She stiffened slightly; she had been waiting for this moment.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Tab Is On Me!', 'kicker': 'Latitude', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxation', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Passos Coelho, Pedro', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Portugal', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-01T12:13:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jonathan Blitzer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jonathan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Blitzer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/082a8016-9729-561d-a7f9-ebb1805102df', 'word_count': 564, 'uri': 'nyt://article/082a8016-9729-561d-a7f9-ebb1805102df'}, {'abstract': 'A live television show on China’s national broadcaster on Friday displayed four foreign drug traffickers, convicted of murder, being led to their executions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/02/world/asia/chinese-tv-special-on-executions-stirs-debate.html', 'snippet': 'A live television show on China’s national broadcaster on Friday displayed four foreign drug traffickers, convicted of murder, being led to their executions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIJING — During a two-hour television broadcast that was part morality play, part propaganda tour de force, the Chinese government on Friday sent four foreign drug traffickers to their deaths after convicting them of killing 13 Chinese sailors two years ago as they sailed down the Mekong River through Myanmar. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/02/world/china/china-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/02/world/china/china-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/02/world/china/china-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/02/world/china/china-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 713, 'width': 1072, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/02/world/china/china-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/02/world/china/china-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/02/world/china/china-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Divided Chinese See a Live TV Program About Executions as Crass, or Cathartic', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Divided Chinese See a Live TV Program About Executions as Crass, or Cathartic', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jacobs, Andrew', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': '