 1916 in Stockholm.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Teams to Wear Classic White', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Uniforms', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'NIKE Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Soccer Federation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-01T16:15:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jack Bell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jack', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9d81b111-c591-52c5-9f25-f4abe5d06ad4', 'word_count': 356, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9d81b111-c591-52c5-9f25-f4abe5d06ad4'}, {'abstract': 'Jon Pareles and Ben Ratliff discuss “Amok,” the new album by Atoms for Peace.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/01/popcast-deconstructing-thom-yorkes-atoms-for-peace/', 'snippet': 'Jon Pareles and Ben Ratliff discuss “Amok,” the new album by Atoms for Peace.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This week: Jon Pareles, The Times’s chief pop music critic, talks to host Ben Ratliff about “Amok,” the new album by Atoms for Peace. The quintet is, at heart, a collaboration between Radiohead’s Thom Yorke and his longtime producer Nigel Godrich. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/28/arts/atoms/atoms-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 378, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/02/28/arts/atoms/atoms-articleLarge.jpg', 'xla