 O. Scott and David Carr talk about Netflix’s “House of Cards” and other shows for “binge-viewing.” How do you watch TV?', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/01/the-sweet-spot-tv-binge-viewing/', 'snippet': 'A. O. Scott and David Carr talk about Netflix’s “House of Cards” and other shows for “binge-viewing.” How do you watch TV?', 'lead_paragraph': 'In this week’s episode, A. O. Scott and David Carr talk about Netflix’s “House of Cards” and other shows for “binge-viewing.” How do you watch TV?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Sweet Spot: Streaming Along', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings and Downloads', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Carr, David', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Scott, A O', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Netflix Inc', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-01T18:00:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/daec183e-dc10-589a-bb54-80c651cc0344', 'word_count': 27, 'uri': 'nyt://article/daec183e-dc10-589a-bb54-80c651cc0344'}, {'abstract': 'A weekly capsule of events around the world curated by our writers and editors.', 'web_url': 'https://intransit.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/01/calendar-coming-events-in-auburn-n-y-cambridge-md-seattle/', 'snippet': 'A weekly capsule of events around the world curated by our writers and editors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Harriet Tubman Centennial, New York and Maryland A woman leads a military expedition against a brutal regime, helping hundreds of people to escape. Sounds like the plot of a Quentin Tarantino film, but it is the story of Harriet Tubman, above, who died 100 years ago next week. New York State, where she settled, and Maryland, where she led many to freedom, are full of events in her honor, including a wreath-laying at her grave in Fort Hill Cemetery in Auburn, N.Y., on March 9, and a party that same day at the Harriet Tubman Museum in Cambridge, Md. (harriettubmanbyway.org)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Calendar: Coming Events in Auburn, N.Y.; Cambridge, Md.; Seattle', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-01T18:00:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/79fa9d3d-fef3-5ef0-8814-9e76cd83b814', 'word_count': 190, 'uri': 'nyt://article/79fa9d3d-fef3-5ef0-8814-9e76cd83b814'}, {'abstract': 'From the sisters behind the home fragrance brand Alora Ambianc comes a new collection of personal fragrance oils.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/01/vain-glorious-terveer-perfume-oils/', 'snippet': 'From the sisters behind the home fragrance brand Alora Ambianc comes a new collection of personal fragrance oils.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sisters Annie and Therese Gibbons, creators of the blockbuster home fragrance brand Alora Ambiance, have channeled their past and present travels into a new collection of personal perfume oils named after their mother. “I fell in love with the ritual of applying oil to your skin, and fragrance oils are more concentrated and therefore last longer as well,” Annie says. Green, which contains notes of fig leaves and wet oakmoss, aims to capture their childhood memories of growing up on a southern Minnesota farm; Incense, a blend of peppery-sweet bergamot and burnt firewood, evokes the spicy-smoky aroma of the Romanesque cathedrals they would frequently pass while living in Lake Como, Italy; and Gardenia celebrates the exotic flora of Hawaii, where Annie resides. “I actually sent several gardenia flowers, tuberoses and pikake leis to our perfumers, and we ended up with an authentic gardenia scent that smells like my backyard,” she says. Thanks to the supersleek refillable perfume holder, you can securely stash the fragrance oil in your bag and always have it within reach, regardless of where life may take you.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Vain Glorious | Terveer Perfume Oils', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Vain Glorious: Traveling Scents', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Perfumes and Fragrances', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Barneys New York', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-01T18:01:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jane Shin Park', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jane', 'middlename': 'Shin', 'lastname': 'Park', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9e66914f-72e1-527e-b74e-e501f6b40f29', 'word_count': 191, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9e66914f-72e1-527e-b74e-e501f6b40f29'}, {'abstract': 'The governor of Michigan says a state-appointed manager could help the city avert disaster.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/us/100000002094017/detroits-fiscal-woes.html', 'snippet': 'The governor of Michigan says a state-appointed manager could help the city avert di