ticle/9ba79984-7e67-5f48-b489-5dc10720848a'}, {'abstract': 'Cristian Mungiu’s new film, “Beyond the Hills,” based on an actual incident in Romania, dissects authoritarianism and intolerance.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/03/movies/sacrifice-at-the-altar-of-intolerance.html', 'snippet': 'Cristian Mungiu’s new film, “Beyond the Hills,” based on an actual incident in Romania, dissects authoritarianism and intolerance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two girls grow up together, friends and allies, in a decrepit Dickensian orphanage. When they turn 18 and have to leave, one goes abroad in search of work, while the other, after drifting for a while and out of other options, enters a monastery led by a charismatic monk and becomes a nun. After a few years the émigré returns to visit her friend and finds her changed, a bit distant. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/03/arts/03MUNGIU1_SPAN/03MUNGU1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/03/arts/03MUNGIU1_SPAN/03MUNGU1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/03/arts/03MUNGIU1_SPAN/03MUNGU1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/03/arts/03MUNGIU1_SPAN/03MUNGU1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1277, 'width': 1913, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/03/arts/03MUNGIU1_SPAN/03MUNGIU1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': '