of player personnel for the Memphis Grizzlies in December. Hollinger, who created the Player Efficiency Rating metric, a single number to measure a player’s overall value, is enjoying himself as the Grizzlies are riding high for the moment. So he will presumably be feeling pretty good on Friday as he heads to the Sports Analytics Conference at the Massachusetts Institute of Technology, the highlight of the sports geeks’ calendar.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Statistics Guru Settles In With the Grizzlies', 'kicker': 'Off the Dribble', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gay, Rudy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Prince, Tayshaun', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Memphis Grizzlies', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-01T19:49:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joshua Brustein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joshua', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Brustein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/483433d4-d1f0-534f-b7f7-280a215a7d76', 'word_count': 775, 'uri': 'nyt://article/483433d4-d1f0-534f-b7f7-280a215a7d76'}, {'abstract': 'The Red Bulls open their 2013 season at Portland on Sunday evening. Here are some questions to ponder.', 'web_url': 'https://goal.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/01/10-questions-for-the-red-bulls/', 'snippet': 'The Red Bulls open their 2013 season at Portland on Sunday evening. Here are some questions to ponder.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Red Bulls, the ever-underachieving Red Bulls, open their 2013 season at Portland on Sunday evening. And the schedule make