first season, isn’t getting as many eyeballs through delayed viewing this time around.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/01/smash-getting-only-a-little-help-from-dvr-numbers/', 'snippet': '“Smash,” which was buoyed by DVR ratings in its first season, isn’t getting as many eyeballs through delayed viewing this time around.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sure, the ratings for the second season of NBC’s “Smash” have been low. The most recent episode fell to 3.3 million total viewers and it barely cleared the 1 million threshold in viewers between the ages of 18 and 49, the demographic most important to advertisers. But DVR viewing was crucial to buoying “Smash” in its first season. Will that be a help this time around?Probably not.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Smash’ Getting Only a Little Help From DVR Numbers', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Broadcasting Co', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-01T20:10:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam Kepler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kepler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/644bb38e-9cb6-502b-8c3f-1a1345d3d6c2', 'word_count': 192, 'uri': 'nyt://article/644bb38e-9cb6-502b-8c3f-1a1345d3d6c2'}, {'abstract': 'A photographer seeks to drive home the proximity of fracking to Glacier National Park.', 'web_url': 'https://green.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/01/a-snapshot-of-drilling-on-a-parks-margins/', 'snippet': 'A photographer seeks to drive home the proximity of fracking to Glacier National Park.', 'lead_paragraph': 'More on the