'This year marks the seventh installment of the M.I.T. Sloan Sports Analytics Conference. Held in Boston, the conference – which is expected to draw in excess of 2,500 attendees – represents the cutting edge of statistical, economic and technological information in the world of sports, with dozens of papers, panels and presentations giving attendees a first-hand look at the future of our most cherished pastimes.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Teams Trailing Late in Games Play More Efficiently, Paper Suggests', 'kicker': 'Off the Dribble', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Massachusetts Institute of Technology', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Basketball Assn', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-01T21:57:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jim Cavan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cavan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/081470a9-148f-58f6-8c77-11435dd89920', 'word_count': 594, 'uri': 'nyt://article/081470a9-148f-58f6-8c77-11435dd89920'}, {'abstract': 'Scenes from the Paris Fashion Week photo diary of Kasia Bobula.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/01/photos-of-the-moment-isabel-marant-4/', 'snippet': 'Scenes from the Paris Fashion Week photo diary of Kasia Bobula.', 'lead_paragraph': 'var data;function jsonSlideshowCallback(response){data = response;}NYTD.options = {source: data,cropType: \'blog480\',appendTo: \'fullScreenSlideShow\',showHeadLine: \'false\', renderstyle: "embeddedSlideShowTmag"}', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Photos of The Moment | Isabel Marant', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-03-01T22:00:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kasia Bobula', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kasia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bobula', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5d3d6ecd-f703-5b5a-83cd-b8662574129e', 'word_count': 34, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5d3d6ecd-f703-5b5a-83cd-b8662574129e'}, {'abstract': 'The New York Times is discontinuing the Green blog but plans to press on with aggressive energy and environment coverage.', 'web_url': 'https://green.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/01/a-blogs-adieu/', 'snippet': 'The New York Times is discontinuing the Green blog but plans to press on with aggressive energy and environment coverage.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Times is discontinuing the Green blog, which was created \xa0to track environmental and energy news and to foster lively discussion of developments in both areas. This change will allow us to direct production resources to other online projects. But we’ll forge ahead with our aggressive reporting on environmental and energy topics, including climate change, land use, threatened ecosystems, government policy, the fossil fuel industries, the growing renewables sector and consumer choices.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Blog’s Adieu', 'kicker': 'Green', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blogs and Blogging (Internet)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-01T22:00