jets-can-best-afford-to-wait-and-see-on-darrelle-revis.html', 'snippet': 'Cornerback Darrelle Revis, recovering from a torn knee ligament, wants a new contract, but his trade value will not increase until he proves himself on the field.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Either Darrelle Revis will play for the Jets in 2013, or he won’t. The simplicity of that statement obscures a complicated problem, one that will lord over the team until it is resolved, be it in six days, six weeks or six months. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/02/sports/jets/jets-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 408, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/02/sports/jets/jets-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 408}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/02/sports/jets/jets-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 696, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/02/sports/jets/jets-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1393, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/02/sports/jets/jets-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/02/sports/jets/jets-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/02/sports/jets/jets-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'On Revis, the Jets Can Best Afford to Wait and See', 'kicker': 'On Football', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Jets Need Not Hurry in Deciding What to Do About Revis', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Revis, Darrelle', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Jets', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Trades (Sports)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Woody', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-02T02:46:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Shpigel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shpigel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/44d18ba0-0ba5-5430-95d0-a1d196b49b53', 'word_count': 747, 'uri': 'nyt://article/44d18ba0-0ba5-5430-95d0-a1d196b49b53'}, {'abstract': 'Natalie Nougayrède, 46, was chosen Friday as the first woman to serve as both director and editor of Le Monde, France’s most prominent newspaper, and its Web site.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/02/world/europe/france-le-monde-picks-first-woman-for-a-top-post.html', 'snippet': 'Natalie Nougayrède, 46, was chosen Friday as the first woman to serve as both director and editor of Le Monde, France’s most prominent newspaper, and its Web site.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Natalie Nougayrède, 46, was chosen Friday as the first woman to serve as both director and editor of Le Monde, France’s most prominent newspaper, and its Web site. Ms. Nougayrède, the diplomatic correspondent and former Moscow bureau chief for the newspaper, was elected by the staff after being nominated by the principal owners. She succeeds Érik Izraelewicz, who died suddenly in November and who had first combined the jobs of director and editor. Sylvie Kauffmann was the first woman to serve as editor of Le Monde, under the director Éric Fottorino. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'France: Le Monde Picks First Woman for a Top Post', 'kicker': 'World Briefing | Europe', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'France: Le Monde Picks First Woman for a Top Post', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Erlanger, Steven', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Le Monde', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nougayrede, Natalie', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-02T02:53:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Erlanger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Erlanger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/40e8f297-7f9a-5b6b-a730-5f80bf9fe385', 'word_count': 91, 'uri': 'nyt://article/40e8f297-7f9a-5b6b-a730-5f80bf9fe385'}, {'abstract': 'At the Strand Smokehouse in Astoria, Queens, four soccer teammates and a friend gathered to eat off platters covered in butcher paper.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/03/nyregion/soccer-in-the-blood-pulled-pork-on-the-platter-at-the-strand-smokehouse.html', 'snippet': 'At the Strand Smokehouse in Astoria, Queens, four soccer teammates and a friend gathered to eat off platters covered in butcher paper.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With its smoky aromas, rough-hewed picnic tables and numerous bourbons poured straight from the barrel, the Strand Smokehouse, at 25-27 Broadway, brings a hint of down-home flavor to the traditionally Greek precincts of Astoria, Queens. Half barbecue joint, half beer garden, the Strand, which opened two months ago, serves a pan-regional mash-up of ribs, smoked chicken and pulled pork accompanied by local craft beers and a whiskey selection that could easily make a transplanted good old boy nostalgic for home. While the large backyard was still closed for the season last week, the cavernous main room was filled with an assortment of sticky-fingered families, curious local residents and at least one heterogeneous party of first-time visitors.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/03/nyregion/03TABLE/03TABLE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 281, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/03/nyregion/03TABLE/03TABLE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 281}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/03/nyregion/03TABLE/03TABLE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/03/nyregion/03TABLE/03TABLE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 960, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/03/nyregion/03TABLE/03TABLE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/03/nyregion/03TABLE/03TABLE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/03/nyregion/03TABLE/03TABLE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Soccer in the Blood, Pork on the Platter', 'kicker': 'At the Table | The Strand Smokehouse', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Soccer in the Blood, Pork on the Platter', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Feuer, Alan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Astoria (Queens, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Strand Smokehouse (Queens, NY, Restaurant)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-02T02:57:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alan Feuer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Feuer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b9c9c516-41d8-5bf0-b762-59aaf1f9b65c', 'word_count': 539, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b9c9c516-41d8-5bf0-b762-59aaf1f9b65c'}, {'abstract': 'Corrections appearing in print on March 2, 2013.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/02/pageoneplus/corrections-march-2-2013.html', 'snippet': 'Corrections appearing in print on March 2, 2013.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FRONT PAGE', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: March 2, 2013', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-03-02T03:00:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '',