cting fewer passengers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/02/nyregion/safety-board-says-helicopter-in-east-river-crash-was-overloaded.html', 'snippet': 'Investigators reported that the pilot was expecting fewer passengers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The pilot of a helicopter that crashed into the East River in 2011 failed to properly account for the weight of his passengers, three of whom died after being trapped underwater, federal safety officials concluded in a report released on Friday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Safety Board Calls Copter in East River Crash Overloaded', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Safety Board Says Copter In Crash Was Overloaded', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Aviation Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McGeehan, Patrick', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Helicopters', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Transportation Safety Board', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dudley, Paul', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'East River (NYC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-02T03:54:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick McGeehan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McGeehan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9fe00ab8-4705-53a2-aa38-baeeb81e6972', 'word_count': 576, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9fe00ab8-4705-53a2-aa38-baeeb81e6972'}, {'abstract': 'Deron Williams tried mightily against the team that courted him in the off-season, but the Nets had dug themselves into too deep a hole.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/02/sports/basketball/nets-fall-short-against-the-mavericks.html', 'snippet': 'Deron Williams tried mightily against the team that courted him in the off-season, but the Nets had dug themselves into too deep a hole.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Deron Williams opened and closed Friday’s game against Dallas playing like a motivated superstar, one the Mavericks openly coveted and the Nets paid handsomely to keep this past off-season.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/02/sports/basketball/02nets1-img/02nets1-img-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 436, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/02/sports/basketball/02nets1-img/02nets1-img-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 436}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/02/sports/basketball/02nets1-img/02nets1-img-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 745, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/02/sports/basketball/02nets1-img/02nets1-img-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1490, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/02/sports/basketball/02nets1-img/02nets1-img-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/02/sports/basketball/02nets1-img/02nets1-img-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/02/sport