nk': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Lower East Side (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rose, Brian', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fausty, Edward', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-02T03:58:35+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'New York', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/b200a738-da00-5893-9618-007e2bf7d583', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/b200a738-da00-5893-9618-007e2bf7d583'}, {'abstract': 'Thirteen years ago, Jennifer Sultan and her colleagues sold a technology company for $70 million; on Friday, she got a four-year sentence for selling oxycodone and conspiring to sell a gun.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/02/nyregion/jennifer-sultan-pleads-guilty-to-selling-prescription-drugs.html', 'snippet': 'Thirteen years ago, Jennifer Sultan and her colleagues sold a technology company for $70 million; on Friday, she got a four-year sentence for selling oxycodone and conspiring to sell a gun.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At the height of dot-com mania 13 years ago, Jennifer Sultan and a few colleagues sold their small technology company for $70 million in stock and cash. She and her boyfriend rented a large house in the Hamptons for the summer and bought a spacious loft near Union Square.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/02/nyregion/plede/plede-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/02/nyregion/plede/plede-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/02/