ly to face criminal charges but may face administrative charges for not being at her post when Amar Diarrassouba was hit.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/02/nyregion/guard-was-not-at-east-harlem-crossing-when-truck-killed-boy-6.html', 'snippet': 'Flavia Roman is unlikely to face criminal charges but may face administrative charges for not being at her post when Amar Diarrassouba was hit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A school crossing guard who was not at an intersection in East Harlem when a truck hit and killed a 6-year-old boy had called into the police station just before the accident to report being on the job, the police said on Friday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Guard Said She Was at Post Before Truck Killed Boy, 6', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Guard Said She Was at Post Before Truck Killed Boy, 6', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Traffic Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ruderman, Wendy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Diarrassouba, Amar', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-12)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'East Harlem (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Roman, Flavia', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-02T04:04:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Wendy Ruderman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Wendy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ruderman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9006f0cf-a450-5245-b328-ed308624dcd1', 'word_count': 430, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9006f0cf-a450-5245-b328-ed308624dcd1'}, {'abstract': 'There was a time when a sloppy 1-7 start, such as this Yankee team is off to, would have led to an outraged owner.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/02/sports/baseball/for-yankees-even-in-spring-little-panic-with-few-wins-is-something-new.html', 'snippet': 'There was a time when a sloppy 1-7 start, such as this Yankee team is off to, would have led to an outraged owner.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TAMPA, Fla. — There may be nothing as meaningless as the results of spring training games, especially only one week into the exhibition schedule. And there is no proven correlation between wins and losses at this time of year and what happens in October, so Yankee fans do not need to panic. At least not yet.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/02/sports/sub-yankees/sub-yankees-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 442, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/02/sports/sub-yankees/sub-yankees-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 442}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/02/sports/sub-yankees/sub-yankees-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 754, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/02/sports/sub-yankees/sub-yankees-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1507, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/02/sports/sub-yankees/sub-yankees-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thum