 seen in public since his Dec. 11 surgery in Havana.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CARACAS, Venezuela — President Hugo Chávez is receiving chemotherapy or radiation treatments in the aftermath of his most recent cancer surgery, a government official said for the first time on Friday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Venezuelan Official Confirms Chávez Receiving Cancer Treatments', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Chávez Back\r\nOn Treatment\r\nFor Cancer', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Venezuela', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chavez, Hugo', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Radiation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Chemotherapy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cancer', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-02T04:20:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Neuman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Neuman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9bb26cc2-e62c-543f-b925-b975531e368a', 'word_count': 445, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9bb26cc2-e62c-543f-b925-b975531e368a'}, {'abstract': 'The trial of Gilberto Valle, accused of plotting to kidnap, cook and eat female victims, should serve as a summons to broaden our discussions about the corners of the Internet where violent notions about women flourish.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/03/nyregion/remember-misogyny-its-on-the-web.html', 'snippet': 'The trial of Gilberto Valle, accused of plotting to kidnap, cook and eat female victims, should serve as a summons to broaden our discussions about the corners of the Internet where violent notions about women flourish.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you spent any time in Manhattan during the 1980s, particularly on the Upper West Side, you are likely to recall a recurrent vignette of dissent — the presence of a thin, wiry woman with hair that made emphatic her seriousness, who colonized the sidewalks in what appeared to be a full-time avocation as a crusader against pornography and other forms of sexual degradation. To make her point, she would often have with her a blowup of a notorious Hustler cover that featured an image of a woman who had been plunged headfirst into a meat grinder. Her approach was hardly solicitous; she demanded of those who passed by, “Sign the petition!”', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/03/nyregion/03BIG1/03JPBIG1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/03/nyregion/03BIG1/03JPBIG1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/03/nyregion/03BIG1/03JPBIG1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 631, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/03/nyregion/03BIG1/03JPBIG1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1263, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/03/nyregion/03BIG1/03JPBIG1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/03/nyregion/03BIG1/03JPBIG1-thumbStandard.jpg', 