ick Read: March 2', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-03-02T04:38:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By The International Herald Tribune', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The International Herald Tribune'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b5f1f850-9861-5216-9a0f-1bae84b57f01', 'word_count': 526, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b5f1f850-9861-5216-9a0f-1bae84b57f01'}, {'abstract': 'A rookie driver on Nascar’s Nationwide Series, Kyle Larson is eager to race again after being involved in last week’s crash at Daytona International Speedway.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/02/sports/autoracing/kyle-larson-may-be-nascars-next-star.html', 'snippet': 'A rookie driver on Nascar’s Nationwide Series, Kyle Larson is eager to race again after being involved in last week’s crash at Daytona International Speedway.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mike and Janet Larson were sitting in the upper deck of the front-stretch grandstand at Daytona International Speedway last Saturday afternoon when they saw a 12-car crash in the final lap of a Nascar Nationwide Series race. The crash began almost right in front of them.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/02/sports/y-nascar/y-nascar-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/02/sports/y-nascar/y-nascar-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/02/sports/y-nascar/y-nascar-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0,