86-5cd6-8020-e06d626f64e8'}, {'abstract': 'Basketball players from the Robert M. Beren Academy in Houston won the right to compete in a state tournament without having to play on the Jewish Sabbath. Then they had to win their games on the court.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/02/sports/jewish-academy-competes-in-texas-after-winning-the-right-to-play.html', 'snippet': 'Basketball players from the Robert M. Beren Academy in Houston won the right to compete in a state tournament without having to play on the Jewish Sabbath. Then they had to win their games on the court.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When he woke up Friday, Zachary Yoshor, 17, a senior at the Robert M. Beren Academy in Houston and a star player on the school’s basketball team, said he was not nervous about the state semifinal game looming for his team that afternoon in Fort Worth. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Right to Play Is a Victory for a Texas School', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Right to Play Is a Victory For a School', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pilon, Mary', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Beren, Robert M, Academy (Houston, Tex)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jews and Judaism', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Texas Assn of Private and Parochial Schools', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Houston (Tex)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-02T04:59:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mary Pilon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pilon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cc9a29d8-b195-5182-9324-0624feac474c', 'word_count': 380, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cc9a29d8-b195-5182-9324-0624feac474c'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Bernanke, speaking at a conference in San Francisco, said the Federal Reserve’s stimulus was working and he warned of the risk of raising interest rates too soon.', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/02/different-time-zone-same-defense-for-bernanke/', 'snippet': 'Mr. Bernanke, speaking at a conference in San Francisco, said the Federal Reserve’s stimulus was working and he warned of the risk of raising interest rates too soon.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Federal Reserve’s chairman, Ben S. Bernanke, picked an unusual time to offer his most recent defense of the Fed’s campaign to stimulate the economy: 7 p.m. on a Friday night in San Francisco, 10 p.m. back home on the East Coast.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Late Night With Ben Bernanke', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interest Rates', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Subprime Mortgage Crisis', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bernanke, Ben S', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Reserve System', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-02T05:02:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Binyamin Appelbaum', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Binyamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Appelbaum', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e3b73746-d120-5e06-8b96-c08c0ff9765e', 'word_count': 447, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e3b73746-d120-5e06-8b96-c08c0ff9765e'}, {'abstract': 'A 41-day road from bracket pairings to a championship has drawn criticism from coaches.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/02/sports/ncaabasketball/ncaa-division-iii-basketball-tournament-will-be-lengthy.html', 'snippet': 'A 41-day road from bracket pairings to a championship has drawn criticism from coaches.', 'lead_paragraph': 'David Hixon, the coach of second-ranked Amherst, had mixed emotions when he saw the draw for the Division III men’s basketball tournament, which begins Saturday.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Division III Postseason Changes Create Long Wait Until Championship Game', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Division III Postseason Changes Create Long Wait Until Championship Game', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'College Athletics', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'May, Peter', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Collegiate Athletic Assn', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMHERST COLLEGE', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball (College)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-02T05:03:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'College Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter May', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'May', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3f8b1af1-7c1a-5db2-b933-55a7f754afb1', 'word_count': 966, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3f8b1af1-7c1a-5db2-b933-55a7f754afb1'}, {'abstract': 'In 1973, a man committed an unthinkable act against a Brooklyn boy named Josh Miele. Still haunted decades later, a neighbor searched for answers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/03/nyregion/40-years-after-an-acid-attack-a-life-well-lived.html', 'snippet': 'In 1973, a man committed an unthinkable act against a Brooklyn boy named Josh Miele. Still haunted decades later, a neighbor searched for answers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On an October afternoon 40 years ago, on a beautiful block in Park Slope, Brooklyn, a crime occurred in a split second that was as permanent as it was cruel. Grown-ups tried to make sense of it, even use it as a cautionary tale for their children, but in the end, many just put it out of their minds. How could they not? It was just too awful, its lessons too hard to fathom.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/03/nyregion/03MIELE1_SPAN/03MIELE1_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/03/nyregion/03MIELE1_SPAN/03MIELE1_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/03/nyregion/03MIELE1_SPAN/03MIELE1_SPAN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 679, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/03/nyregion/03MIELE1_SPAN/03MIELE1_SPAN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1358, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/03/nyregion/03MIELE1_SPAN/03MIELE1_SPAN-thumbSta