he executive director of VH1 Save the Music Foundation, which helps schools that are facing cuts in music education budgets, says fund-raising is a creative career.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MY family lived in a working-class neighborhood of West Philadelphia. My mother sent my older sister and me to Catholic school to escape the gangs in the local public schools. My father was a mechanic at the local Ford dealer, and he, my two older brothers and I would always talk about car magazines and the latest cars. Every Christmas I’d get a radio-controlled toy car. The year the Mustang came out, I got one with working lights. ', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/03/business/03-BOSS/03-BOSS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 571, 'width': 441, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/03/business/03-BOSS/03-BOSS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 571, 'width': 441, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/03/business/03-BOSS/03-BOSS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/03/business/03-BOSS/03-BOSS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/03/business/03-BOSS/03-BOSS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Bringing Music Back to School', 'kicker': 'The Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bringing Music Back to School', 'name': None, 'seo': None, '