lness and a government disability pension had allowed her to quit the last of a long series of secretarial jobs, most of them as a temp. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/03/arts/dog-SMITH-obit/dog-SMITH-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 390, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/03/arts/dog-SMITH-obit/dog-SMITH-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 390}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/03/arts/dog-SMITH-obit/dog-SMITH-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 665, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/03/arts/dog-SMITH-obit/dog-SMITH-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1330, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/03/arts/dog-SMITH-obit/dog-SMITH-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/03/arts/dog-SMITH-obit/dog-SMITH-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/03/arts/dog-SMITH-obit/dog-SMITH-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sylvia Smith, Memoirist of the Life Banal, Dies at 67', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sylvia Smith, 67, Memoirist of the Life Banal', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Smith, Sylvia (1945-2013)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vitello, Paul', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Writing and Writers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-03T01:09:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Books', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Vitello', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vitello', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/da163001-0845-5f19-be15-cbdc4ed6c59a', 'word_count': 1082, 'uri': 'nyt://article/da163001-0845-5f19-be15-cbdc4ed6c59a'}, {'abstract': 'The devastation from Hurricane Sandy, and the promise to rebuild, were inescapable during the Queens County St. Patrick’s Day Parade in the Rockaways on Saturday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/03/nyregion/evidence-of-hope-and-loss-during-a-parade-in-queens.html', 'snippet': 'The devastation from Hurricane Sandy, and the promise to rebuild, were inescapable during the Queens County St. Patrick’s Day Parade in the Rockaways on Saturday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There were the usual caps dotted with shamrocks; bunting in the green, white and orange of the Irish flag; and the nasal hum of bagpipes. While some of the bands marching in the Rockaways on Saturday were from schools that had been flooded out by Hurricane Sandy and some of the spectators watching from the sidewalks were still living in temporary quarters because their homes were either badly damaged or destroyed, the Queens County St. Patrick’s Day Parade seemed to make a special effort to hew to its nearly four decades of tradition. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 's