}, {'abstract': 'The baby, born in rural Mississippi, was treated aggressively with antiretroviral drugs starting around 30 hours after birth; if further study shows this treatment works, it will almost certainly be recommended globally.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/04/health/for-first-time-baby-cured-of-hiv-doctors-say.html', 'snippet': 'The baby, born in rural Mississippi, was treated aggressively with antiretroviral drugs starting around 30 hours after birth; if further study shows this treatment works, it will almost certainly be recommended globally.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Doctors announced on Sunday that a baby had been cured of an H.I.V. infection for the first time, a startling development that could change how infected newborns are treated and sharply reduce the number of children living with the virus that causes AIDS.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Medical First, a Baby With H.I.V. Is Deemed Cured', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Medical First, a Baby With H.I.V. Is Deemed Cured', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pollack, Andrew', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Babies and Infants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McNeil, Donald G Jr', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Acquired Immune Deficiency Syndrome', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Research', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'amfAR, The Foundation for AIDS Research', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gay, Hannah B', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Persaud, Deborah', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mississippi', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-03T22:20:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National'