ttps://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/04/arts/dance/san-francisco-ballets-works-by-mark-morris-and-ashley-page.html', 'snippet': 'San Francisco Ballet presents its commissions by Mark Morris, Ashley Page and Yuri Possokhov.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN FRANCISCO — When San Francisco Ballet celebrated its 75th anniversary in 2008, it had achieved the unusual feat of making its third quarter-century its most prestigious, the one that established it as a world-class company, with seasons on the East Coast and in Europe. This it owed to Helgi Tomasson, who became its artistic director in 1985. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/04/arts/BALLET/BALLET-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 349, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/04/arts/BALLET/BALLET-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 349}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/04/arts/BALLET/BALLET-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 595, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/04/arts/BALLET/BALLET-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1190, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/04/arts/BALLET/BALLET-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/04/arts/BALLET/BALLET-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/04/arts/BALLET/BALLET-thumbLarge