 of the finest 20th-century literary biographies on any subject.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/04/arts/joseph-frank-biographer-of-dostoevsky-dies-at-94.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Frank’s five-volume biography of Fyodor Dostoevsky is considered one of the finest 20th-century literary biographies on any subject.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Joseph Frank, whose magisterial, five-volume life of Fyodor Dostoevsky was frequently cited among the greatest of 20th-century literary biographies, alongside Richard Ellmann’s of James Joyce, Walter Jackson Bate’s of John Keats and Leon Edel’s of Henry James, died on Wednesday in Palo Alto, Calif. He was 94 and lived in Palo Alto.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/04/arts/frank-obit/frank-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 816, 'width': 564, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/04/arts/frank-obit/frank-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 816, 'width': 564, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/04/arts/frank-obit/frank-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/04/arts/frank-obit/frank-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/04/arts/frank-obit/frank-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Joseph Frank, Biographer of Dostoevsky, Dies at 94', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None