bron-james-and-the-heat-are-always-in-the-knicks-way.html', 'snippet': 'As long as LeBron James plays for the Miami Heat, the Knicks and their fans face an ultimately grim future.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are times — and Sunday had to be one of them — when the chilling realization must run through the Knicks, and all those emotionally tethered to them, that their Eastern Conference fate for another cluster of years was cruelly settled during the summer of 2010, when they thought they were in the game for LeBron James. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/04/sports/YJPARATON/YJPARATON-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 458, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/04/sports/YJPARATON/YJPARATON-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 458}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/04/sports/YJPARATON/YJPARATON-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 781, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/04/sports/YJPARATON/YJPARATON-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1343, 'width': 1761, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/04/sports/YJPARATON/YJPARATON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/04/sports/YJPARATON/YJPARATON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/04/sports/YJPARATON/YJPARATON-thumbLarge.jpg