ead_paragraph': 'NAIROBI, Kenya — Millions of Kenyans poured into polling stations on Monday to cast their ballots in a crucial, anxiously awaited presidential election, and as the voting proceeded relatively smoothly a real chance emerged that a candidate charged with crimes against humanity could win the race.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Kenyans Flood Polls for Presidential Vote', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Kenyans Flood Polls For Presidential Vote', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gettleman, Jeffrey', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kenya', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Odinga, Raila', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kenyatta, Uhuru Muigai', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ruto, William', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'War Crimes, Genocide and Crimes Against Humanity', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-04T08:38:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeffrey Gettleman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeffrey', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gettleman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e1118a57-95d6-57ba-bc90-cfbc16f70673', 'word_count': 1180, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e1118a57-95d6-57ba-bc90-cfbc16f70673'}, {'abstract': 'On Sotheby’s expansion plans in India and the growing art market.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/04/a-conversation-with-sothebys-lord-mark-poltimore/', 'snippet': 'On Sotheby’s expansion plans in India and the growing art market.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As a regular visitor to India, Lord Poltimore, deputy chairman of Sotheby’s Europe and chairman of Sotheby’s Russia, has had a ringside view of the changes that have taken place in the Indian art scene over the past two decades. Lord Poltimore has had a storied auction house career, including 23 years at Christie’s, where he rose to deputy chairman. He left Christie’s in 2000 to join an online auction startup called eAuctionRoom. At Sotheby’s, where he has spent a decade, Lord Poltimore led the company’s foray into Russia and is responsible for cultivating new markets like India.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/28/world/asia/28-Poltimore-Indiaink/28-Poltimore-Indiaink-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 616, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/02/28/world/asia/28-Poltimore-Indiaink/28-Poltimore-Indiaink-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 616}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/28/world/asia/28-Poltimore-Indiaink/28-Poltimore-Indiaink-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 998, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/28/world/asia/28-Poltimore-Indiaink/28-Poltimore-Indiaink-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1996, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/28/world/asia/28-Poltimore-Indiaink/28-Poltimore-Indiaink-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/02/28/world/asia/28-Poltimore-Indiaink/28-Poltimore-Indiaink-thumbStandard.jp