08a9d', 'word_count': 167, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b057f541-d10a-5d46-81e2-76e0ef108a9d'}, {'abstract': 'LeBron James and Patrick Kane delivered late-game heroics but a high school player made the most impressive shot of all.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/05/sports/weekend-of-the-shooting-stars-leading-off.html', 'snippet': 'LeBron James and Patrick Kane delivered late-game heroics but a high school player made the most impressive shot of all.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you spent the weekend looking for a sports highlight fix, you did not have to search hard. On Sunday alone the highlights came fast and furious and from many of the usual suspects. You could have chosen LeBron James breaking the Knicks’ hearts — although yes, that has happened enough times to qualify as a dramatic series — or the Blackhawks pulling another victory out of thin air. You had Danica Patrick slamming into a wall. You could have gone back and replayed Rory McIlroy hitting a proverbial wall as he melted down at the Honda Classic and walked off the course.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/05/sports/basketball/05leadingpic/05leadingpic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 813, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/05/sports/basketball/05leadingpic/05leadingpic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 813}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/05/sports/basketball/05leadingpic/05leadingpic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 756, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/05/sports/basketball/05leadingpic/05leadingpic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1511, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 's