 conclave to choose a new pope.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/04/video-of-cardinals-arriving-to-choose-benedicts-successor/', 'snippet': 'With all of the world’s cardinals not yet in Rome, a date is not expected to immediately be set on Monday for the start of the conclave to choose a new pope.', 'lead_paragraph': 'More than 100 cardinals from throughout the world arrived at Paul VI Hall in Rome on Monday to prepare for the conclave, the process used to select the successor to Pope Benedict XVI, who stepped down last week. Not all of the cardinals have yet arrived in Rome, officials said, so the date for the start of the conclave is not expected to immediately be set. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Video of Cardinals Arriving to Choose Benedict’s Successor', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cardinals (Roman Catholic Prelates)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Popes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Benedict XVI', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': "O'Brien, Keith Michael Patrick", 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Roman Catholic Church', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Rome (Italy)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-04T16:54:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Preston', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Preston', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/adcfb821-d2d6-522b-8e20-8583f03bfd14', 'word_count': 531, 'uri': 'nyt://article/adcfb821-d2d6-522b-8e20-8583f03bfd14'}, {'abstract': 'Warren E. Buffett announced on Monday that Douglas Kass, a hedge fund manager, would be added to the panel of analysts who question him and Berkshire’s vice chairman, Charles T. Munger, on stage during Berkshire Hathaway’s annual gathering in Omaha on May 4.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/03/04/buffett-picks-his-bear-for-annual-meeting/', 'snippet': 'Warren E. Buffett announced on Monday that Douglas Kass, a hedge fund manager, would be added to the panel of analysts who question him and Berkshire’s vice chairman, Charles T. Munger, on stage during Berkshire Hathaway’s annual gathering in Omah...', 'lead_paragraph': 'Warren E. Buffett has found his bear.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Buffett Picks His ‘Bear’ for Annual Meeting', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Buffett Picks His Bear for His Annual Meeting', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Buffett, Warren E', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Berkshire Hathaway Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Seabreeze Partners Management', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-04T16:54:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Lattman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lattman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6b3305fc-54dc-5a1f-9af1-3a18c9d670e7', 'word_count': 778, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6b3305fc-54dc-5a1f-9af1-3a18c9d670e7'}, {'abstract': 'Prime Minister Wen Jiabao delivered a sometimes gloomy assessment of the state of Chinese society in his final annual work report to the national legislature.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/05/world/asia/on-eve-of-chinas-party-congress-vows-of-change.html', 'snippet': 'Prime Minister Wen Jiabao delivered a sometimes gloomy assessment of the state of Chinese society in his final annual work report to the national legislature.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIJING — Prime Minister Wen Jiabao of China entered his final days in power on Tuesday with a warning that the nation remained troubled by divisions between the urban rich and rural poor and unbalanced economic growth, and he vowed that the government would continue building up its military, which received a 10.7 percent increase in spending for 2013.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'China’s Wen Warns of Inequality and Vows to Continue Military Buildup', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'China’s Wen Warns of Inequality and Vows to Continue Military Buildup', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "National People's Congress (China)", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Communist Party of China', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corruption (Institutional)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Air Pollution', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-04T16:57:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Jacobs and Chris Buckley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jacobs', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Chris', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Buckley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3cc7e331-c7f1-511f-96c5-ad7a5596ee1c', 'word_count': 1293, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3cc7e331-c7f1-511f-96c5-ad7a5596ee1c'}, {'abstract': 'The former minister, Akis Tsochatzopoulos, was sentenced to eight years in prison in the second high-profile corruption conviction in a week in Greece.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/05/world/europe/former-greek-defense-minister-convicted-in-corruption-case.html', 'snippet': 'The former minister, Akis Tsochatzopoulos, was sentenced to eight years in prison in the second high-profile corruption conviction in a week in Greece.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ATHENS — A former Greek defense minister, Akis Tsochatzopoulos, was convicted and sentenced on Monday to eight years in prison for concealing assets from the authorities. It was the second high-profile corruption conviction in a week in Greece, a country where prosecutions of senior political figures are very rare. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Former Greek Defense Minister Convicted in Corruption Case', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Greece: Former Minister Convicted of Hiding Assets', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tsochatzopoulos, Akis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kitsantonis, Niki', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Greece', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pasok (Panhellenic Socialist Movement)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corruption (Institutional)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-04T16:59:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Niki Kitsantonis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Niki', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kitsantonis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0866e697-549c-57e1-aaef-d3860326aba6', 'word_count': 248, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0866e697-549c-57e1-aaef-d3860326aba6'}, {'abstract': 'An entrepreneur has devised a gambling machine. Would you play?', 'web_url': 'https://wordplay.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/04/machine/', 'snippet': 'An entrepreneur has devised a gambling machine. Would you play?', 'lead_paragraph': 'This week’s puzzle was suggested by mathematician Nelson Blachman, who began his research and teaching career at the Underwater Sound Laboratory at Harvard University 70 years ago. Dr. Blachman continues to produce original mathematical research today, a feat of endurance made even more remarkable because of a quality rare among mathematicians: Dr. Blachman is blind.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/03/crosswords/Blachman/Blachman-jumbo.png', 'height': 320, 'width': 480, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/03/crosswords/Blachman/Blachman-superJumbo.png', 'height': 320, 'width': 480, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/03/crosswords/Blachman/Blachman-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/03/crosswords/Blachman/Blachman-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/03/crosswords/Blachman/Blachman-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Gambling Machine Puzzle', 'kicker': 'Wordplay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Creativity', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mathematics', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Puzzles', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Harvard University', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ljubljana (Slovenia)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-04T17:00:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gary Antonick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Antonick', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/facc49d3-c900-5792-a27c-c9d663cad10f', 'word_count': 1378, 'uri': 'nyt://article/facc49d3-c900-5792-a27c-c9d663cad10f'}, {'abstract': 'The cracked wheat product can lend a nutty flavor to a variety of dishes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/04/health/bulgur-spinach-and-tomato-casserole-recipes-for-health.html', 'snippet': 'The cracked wheat product can lend a nutty flavor to a variety of dishes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ana Sortun, a Cambridge-based chef who loves the cuisines of the Eastern Mediterranean and Turkey in particular, was doing a cooking demonstration recently at the Worlds of Healthy Flavors retreat at the Culinary Institute of America in Napa, Calif., a collaborative effort between the institute, the Harvard School of Public Health and the foodservice industry. As she filled chard leaves with a mix of bulgur, sautéed onions, hazelnuts, red pepper paste and dried mint she said: “I think bulgur should be the next quinoa.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/05/science/04recipehealth/04recipehealth-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/05/science/04recipehealth/04recipehealth-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/05/science/04recipehealth/04recipehealth-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/05/science/04recipehealth/04recipehealth-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/05/science/04recipehealth/04recipehealth-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/05/science/04recipehealth/04recipehealth-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/05/science/04recipehealth/04recipehealth-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For Flavor and Versatility, Add Bulgur', 'kicker': 'Recipes for Health', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name'