013/03/04/photos-of-the-moment-stella-mccartney-7/', 'snippet': 'Scenes from the Paris Fashion Week photo diary of Kasia Bobula.', 'lead_paragraph': 'var data;function jsonSlideshowCallback(response){data = response;}NYTD.options = {source: data,cropType: \'blog480\',appendTo: \'fullScreenSlideShow\',showHeadLine: \'false\', renderstyle: "embeddedSlideShowTmag"}', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Photos of The Moment | Stella McCartney', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-03-04T21:35:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kasia Bobula', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kasia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bobula', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b63bf8a3-2a69-545c-87c1-10805fb082f5', 'word_count': 34, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b63bf8a3-2a69-545c-87c1-10805fb082f5'}, {'abstract': 'In a new book, Justice Sandra Day O’Connor recounts the Supreme Court’s evolution from what seemed like a jerry-built enterprise.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/05/books/sandra-day-oconnors-out-of-order.html', 'snippet': 'In a new book, Justice Sandra Day O’Connor recounts the Supreme Court’s evolution from what seemed like a jerry-built enterprise.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sandra Day O’Connor or, as she likes to call herself, the Fwotsc — the First Woman on the Supreme Court — is the author of one wonderful book: “Lazy B,”  an evocative memoir about growing up among “old-time, long-suffering, good-natured cowboys” on a cattle ranch on the Arizona-New Mexico border. Written with her brother, H. Alan Day, that book not only did a magical job of conjuring an isolated and now vanishing world of big skies and wide-open plains, but it also underscored how the frontier values of her childhood — self-reliance, competence and dependability — shaped her pragmatic judicial philosophy.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/05/arts/BOOK/BOOK-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 915, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/05/arts/BOOK/BOOK-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 915}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/05/arts/BOOK/BOOK-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 672, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/05/arts/BOOK/BOOK-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1344, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/05/arts/BOOK/BOOK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/05/arts/BOOK/BOOK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/05/arts/BOOK/BOOK-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Bumpy Start for a Court Cloaked in Grandeur', 'kicker': 'Books of The Times', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bumpy Start For a Court Cloaked In Grandeur', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': "O'Connor, Sandra Day", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Court', 'r