Liberal Party Faces Inquiries Without End', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Working Families Party', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Powell, Michael K', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Campaign Finance', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Campaign Finance Board (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Donovan, Daniel M Jr', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'City Council (NYC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, City Councils', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-05T01:37:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Powell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Powell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5d548519-4a5f-52f7-98a5-6635c7a3ba6d', 'word_count': 738, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5d548519-4a5f-52f7-98a5-6635c7a3ba6d'}, {'abstract': 'After the prosecution offered grisly images into evidence, the defense lawyer for Officer Gilberto Valle argued to the judge that the government had failed to prove the officer’s guilt.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/05/nyregion/prosecution-rests-in-cannibalism-case-defense-asks-for-officers-acquittal.html', 'snippet': 'After the prosecution offered grisly images into evidence, the defense lawyer for Officer Gilberto Valle argued to the judge that the government had failed to prove the officer’s guilt.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After offering grisly images and revealing Internet searches into evidence, federal prosecutors in Manhattan rested their case on Monday in the trial of Gilberto Valle, the