any might have imagined for the Champions League final.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MANCHESTER, England — The white scarves of Real Madrid were everywhere Monday as Spanish fans buzzed around St. Peter’s Square. Latecomers looking for lodging, though, were out of luck; there was nary a room to be had in the city. And out near Old Trafford, a pair of drivers idling at a red light on Sir Matt Busby Way waved over two ticket scalpers before sending them back almost immediately after hearing the asking prices for tickets to the game everyone is talking about. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/05/sports/SOCCER/SOCCER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 397, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/05/sports/SOCCER/SOCCER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 397}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/05/sports/SOCCER/SOCCER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 678, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/05/sports/SOCCER/SOCCER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1355, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/05/sports/SOCCER/SOCCER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/05/sports/SOCCER/SOCCER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/05/sports/SOCCER/SOCCER-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height':