 continent of Africa as a whole?', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/05/millions-vote-in-kenya/', 'snippet': 'Why is this vote so important, for Kenya and for the continent of Africa as a whole?', 'lead_paragraph': 'In “Millions Vote in Crucial Kenyan Elections,” Jeffrey Gettleman reports from the polls there on Monday. Use the article and the video, above, to answer these questions:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Millions Vote in Kenya', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-03-05T09:42:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Katherine Schulten', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Katherine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schulten', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d256e8ef-4f8e-51b2-a410-39fff2a35443', 'word_count': 135, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d256e8ef-4f8e-51b2-a410-39fff2a35443'}, {'abstract': 'How the perception of an Indian about Pakistan changed while living in London.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/05/in-britain-the-enemy-was-just-like-me/', 'snippet': 'How the perception of an Indian about Pakistan changed while living in London.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Before coming to London, I had never met a Pakistani in my life.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/04/world/asia/4-London-IndiaInk/4-London-IndiaInk-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/04/world/asia/4-London-IndiaInk/4-London-IndiaInk-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 