 of absolutely no one with a Twitter feed, a new Pew study finds that tweeted reaction “to major political events and policy decisions often differs a great deal from public opinion as measured by surveys,” and reports that more than partisanship, it’s “the overall negativity” of Twitter reactions that really stand out. I could write a thumbsucking post about how this phenomenon probably influences our politics for the worse, by encouraging journalists — most of whom (myself included) now watch crucial moments of political theater with their fellow scribes’ snark scrolling in the background\xa0— to let their natural solipsism and their natural cynicism intertwine, and pretend that what they see on Twitter is the political world entire. But I think I can get at the same idea by talking about Anne Hathaway instead.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Who Really Hates Anne Hathaway?', 'kicker': 'Ross Douthat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-03-05T21:51:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ross Douthat', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ross', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Douthat', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/401d0655-0ed5-5b47-84d2-26d7fb3a1ba8', 'word_count': 606, 'uri': 'nyt://article/401d0655-0ed5-5b47-84d2-26d7fb3a1ba8'}, {'abstract': 'Simon Romero, The Times’s former Caracas bureau chief, reflects on the presidency of Hugo Chávez.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/world/americas/100000002006896/hugo-chavez-1954-2013.html', 'snippet': 'Simon Romero, The Times’s former Caracas bureau chief, reflects on the presidency of Hugo Chávez.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Simon Romero, The Times’s former Caracas bureau chief, reflects on the presidency of Hugo Chávez.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/03/06/world/americas/06chavez-video/06chavez-video-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 337, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2014/03/06/world/americas/06chavez-video/06chavez-video-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 337}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/03/06/world/americas/06chavez-video/06chavez-video-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/03/06/world/americas/06chavez-video/06chavez-video-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/03/06/world/americas/06chavez-video/06chavez-video-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/03/06/world/americas/06chavez-video/06chavez-video-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/03/06/world/americas/06chavez-video/06chavez-video-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Hugo Chávez, 1954-2013', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chavez, Hugo', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Venezuela', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-0