ed or dragged, the coroner said on Tuesday, challenging a statement from the victim’s family that the official said was misleading.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/06/us/CLARKSDALE-1/CLARKSDALE-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 860, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/06/us/CLARKSDALE-1/CLARKSDALE-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 860}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/06/us/CLARKSDALE-1/CLARKSDALE-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 715, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/06/us/CLARKSDALE-1/CLARKSDALE-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2020, 'width': 1409, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/06/us/CLARKSDALE-1/CLARKSDALE-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/06/us/CLARKSDALE-1/CLARKSDALE-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/06/us/CLARKSDALE-1/CLARKSDALE-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Coroner Disputes Family’s Account of Mississippi Mayoral Candidate’s Death', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Coroner Disputes Family’s Account of Mississippi Mayoral Candidate’s Death', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Mayors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Robbie', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Clarksdale (Miss)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Forensic Science', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McMillian, Marco', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mississippi', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-06T01:44:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Campbell Robertson and Robbie Brown', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Campbell', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Robertson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Robbie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Brown', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cc4563e3-edf7-5b58-bfaf-15b13a3906aa', 'word_count': 815, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cc4563e3-edf7-5b58-bfaf-15b13a3906aa'}, {'abstract': 'With the opening of baseball museums at several stadiums in the past decade or so, many teams have employees who work as historians and curators.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/06/sports/baseball/baseball-team-historians-are-fans-link-to-past.html', 'snippet': 'With the opening of baseball museums at several stadiums in the past decade or so, many teams have employees who work as historians and curators.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BOSTON — On a concourse behind third base at Fenway Park, silent but for the periodic whoosh of the frigid wind, Dan Rea recently approached a display case devoted to the 1930s-era Red Sox. A ledger inside the case was opened to a page where an accountant once entered players’ salaries.', 'print_se