State Senate voted 20 to 14 Tuesday to override Gov. Mike Beebe’s veto of a bill that would establish the country’s most stringent limits on abortion, banning the procedure after 12 weeks of pregnancy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The State Senate voted 20 to 14 Tuesday to override Gov. Mike Beebe’s veto of a bill that would establish the country’s most stringent limits on abortion, banning the procedure after 12 weeks of pregnancy. The governor and most legal experts said the measure would quickly be struck down by federal courts as unconstitutional. The Supreme Court has ruled that women have a right to an abortion up to when the fetus is viable outside the womb, generally around 24 weeks into pregnancy. The motion to override now passes to the House, where a vote is expected to be close. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Arkansas: Abortion Law Survives Veto', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | South', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Arkansas: Abortion Law Survives Veto', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ABORTION', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Eckholm, Erik', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Beebe, Mike', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ARKANSAS', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-06T02:06:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Erik Eckholm', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Erik', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Eckholm', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/34c6cdb8-4ff6-598e-87fa-a9747f8f4846', 'word_count': 100, 'uri': 'nyt://article/34c6cdb8-4ff6-598e-87fa-a9747f8f4846'}