 States Catholics is explained.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/06/us/how-the-new-york-times-cbs-news-poll-was-conducted.html', 'snippet': 'The methodology of the latest New York Times/CBS News poll of United States Catholics is explained.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The latest New York Times/CBS News poll is based on telephone interviews conducted Feb. 23 to 27 with 1,585 adults throughout the United States. Interviews were conducted in English and Spanish. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'How The New York Times/CBS News Poll Was Conducted', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'How the Poll Was Conducted', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Polls and Public Opinion', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Roman Catholic Church', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CBS News', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-06T03:54:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e87dc826-4c83-5b82-a335-eef9927b17ac', 'word_count': 443, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e87dc826-4c83-5b82-a335-eef9927b17ac'}, {'abstract': 'Wen Jiabao, in a break from the past, sent signals reaffirming the party’s heavy-handed approach to the nation’s political and economic affairs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/06/world/asia/chinas-wen-gives-final-speech-as-prime-minister.html', 'snippet': 'Wen Jiabao, in a break from the past, sent signals reaffirming the party’s heavy-handed approach to the nation’s political and economic affairs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIJING — Wen Jiabao, in his final address as China’s prime minister, warned on Tuesday of the