ist writes that her clothing line isn’t selling. In the Season 2 opener of “It’s a Brad, Brad World,” at 10, Brad Goreski, a former assistant to Ms. Zoe, styles looks for Kate Spade’s runway presentation while juggling clients like the actress Minka Kelly. And “Dukes of Melrose,” a new series at 10:30, follows Christos Garkinos and Cameron Silver, the owners of the Decades boutique in Los Angeles, as they raid closets and scour auctions for vintage couture.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s On Wednesday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s On Today', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-03-06T06:00:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kathryn Shattuck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kathryn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shattuck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/62d7e8ca-7386-5924-86d5-8df4abe0bb9a', 'word_count': 728, 'uri': 'nyt://article/62d7e8ca-7386-5924-86d5-8df4abe0bb9a'}, {'abstract': 'Hugo Chavez, the former Venezuelan leader, was a friend of China and oversaw large oil deals. A day after his death official media and the blogosphere discussed him.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/06/chavezs-death-may-challenge-china-a-friend/', 'snippet': 'Hugo Chavez, the former Venezuelan leader, was a friend of China and oversaw large oil deals. A day after his death official media and the blogosphere discussed him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIJING — Domestic politics trumps international politics, in China as everywhere. So even though China lost a friend in President Hugo Chávez of Venezuela, who died in Caracas on Tuesday, the homepage of the Xinhua News 