reakthroughs in terror-related crimes.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/06/indias-record-on-terror-attacks-holds-lessons-for-hyderabad-blasts-investigation/', 'snippet': 'Lack of political consensus on terror laws and poor conviction rates have resulted in fewer breakthroughs in terror-related crimes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW DELHI —A special court in Delhi on Tuesday issued arrest warrants for 10 members of the Indian Mujahideen, a banned terrorist organization, including its founder, Riyaz Bhatkal, in connection with the Feb. 21 Hyderabad blasts.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/06/world/asia/6-Terrorism-convictions-IndiaInk/6-Terrorism-convictions-IndiaInk-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/06/world/asia/6-Terrorism-convictions-IndiaInk/6-Terrorism-convictions-IndiaInk-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/06/world/asia/6-Terrorism-convictions-IndiaInk/6-Terrorism-convictions-IndiaInk-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/06/world/asia/6-Terrorism-convictions-IndiaInk/6-Terrorism-convictions-IndiaInk-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/06/world/asia/6-Terrorism-convictions-IndiaInk/6-Terrorism-convictions-IndiaInk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2