 Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Runoff Set in Race for Los Angeles Mayor', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Runoff Set in Race for Los Angeles Mayor', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Los Angeles (Calif)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mayors', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Garcetti, Eric', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Greuel, Wendy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-06T07:40:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Medina', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Medina', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3047c56b-0df5-55c0-8e6c-97cdb233dde5', 'word_count': 753, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3047c56b-0df5-55c0-8e6c-97cdb233dde5'}, {'abstract': 'Chávez is gone, but the aggressive rhetoric of the Venezuelan government is here to stay.', 'web_url': 'https://latitude.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/06/even-after-chavezs-death-the-venezuelan-government-will-hold-to-its-aggressive-line/', 'snippet': 'Chávez is gone, but the aggressive rhetoric of the Venezuelan government is here to stay.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MONTREAL — Hugo Chávez’s death, following a battle with cancer, has left Venezuela teetering on the edge. The relentlessly divisive leader left power in the hand of a dauphin, Nicolás Maduro, who is also wedded to the kind of aggressive rhetoric that was the cornerstone of his mentor’s government.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Dead But Alive', 'kicker': 'Latitude', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-03-06T08:18:47+0000', 'document_