, I’m packing it in. No more babies for us.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It seems like an instant ago, that sweltering summer I spent scouring Craigslist and tag sales, possessed by a frenzied, pre-baby urge to nest. I scooped up gently used Ergos and Bjorns — words that were foreign to a first-time mother’s tongue but promised parental salvation. Eventually, all the essential gear was acquired, along with a few items that in hindsight (yes, that would be you, wipes warmer) were anything but.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bye-Bye, Bumbo and Boppy (With Reservations)', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Babies and Infants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cribs (Baby Beds)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Toys', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-06T15:00:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melissa Schorr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melissa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schorr', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1e7fe03a-4f06-5acd-aa6b-cf925751b711', 'word_count': 714, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1e7fe03a-4f06-5acd-aa6b-cf925751b711'}, {'abstract': 'After a career of five decades, Mr. Bowie has a new album.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2013/03/10/arts/music/20130310-bowie.html', 'snippet': 'After a career of five decades, Mr. Bowie has a new album.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After a career of five decades, Mr. Bowie has a new album.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/