 'pub_date': '2013-03-06T16:52:18+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Fashion & Style', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': "Women's Runway", 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/2a0b7640-37a4-5564-93a2-d305f1c3ed33', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/2a0b7640-37a4-5564-93a2-d305f1c3ed33'}, {'abstract': 'A lawsuit over Bank of America’s mortgage portfolio could cost the bank tens of billions more than it had planned, prompting critics to say the bank had not set aside enough for a settlement.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/03/06/with-legal-reserves-low-bank-of-america-faces-a-big-lawsuit/', 'snippet': 'A lawsuit over Bank of America’s mortgage portfolio could cost the bank tens of billions more than it had planned, prompting critics to say the bank had not set aside enough for a settlement.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bank of America has been underestimating its legal risks for years, and brazenly so, according to its critics. Is that strategy about to pay off with the Federal Reserve?', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'With Legal Reserves Low, Bank of America Faces a Big Lawsuit', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bank of America Faces a Big Lawsuit With Low Legal Reserves', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mortgage-Backed Securities', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bank of America Corporation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Reserve System', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-06T17:00:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jesse Eisinger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jesse', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Eisinger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6d25aaae-1e61-5182-9fed-6d7980b81eb3', 'word_count': 1194, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6d25aaae-1e61-5182-9fed-6d7980b81eb3'}, {'abstract': 'In a letter of condolence to the people of Venezuela, Iran’s president struck a note of interfaith harmony, expressing confidence that Hugo Chávez would be resurrected, along with Jesus and the Hidden Imam.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/06/ahmadinejad-says-chavez-will-rise-again/', 'snippet': 'In a letter of condolence to the people of Venezuela, Iran’s president struck a note of interfaith harmony, expressing confidence that Hugo Chávez would be resurrected, along with Jesus and the Hidden Imam.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last Updated, 3:44 p.m. In a letter of condolence to the people of Venezuela, Iran’s president, Mahmoud Ahmadinejad, struck a note of interfaith harmony on Wednesday, expressing confidence that the late Hugo Chávez would eventually be resurrected, along with Jesus and the Hidden Imam, a messianic figure in Shiite Islam.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ahmadinejad Says Chávez Will Rise Again', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'AHMADINEJAD, MAHMOUD', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chavez, Hugo', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Venezuela', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-06T17:01:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Mackey and Thomas Erdbrink', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mackey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Erdbrink', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7530d6b5-1ff9-5fb6-b2d9-cd956939872e', 'word_count': 569, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7530d6b5-1ff9-5fb6-b2d9-cd956939872e'}, {'abstract': 'Scenes from the Paris Fashion Week photo diary of Schohaja.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/06/photos-of-the-moment-chanel-9/', 'snippet': 'Scenes from the Paris Fashion Week photo diary of Schohaja.', 'lead_paragraph': 'var data;function jsonSlideshowCallback(response){data = response;}NYTD.options = {source: data,cropType: \'blog480\',appendTo: \'fullScreenSlideShow\',showHeadLine: \'false\', renderstyle: "embeddedSlideShowTmag"}', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Photos of The Moment | Chanel', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Paris Fashion Week', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chanel SA', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-06T17:03:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Schohaja', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Schohaja', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6618e6c8-2a24-54e4-8685-88b27a0da4cd', 'word_count': 33, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6618e6c8-2a24-54e4-8685-88b27a0da4cd'}, {'abstract': 'President Obama will host a group of Senate Republicans on Wednesday for a dinner to discuss the federal debt.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/06/for-obama-and-senate-republicans-an-opportunity-to-dine-and-deal/', 'snippet': 'President Obama will host a group of Senate Republicans on Wednesday for a dinner to discuss the federal debt.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As President Obama ratchets up his outreach effort to Congressional Republicans on Wednesday with a dinner date at the Jefferson Hotel, his guests will include some of his fiercest critics in the Senate, some conciliators and some lawmakers who hardly have made a ripple in the public debate over how to tackle the federal debt.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For Obama and Senate Republicans, an Opportunity to Dine and Deal', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-03-06T17:06:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jonathan Weisman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jonathan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weisman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ee74bcbc-3ec4-5e7b-8101-a7b594399cb6', 'word_count': 357, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ee74bcbc-3ec4-5e7b-8101-a7b594399cb6'}, {'abstract': 'A look at schools where design and teaching focus on energy and the environment.', 'web_url': 'https://dotearth.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/06/schools-and-syllabuses-designed-with-the-environment-in-mind/', 'snippet': 'A look at schools where design and teaching focus on energy and the environment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Schools can play an important role in fostering environmental and energy awareness not only through how they teach, but also their physical structures and grounds. I’ve been getting familiar with the remarkable, and growing, range of “green school” designs and initiatives around the country. Here’s an initial survey, spurred in part by invaluable input from Veronique Choa Pittman of the Green Schools Alliance and from my visit last week to the engaging new Green Schools exhibition at the National Building Museum in Washington. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/06/blogs/dotkiowa/dotkiowa-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 381, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/06/blogs/dotkiowa/dotkiowa-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 381}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/06/blogs/dotkiowa/dotkiowa-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 444, 'width': 700, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/06/blogs/dotkiowa/dotkiowa-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 444, 'width': 700, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/06/blogs/dotkiowa/dotkiowa-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/06/blogs/dotkiowa/dotkiowa-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/06/blogs/dotkiowa/dotkiowa-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Schools, and Syllabuses, Designed With the Environment in Mind', 'kicker': 'Dot Earth', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None,