 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hotels and Travel Lodgings', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Istanbul (Turkey)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Turkey', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-06T17:30:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Seth Sherwood', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Seth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sherwood', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d0cf9a9d-56c2-561d-b0c8-fbf072752d9d', 'word_count': 532, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d0cf9a9d-56c2-561d-b0c8-fbf072752d9d'}, {'abstract': 'At this small, highly touted spot near Mendoza, modern meals are paired with gentle prices.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/10/travel/restaurant-report-brindillas-in-vistalba-argentina.html', 'snippet': 'At this small, highly touted spot near Mendoza, modern meals are paired with gentle prices.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In Argentina, the peso is written with a dollar sign. So when we were presented with the menus at Brindillas, an unassuming but highly touted little restaurant about 20 minutes from downtown Mendoza, and saw a five-course tasting menu for what looked like $135, or seven courses for $175, we felt ambushed but undaunted. But after our meal — which cost about $100 (that’s U.S. dollars) for two, wine included — we were pleasantly surprised, a feeling enhanced by food that had a sophisticated, modernist outlook that went well beyond the borders of Argentina.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/travel/10BITES/10BITES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/10/travel/10BITES/10BITES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/travel/10BITES/10BITES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/travel/10BITES/10BITES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/travel/10BITES/10BITES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/10/travel/10BITES/10BITES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/travel/10BITES/10BITES-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Restaurant Report: Brindillas in Vistalba, Argentina', 'kicker': 'Bites ', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Mendoza, a Global Outlook', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mendoza (Argentina)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ARGENTINA', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-06T17:30:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person':