ity fashion mavens to his elegant London store.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/07/fashion/vintage-king-mines-the-past.html', 'snippet': 'William Banks-Blaney is increasingly becoming a bulwark in the field of vintage couture, drawing celebrity fashion mavens to his elegant London store.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Extraordinary dresses have a way of finding William Banks-Blaney. Dresses like the mint condition 1970s Ossie Clark he discovered, along with a floor-length, silk velvet Art Deco cape, in “a random little store on Waiheke Island, off the coast of Auckland, New Zealand, when I was there for Christmas last year,” he said recently, sipping a cappuccino in the lobby of the Maritime hotel in Manhattan. “You just never know where a dress will travel to.”', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/07/fashion/07VINTAGE_SPAN/07ZVINTAGE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/07/fashion/07VINTAGE_SPAN/07ZVINTAGE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/07/fashion/07VINTAGE_SPAN/07ZVINTAGE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/07/fashion/07VINTAGE_SPAN/07ZVINTAGE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/07/fashion/07VINTAGE_SPAN/07ZVINTAGE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legac