3/07/arts/music/jon-gillock-plays-messiaen-at-church-of-the-ascension.html', 'snippet': 'Jon Gillock, organist and student of Messiaen, played his teacher’s work on Tuesday at the Church of the Ascension.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two estimable figures have hovered over the Manton Memorial Organ at the Church of the Ascension in Greenwich Village since that tremendous instrument was inaugurated in May 2011. One is Olivier Messiaen, the visionary 20th-century Frenchman who made the organ a staple of his life’s work as a composer and performer. The other is Jon Gillock, a superb organist born in Oklahoma and based in France who played Messiaen and more to christen the Ascension organ in 2011.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sacrament, With Birds', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sacrament, With Birds', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gillock, Jon', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-06T23:06:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steve Smith', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steve', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Smith', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/05d7cdab-1e33-5731-9708-9c40ab88f0a1', 'word_count': 398, 'uri': 'nyt://article/05d7cdab-1e33-5731-9708-9c40ab88f0a1'}, {'abstract': 'A look at the day in sports from spring training camp and World Baseball Classic games to the Iditarod Trail Sled Dog Race.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2013/03/06/sports/20130306photoreplay.html', 'snippet': 'A look at the day in sports from spring training camp and World Baseball Classic games to the Idit