-106c234dcdc6', 'word_count': 1112, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0a3ded0e-2fcc-520c-b2d8-106c234dcdc6'}, {'abstract': 'A desk that can act as a writing or computing surface, a storage ledge or a hat rack.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/07/garden/the-versatile-appunto-desk.html', 'snippet': 'A desk that can act as a writing or computing surface, a storage ledge or a hat rack.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With Appunto, the Belgian-born designer Laurent Corio has created a versatile piece of furniture for small spaces. His modern escritoire for the French company Eno works as a writing or computing desk: the surface measures 19 by 24 inches to support a laptop. It can also do duty as a ledge for storing items in a kitchen, bathroom, children’s room or foyer. When Appunto is closed, its solid beech legs serve as a place to hang shopping bags, scarves or backpacks, and its reverse side, which is washable, also functions as a message board.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/07/garden/07FURNITURE_SPAN/07FURNITURE_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/07/garden/07FURNITURE_SPAN/07FURNITURE_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/07/garden/07FURNITURE_SPAN/07FURNITURE_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/07/garden/07FURNITURE_SPAN/07FURNITURE_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, '