'section_name': 'Home & Garden', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephen Milioti', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Milioti', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b60928e4-e7d8-5c85-a8af-d11b96207258', 'word_count': 146, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b60928e4-e7d8-5c85-a8af-d11b96207258'}, {'abstract': 'In short brown wigs that looked slept-in, models appeared to play the role of a woman in love, or lust.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/06/the-daily-do-louis-vuitton/', 'snippet': 'In short brown wigs that looked slept-in, models appeared to play the role of a woman in love, or lust.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At Louis Vuitton today, Marc Jacobs sent his boudoir-clad ladies out from hotel room doors at the start of the runway. In short, brown Clara Bow-inspired wigs that looked slept-in, the models all appeared to play the same role of a woman in love, or lust.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Daily Do | Louis Vuitton', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Models (Professional)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wigs', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jacobs, Marc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vuitton, Louis', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-06T23:30:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Malina Joseph Gilchrist', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Malina', 'middlename': 'Joseph', 'lastname': 'Gilchrist', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4b23ef44-79a8-5ac6-af83-297acfd23cec', 'word_count': 46, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4b23ef44-79a8-5ac6-af83-297acfd23cec'}, {'abstract': 'Sales on furniture and accessories at Property Furniture and Kartell. Discounts on chairs, sofas, storage systems and more.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/07/garden/discounts-on-chairs-sofas-storage-systems-and-more-currents.html', 'snippet': 'Sales on furniture and accessories at Property Furniture and Kartell. Discounts on chairs, sofas, storage systems and more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'During Property’s sale from Friday through March 23, some furniture and accessories will be up to 60 percent off, and most new orders will be 20 percent off (the Cubica leather lounge chair by Lievore Altherr Molina, which was originally $4,560, will be $1,800; the Booknest pullout sofa by Carlo Colombo, originally $11,070, will be $5,500); 14 Wooster Street (Grand Street), (917) 237-0123, propertyfurniture.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/07/garden/07DEALS_SPAN/07CURR5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 233, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/07/garden/07DEALS_SPAN/07CURR5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 233}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/07/garden/07DEALS_SPAN/07CURR5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 397, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/07/garden/07DEALS_SPAN/07CURR5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 397, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/07/garden/07DEALS_SPAN/07