uri': 'nyt://slideshow/0827cdab-ab9a-577b-9eb2-70f464b7e0d0'}, {'abstract': 'The artist Neil Jenney, long under the art world’s radar, is the subject of a new show, “Works of the Jenney Archive,” at Gagosian’s Madison Avenue gallery.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/10/arts/design/neil-jenney-has-a-rare-art-show-at-gagosian-gallery.html', 'snippet': 'The artist Neil Jenney, long under the art world’s radar, is the subject of a new show, “Works of the Jenney Archive,” at Gagosian’s Madison Avenue gallery.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The art world has always laid claim to its share of oddballs and mavericks, including those who pose as such. True-blue originals, however — people who follow their own lights, make their own rules and essentially create their own frame of reference — are as rare in this context as any other. One of the few contemporary artists in this latter category, for better and worse, is Neil Jenney.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/arts/10JENNEY_SPAN/10JENNEY_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/10/arts/10JENNEY_SPAN/10JENNEY_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/arts/10JENNEY_SPAN/10JENNEY_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/arts/10JENNEY_SPAN/10JENNEY_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1314, 'width': 1972, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'i