thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2008/02/04/sports/05knight_slide75.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Bob Knight:  A Look Back', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Knight, Bob', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'College Athletics', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-07T22:24:31+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Slideshow', '_id': 'nyt://slideshow/75f707c6-d6dc-5756-bd25-2dcece0d59a4', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://slideshow/75f707c6-d6dc-5756-bd25-2dcece0d59a4'}, {'abstract': 'In “Emperor,” Tommy Lee Jones plays Gen. Douglas MacArthur during the American occupation of Japan that followed World War II.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/08/movies/emperor-starring-tommy-lee-jones-as-gen-douglas-macarthur.html', 'snippet': 'In “Emperor,” Tommy Lee Jones plays Gen. Douglas MacArthur during the American occupation of Japan that followed World War II.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Aggrieved and exasperated: that is the signature expression of Tommy Lee Jones, a star who often conveys an attitude of terminal impatience, as if coping with the fools around him were almost more than he could bear. That gruff demeanor suits his character, Gen. Douglas MacArthur, in “Emperor,” the British director Peter Webber’s stolid, simplified history lesson about the delicate relationship between the United States and Japan just after World War II. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/08/arts/08EMPEROR_SPAN/EMPEROR-articleLarg