, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f38eb1d9-3e0b-5f83-a902-8c7348d0349e'}, {'abstract': 'The destroyed vehicle played a crucial part in the history of plug-in electric vehicles. The cause of the fire was unknown.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/07/fire-destroys-a-pioneering-plug-in-prius-conversion/', 'snippet': 'The destroyed vehicle played a crucial part in the history of plug-in electric vehicles. The cause of the fire was unknown.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A 2004 Toyota Prius that had been converted to run on grid-supplied electricity caught fire at 6:30 p.m. Tuesday night in Corte Madera, Calif., according to The Marin Independent Journal and other Bay Area news outlets. Nobody was hurt, but the fire killed a cat and caused about $250,000 worth of damage to the owner’s condominium.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Fire Destroys a Pioneering Plug-In Prius Conversion', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Electric and Hybrid Vehicles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fires and Firefighters', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fuel Efficiency', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'California Institute of Technology', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Toyota Motor Corporation', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-07T23:00:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bradley Berman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bradley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Berman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/93b22b4d-bd68-58e9-a65d-47b8ba86ddb8', 'word_cou