91d-1aa2-5707-a2f9-bc7e0c1faffb'}, {'abstract': 'Jason Marsalis and his band played a set at Dizzy’s Club Coca-Cola that was slow and fast, and fanciful and serious, yet kind of severe in form and affect.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/08/arts/music/jason-marsalis-vibes-quartet-at-dizzys-club-coca-cola.html', 'snippet': 'Jason Marsalis and his band played a set at Dizzy’s Club Coca-Cola that was slow and fast, and fanciful and serious, yet kind of severe in form and affect.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For most of Jason Marsalis’s playing life he’s been a drummer, and a rare one. His playing is eccentric within graceful boundaries, concerned with polyrhythm as science, history and gamesmanship, full of technique used to nonslick ends. It also often feels as if his work has an objective detachment. It’s about music as much as of it.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/08/arts/08DIZZY_SPAN/DIZZY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/08/arts/08DIZZY_SPAN/DIZZY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/08/arts/08DIZZY_SPAN/DIZZY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/08/arts/08DIZZY_SPAN/DIZZY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/08/arts/08DIZZY_SPAN/DIZZY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name':