', '_id': 'nyt://article/238cbfda-0b47-5a8f-8126-750e110744c5', 'word_count': 521, 'uri': 'nyt://article/238cbfda-0b47-5a8f-8126-750e110744c5'}, {'abstract': 'The Bay-Gull Store in Broad Channel, Queens, had to rebuild after Hurricane Sandy, but with its cheese bagels, it became a source of comfort to residents surviving on canned soup.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/10/nyregion/at-the-bay-gull-store-serving-solace-one-bagel-at-a-time.html', 'snippet': 'The Bay-Gull Store in Broad Channel, Queens, had to rebuild after Hurricane Sandy, but with its cheese bagels, it became a source of comfort to residents surviving on canned soup.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Broad Channel is a marshy sliver of land nestled between mainland Queens and the Rockaways, a roughly 20-block string of one- and two-story houses often circled by white picket fences. People here drop their Rs when they speak about their mothas, their brothas, their neighbas. They are police officers and firefighters, often of Irish descent.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/nyregion/10JOINT1_SPAN/10JOINT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/10/nyregion/10JOINT1_SPAN/10JOINT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/nyregion/10JOINT1_SPAN/10JOINT1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/nyregion/10JOINT1_SPAN/10JOINT1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subt