https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/08/pageoneplus/quotation-of-the-day-for-friday-mar-8-2013.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the day for Friday, Mar. 8, 2013.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Politics really understands a couple of things — votes and dollars. My father always used to tell me, ‘No peso, no say-so.’”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day for Friday, Mar. 8, 2013', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quotation of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-03-08T02:44:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/511c2ac7-89f8-5078-999e-3cf3f36d4008', 'word_count': 41, 'uri': 'nyt://article/511c2ac7-89f8-5078-999e-3cf3f36d4008'}, {'abstract': 'The bears are threatened by the melting of Arctic ice, and although a global conference failed to protect them, they did get some judicial help in an American court.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/08/opinion/polar-bears-go-to-court.html', 'snippet': 'The bears are threatened by the melting of Arctic ice, and although a global conference failed to protect them, they did get some judicial help in an American court.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The polar bear, whose long-term survival is threatened by the loss of Arctic sea ice because of global warming, got a welcome judicial assist this month, but a broader effort to protect it suffered defeat at an international conference on trade in endangered wildlife on Thursday. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Polar Bears Go to Court', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Polar Bears Go to Court', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{