on-decision.html', 'snippet': 'The board of trustees met with the expectation of making a decision on whether to end the college’s policy on free tuition for undergraduates, but left saying they are still reviewing options.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Students, faculty and alumni of the Cooper Union for the Advancement of Science and Art eager to learn the fate of the college’s distinctive no-tuition policy have been told to wait, again.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Cooper Union Board Delays Tuition Decision', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Cooper Union Board Delays Tuition Decision', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cooper Union for the Advancement of Science and Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kaminer, Ariel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tuition', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-08T03:20:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ariel Kaminer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ariel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kaminer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/34b1099a-d37e-5691-a51e-5ef373bb3c6a', 'word_count': 351, 'uri': 'nyt://article/34b1099a-d37e-5691-a51e-5ef373bb3c6a'}, {'abstract': 'Mrs. Cahn suggested the design for what became the first successful bag for Coach, the company she helped found: a tote modeled on a type of paper shopping bag she had used as a girl.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/08/business/lillian-cahn-creator-of-the-coach-handbag-dies-at-89.html', 'snippet': 'Mrs. Cahn suggested the design for what became the first successful bag for Coach, the company she helped found: a tote modeled on a type of paper shopping bag she had used as a girl.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Lillian Cahn, who founded the Coach Leatherware Company in a Manhattan loft in 1961 with her husband, Miles, and went on to help produce the “shopping bag” tote and other handbags that have become ubiquitous accessories in the wardrobes of well-heeled American women, died on Monday in Manhattan. She was 89.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/09/us/CAHN/CAHN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 639, 'width': 460, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/09/us/CAHN/CAHN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 639, 'width': 460, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/09/us/CAHN/CAHN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/09/us/CAHN/CAHN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Lillian Cahn, Creator of the Coach Handbag, Dies at 89', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lillian Cahn, 89, Creator of Coach Handbag', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vitello, Paul', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cahn, Lillian (1923-2013)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Coach Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Handbags and Purses', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-08