 on July 16 and was forced to have season-ending surgery. The Yankees can only hope that is not the path that Mark Teixeira will follow.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/08/sports/baseball/yankees-hope-mark-teixeiras-wrist-heals-faster-than-others.html', 'snippet': 'Jose Bautista injured his wrist on July 16 and was forced to have season-ending surgery. The Yankees can only hope that is not the path that Mark Teixeira will follow.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JUPITER, Fla. — When Jose Bautista took the fateful swing that injured his left wrist on July 16, the Yankees’ hitting instructor, Kevin Long, winced along with Bautista from inside the dugout and told Yankees Manager Joe Girardi that Bautista would require surgery.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/08/sports/yYANKEES/yYANKEES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 405, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/08/sports/yYANKEES/yYANKEES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 405}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/08/sports/yYANKEES/yYANKEES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 692, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/08/sports/yYANKEES/yYANKEES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1383, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/08/sports/yYANKEES/yYANKEES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/08/sports/yYANKEES/yYANKEES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'th