ith a new coach, and the Saints with a familiar one in Sean Payton, following his bounty-induced suspension.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'N.F.C. Free Agency Preview', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Hunt Is About to Begin', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Draft and Recruitment (Sports)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Free Agents (Sports)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Atlanta Falcons', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New Orleans Saints', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Philadelphia Eagles', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'San Francisco 49ers', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-08T04:56:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Judy Battista', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Judy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Battista', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6fc3585e-4b4d-57a5-9d4d-c64c5a3406ba', 'word_count': 1364, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6fc3585e-4b4d-57a5-9d4d-c64c5a3406ba'}, {'abstract': 'Preservation groups say some of the buildings, which are for sale or being considered for sale, are architecturally significant and that their design elements and historic features should be protected.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2013/03/07/arts/design/postal-service-looks-to-sell-historic-buildings.html', 'snippet': 'Preservation groups say some of the buildings, which are for sale or being considered for sale, are architecturally significant and that their design elements and historic features should be protected.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Preservation groups say some of the buildings, which are for sale or being considered for sale, are architecturally significant and that their design elements and historic features should be protected.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Postal Service Looks to Sell Historic Buildings', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Historic Buildings and Sites', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Postal Service (US)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-08T04:59:08+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Arts', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/9d1bc2e0-be23-5008-9729-c396c832241e', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/9d1bc2e0-be23-5008-9729-c396c832241e'}, {'abstract': 'Preservationists are fighting what they consider shortsighted decisions to sell architecturally distinctive post office buildings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/08/arts/design/preservationists-fight-postal-service-over-sales.html', 'snippet': 'Preservationists are fighting what they consider shortsighted decisions to sell architecturally distinctive post office buildings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SANTA MONICA, Calif. — The lines are often long inside the Art Deco post office here under the palm trees. But few people complain these days when they visit that New Deal-era building. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/08/arts/08POSTOFFICEjp1/08POSTOFFICEjp1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height'