Hollywood’s men of the moment kicks back with T.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/08/t-magazine/good-morning-matthias-schoenaerts.html', 'snippet': 'With a string of movies on the docket, one of Hollywood’s men of the moment kicks back with T.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After a breakout performance in ‘Rust and Bone,’ Hollywood is waking up to the raw magnetism of this Belgian import.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Good Morning, Matthias Schoenaerts', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-03-08T05:00:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TDesign', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tim Murphy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Murphy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f1909045-8cf0-57b2-a4f6-8f0b034dfb1f', 'word_count': 785, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f1909045-8cf0-57b2-a4f6-8f0b034dfb1f'}, {'abstract': 'Nilanjana Roy shares a personal tale of abuse to make a point “about the importance of consent” in the present debate over women’s rights in India.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/08/nilanjana-roy-breaks-the-silence-on-her-sexual-abuse/', 'snippet': 'Nilanjana Roy shares a personal tale of abuse to make a point “about the importance of consent” in the present debate over women’s rights in India.', 'lead_paragraph': '“The man who was my abuser was a fine host, a good husband, a caring father, a respected elder whose generosity and kindness were as genuine as the fact of the abuse,” Nilanjana S. Roy wrote in The Opinion Pages. “These qualities were important, because they helped him conceal the abuse he carried out over a period of four years.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main