d interesting.', 'web_url': 'https://gadgetwise.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/08/app-smart-extra-unusual-weather-apps/', 'snippet': 'Reviewing some weather apps designed to be attractive and interesting.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This week in App Smart, I wrote about a rather unusual class: Weather prediction apps designed to be simple or beautiful, and almost the antithesis of a brash TV weather report. Unlike watching a weather report on TV or reading one in a paper, an app of this type places interactive weather data in your hands, and can even make learning about coming rain or windstorms a very interesting experience.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'App Smart Extra: Unusual Weather Apps', 'kicker': 'Gadgetwise', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-03-08T06:15:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kit Eaton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kit', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Eaton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f1d87421-8c9f-53b0-b1fa-ebbb9bfaa6ef', 'word_count': 560, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f1d87421-8c9f-53b0-b1fa-ebbb9bfaa6ef'}, {'abstract': 'See what you know about the news of the day.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/08/news-quiz-march-8-2013/', 'snippet': 'See what you know about the news of the day.', 'lead_paragraph': 'See what you know about the news below. To prepare, you might scan the articles or summaries on today’s paper. Good luck!', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'News Quiz | March 8, 2013', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date'