 the familiar buzz. It was always Milani. “What are you doing now?”', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '36', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/magazine/frampton_superduped-slide-4QFT/frampton_superduped-slide-4QFT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 518, 'width': 290, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/magazine/frampton_superduped-slide-4QFT/frampton_superduped-slide-4QFT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 518, 'width': 290, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/magazine/frampton_superduped-slide-4QFT/frampton_superduped-slide-4QFT-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/10/magazine/frampton_superduped-slide-4QFT/frampton_superduped-slide-4QFT-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/magazine/frampton_superduped-slide-4QFT/frampton_superduped-slide-4QFT-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Professor, the Bikini Model and the Suitcase Full of Trouble', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Super-Duped', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Swann, Maxine', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drug Abuse and Traffic', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Frauds and Swindling', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Frampton, Paul',