By Amy Chozick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Amy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Chozick', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fc931e63-60a2-5c2b-924f-3fdcf9a99af2', 'word_count': 509, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fc931e63-60a2-5c2b-924f-3fdcf9a99af2'}, {'abstract': 'Opening in a new country presents an opportunity for growth and revenue, but it is also an opportunity to lose ours shirts.', 'web_url': 'https://boss.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/08/the-risks-of-expanding-into-australia/', 'snippet': 'Opening in a new country presents an opportunity for growth and revenue, but it is also an opportunity to lose ours shirts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 2012, TerraCycle had $15 million in sales with operations in 22 countries, primarily in North and South America as well as in Europe and a little bit of the Middle East. A few months ago, we embarked on opening in our 23rd market, Australia.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Risks of Expanding Into Australia', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recycling of Waste Materials', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'TerraCycle', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Australia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-08T14:38:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tom Szaky', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tom', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Szaky', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f3ff21ac-1a62-534f-8b9e-0be7a902c454', 'word_count': 1148, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f3ff21ac-1a62-534f-8b9e-0be7a902c454'}, {'abstract': 'It’s not enough to retire. Now players like Mariano Rivera are announcing that they will announce that they will retire.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/09/sports/riveras-goodbye-tour-leading-off.html', 'snippet': 'It’s not enough to retire. Now players like Mariano Rivera are announcing that they will announce that they will retire.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It seems we have entered a new era in athlete retirements. It has suddenly become boring to have a news conference to say your career is finished. No, now the in thing is to have a news conference to announce the impending retirement. Or even more humorously, “leak” to the news media that you are having a news conference on Saturday to announce your retirement after the season, as the Yankees’ Mariano Rivera has.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/09/sports/09leading1/09leading1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 783, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/09/sports/09leading1/09leading1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 783}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/09/sports/09leading1/09leading1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 785, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/09/sports/09leading1/09leading1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2000, 'width': 1532, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/09/sports/09leading1/09leading1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, '