ork nightspots.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/10/arts/music/gotham-chamber-operas-eliogabalo-is-at-home-in-the-box.html', 'snippet': 'Gotham Chamber Opera’s production of Francesco Cavalli’s 1667 opera “Eliogabalo,” about the most flamboyant of Roman emperors, is being staged inside the most flamboyant of New York nightspots.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Heliogabalus was a third-century teenage Roman emperor who dressed in women’s clothes and prostituted himself in the imperial palace, appointed an all-female senate and put a dancer in charge of the praetorian guard. According to the historian Lampridius, he traveled with 600 chariots “full of his male prostitutes, bawds, harlots and lusty partners in depravity” and referred to one blond charioteer, Hierocles, as his husband. He also married and divorced five women. When he was 18 and had ruled for nearly four years, he was murdered by his own guard.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/arts/10ELIO1_SPAN/10ELIO1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/10/arts/10ELIO1_SPAN/10ELIO1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/arts/10ELIO1_SPAN/10ELIO1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/arts/10ELIO1_SPAN/10ELIO1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/arts/10ELIO1_SPAN/10ELIO1-t