{'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/c4469d06-64a7-5d0c-b239-2a6a0319db81', 'word_count': 909, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c4469d06-64a7-5d0c-b239-2a6a0319db81'}, {'abstract': 'The director on naked cavorting in Florida and why he wants to be Clint Eastwood.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/10/magazine/harmony-korines-spring-break-intentions-are-pure.html', 'snippet': 'The director on naked cavorting in Florida and why he wants to be Clint Eastwood.', 'lead_paragraph': ' You actually used real spring breakers in your new film, “Spring Breakers,” about a group of young women who commit armed robbery, do drugs and get into trouble. Did you feel like it was wrong to be filming these people half your age, cavorting naked?  I never really feel wrong while making movies. I know myself and I know that my intentions are pure and I’m on the side of righteousness.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/magazine/10talk/10talk-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 420, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/magazine/10talk/10talk-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1267, 'width': 519, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/magazine/10talk/10talk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/10/magazine/10talk/10talk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/mag