}, {'abstract': 'It’s difficult to make marriage in the movies interesting, Jeanine Basinger’s survey argues.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/10/books/review/i-do-and-i-dont-by-jeanine-basinger.html', 'snippet': 'It’s difficult to make marriage in the movies interesting, Jeanine Basinger’s survey argues.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One morning recently, for 37 minutes, my husband talked to me about light bulbs: how their life expectancy is woefully overcalculated, why they have become so expensive, how the new “efficient” models are a cunning plot by manufacturers to make us spend still more. Knowing this would not even be the most boring conversation I’d face that day, I nodded and tried to look interested. At some point it occurred to me that if I were to make a movie about marriage, its title might well be: “Nodding and Trying to Look Interested.”', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/books/review/0310NEWMAN/0310NEWMAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 689, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/10/books/review/0310NEWMAN/0310NEWMAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 689}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/books/review/0310NEWMAN/0310NEWMAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 892, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/books/review/0310NEWMAN/0310NEWMAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1783, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/books/review/0310NEWMAN/0310NEWMAN-thumbSt