ary: If you cancel on the sitter, should you pay her for her time, and how and when? “I baby-sit this wonderful 2-year-old once a week,” the questioner wrote. “There have been issues in the past where they’ve canceled on short notice (12 hours, and there was an emergency) and I’ve been really accommodating.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Do You Pay the Baby Sitter if You Cancel?', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Child Care', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-08T16:41:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': "By Kj Dell'Antonia", 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kj', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': "Dell'Antonia", 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f08dbcd7-98d9-5cd7-93aa-ea0cab6ddf96', 'word_count': 258, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f08dbcd7-98d9-5cd7-93aa-ea0cab6ddf96'}, {'abstract': 'With a string of movies on the docket, one of Hollywood’s men of the moment kicks back with T.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/t-magazine/100000002089121/good-morning-matthias-schoenaerts-.html', 'snippet': 'With a string of movies on the docket, one of Hollywood’s men of the moment kicks back with T.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With a string of movies on the docket, one of Hollywood’s men of the moment kicks back with T.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/02/27/t-magazine/video-tmag-matthias/video-tmag-matthias-articleLarge-v4.png', 'height': 249, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/02/27/t