 a value greater than $100 million experienced litigation. But some argue that the boom in lawsuits can have real value.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Shareholder merger litigation is everywhere these days. And recent developments, including a decision in Delaware over the now completed acquisition of Transatlantic Holdings, show not only that merger litigation is here to stay, but also that courts still don’t know what to do about the proliferation of suits. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Debating the Merits of the Boom in Merger Lawsuits', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Courts and the Judiciary', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Legal Profession', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-08T20:50:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Davidoff Solomon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': 'Davidoff', 'lastname': 'Solomon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cd381199-0a72-5cc3-9ff0-605a3577453c', 'word_count': 1424, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cd381199-0a72-5cc3-9ff0-605a3577453c'}, {'abstract': 'Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg shares his views on the solution to the spate of gun violence in America and how he’s applied them in governing New York City.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/nyregion/100000001959735/mayor-bloomberg-on-meet-the-press.html', 'snippet': 'Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg shares his views on the solution to the spate of gun violence in America and how he’s applied them in govern