cc4168bc-7b25-574e-8149-7046bb5e9e39'}, {'abstract': 'Fears are high because of a recent spate of traffic deaths, but you are still more likely to be murdered in New York City than be killed by a car while on foot.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/10/nyregion/after-a-spate-of-vehicular-deaths-is-it-safe-to-cross-the-road.html', 'snippet': 'Fears are high because of a recent spate of traffic deaths, but you are still more likely to be murdered in New York City than be killed by a car while on foot.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On a Friday afternoon last month, Martha Atwater went to buy cookies at a bagel shop on Atlantic Avenue and Clinton Street in Brooklyn and was struck by a Honda sport utility vehicle that careered onto the sidewalk as she was leaving. According to the Police Department, the driver, John McKinney, lost control when he experienced a blackout related to diabetes. By the time Ms. Atwater was taken to Long Island College Hospital around the block, she was dead, leaving behind a husband, two young daughters and a closely bound community of mourners in Brooklyn Heights, where she had been a vibrant presence.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/nyregion/10BIG_SPAN/10BIG_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/10/nyregion/10BIG_SPAN/10BIG_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/nyregion/10BIG_SPAN/10BIG_SPAN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/nyregion/10BIG_SPAN/10BIG_SPAN-s