': 'nyt://article/53ba0962-29aa-5ea8-b668-144d7161bf2d'}, {'abstract': 'The executive director of the nation’s busiest port on her pink ’57 Thunderbird and her inner Martha Stewart.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/10/opinion/sunday/catching-up-with-geraldine-knatz.html', 'snippet': 'The executive director of the nation’s busiest port on her pink ’57 Thunderbird and her inner Martha Stewart.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Geraldine Knatz is executive director of the Port of Los Angeles, the nation’s busiest. Encompassing 7,500 acres on 43 miles of waterfront, the port handled more than $273 billion in cargo last year and is responsible for 3 million jobs.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/sunday-review/10download/10download-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 2184, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/10/sunday-review/10download/10download-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 2184}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/sunday-review/10download/10download-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 282, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/sunday-review/10download/10download-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 563, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/sunday-review/10download/10download-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/10/sunday-review/10download/10download-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thum