d likes lasagna. It is my expressive medium. On Wednesday alone, I sent at least 100 — but I like to send more than just words. I’m a big fan of using emoji, the colorful symbol alphabet that contains nearly a thousand images of cute animals, food items and expressive smiley faces to convey what words cannot.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Online Emotions, in Hundreds of New Flavors', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Online Emotions, in Hundreds of New Flavors', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wortham, Jenna', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Applications', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Text Messaging', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Path.com', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'MessageMe (Mobile App)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lango (Mobile App)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Naver.com', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-09T21:15:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'SundayBusiness', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jenna Wortham', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jenna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wortham', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/45162d8d-b560-5947-aa8a-1cc5a3a11956', 'word_count': 1097, 'uri': 'nyt://article/45162d8d-b560-5947-aa8a-1cc5a3a11956'}, {'abstract': 'Readers respond to “The Business of the Minimum Wage” (Economic View, March 5).', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/10/business/the-minimum-wage-and-the-economy.html', 'snippet': 'Readers respond to “The Business of the Minimum Wage” (Economic View, March 5).', 'lead_pa