be split, and the Ministry of Health will merge with the commission that manages China’s one-child policy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/11/world/asia/china-announces-reduction-of-cabinet-level-ministries.html', 'snippet': 'The Ministry of Railways, long criticized as being a haven of corruption, will be split, and the Ministry of Health will merge with the commission that manages China’s one-child policy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIJING — Chinese officials announced Sunday that the government would consolidate some cabinet-level ministries in an attempt to streamline the bureaucracy. The move is the seventh restructuring in three decades, according to Xinhua, the state news agency.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/11/world/11iht-11beijing-span/11iht-11beijing-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/11/world/11iht-11beijing-span/11iht-11beijing-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/11/world/11iht-11beijing-span/11iht-11beijing-span-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/11/world/11iht-11beijing-span/11iht-11beijing-span-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/11/world/11iht-11beijing-span/11iht-11beijing-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy