conference to extol the virtues of using Twitter to help improve government.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/10/cory-booker-twitter-visionary/', 'snippet': 'The Newark mayor took the stage at the South by Southwest conference to extol the virtues of using Twitter to help improve government.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AUSTIN, Tex. — Cory Booker — the mayor of Newark and a virtual Twitter superhero for his chronicle of the city — made the trip to the annual South by Southwest conference here on Sunday to impart his tips and perspective on why Twitter is a valuable tool for governing and civic engagement.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Cory Booker, Twitter Visionary', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Networking (Internet)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'South by Southwest Music and Media Conference', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Booker, Cory A', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Twitter', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Newark (NJ)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-10T22:29:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ashley Parker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ashley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Parker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d3a1c42c-0ab2-559c-bbb2-e818d134e622', 'word_count': 756, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d3a1c42c-0ab2-559c-bbb2-e818d134e622'}, {'abstract': 'Jeffrey Schwarz, the director of “I Am Divine,” discusses his documentary about the drag star Divine.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/10/looking-divine-at-south-by-southwest/', 'snippet': 'Jeffrey Schwarz, the director of “I Am Divine,” discusses his documentary about the drag star Divine.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AUSTIN, Tex. — Playing on screens throughout the South by Southwest festival this weekend were a variety of documentaries focusing on key figures in gay, lesbian, bisexual and transgender communities. “Continental” shines its eye on Steve Ostrow, the owner of the Continental Baths, a bathhouse that became a cultural beacon. “Big Joy” focuses on the gay poet and filmmaker James Broughton, whose work in the 1960s and ’70s made him a voice of the sexual revolution. “Mr. Angel” spends time with the porn star and activist Buck Angel, whose work has changed perspectives on transgender performers in adult film.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/movies/divine-4/divine-4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 864, 'width': 587, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/movies/divine-4/divine-4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 864, 'width': 587, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/movies/divine-4/divine-4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/10/movies/divine-4/divine-4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/10/movies/divine-4/divine-4-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Looking Divine at South by Southwest', 'kicker':