n Doyle to Direct a London Revival of ‘The Color Purple’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Low-Key London Revival Of ‘The Color Purple’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Doyle, John', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Menier Chocolate Factory', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-10T22:40:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam W. Kepler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Kepler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/720382b0-a2db-5c31-acb7-5d0c0b68f6bb', 'word_count': 211, 'uri': 'nyt://article/720382b0-a2db-5c31-acb7-5d0c0b68f6bb'}, {'abstract': 'The Pearl Theater Company has pushed back the spring premiere of Terrence McNally’s “And Away We Go” to the fall season.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/11/theater/pearl-theater-company-delays-mcnally-play.html', 'snippet': 'The Pearl Theater Company has pushed back the spring premiere of Terrence McNally’s “And Away We Go” to the fall season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Pearl Theater Company has pushed back the spring premiere of Terrence McNally’s “And Away We Go” to the fall season. The play was previously scheduled to run from April 19 to May 19. “This Side of Neverland,” which features a pair of one-acts by J. M. Barrie, will now fill that period and close the Pearl’s 2012-13 season. The delay follows a February letter to subscribers stating that the company was experiencing a cash-flow shortfall and needed to raise an additional $250,000 to continue the current season as scheduled.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '