roduction for February and the Thomson Reuters/University of Michigan consumer sentiment index for March (Friday).', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Economic Reports for the Week Ahead', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Economic Reports for the Week Ahead', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Company Reports', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-10T22:53:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b3ed46f1-7325-5a53-9611-abe1132c2034', 'word_count': 309, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b3ed46f1-7325-5a53-9611-abe1132c2034'}, {'abstract': 'The following tax-exempt fixed-income issues are scheduled for pricing this week.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/11/business/treasury-auctions-set-for-week-of-march-11.html', 'snippet': 'The following tax-exempt fixed-income issues are scheduled for pricing this week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Treasury’s schedule of financing this week includes Monday’s regular weekly auction of new three- and six-month bills and an auction of four-week bills on Tuesday.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Treasury Auctions Set for This Week', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Treasury Auctions Set for This Week', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Government Bonds', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tax Credits, Deductions and Exemptions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 's