o, an efficient and electrifying 6-foot-5 junior at Indiana, has blossomed from an undervalued recruit into a finalist for the Wooden Award, given to the nation’s top player.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/11/sports/ncaabasketball/indianas-victor-oladipo-keeps-the-great-plays-coming.html', 'snippet': 'Victor Oladipo, an efficient and electrifying 6-foot-5 junior at Indiana, has blossomed from an undervalued recruit into a finalist for the Wooden Award, given to the nation’s top player.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BLOOMINGTON, Ind. — Victor Oladipo believes there is a song for every occasion, and to the resignation of his Indiana teammates, those occasions include blinking, breathing and walking.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/11/sports/ncaabasketball/11indiana1-img/11indiana1-img-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/11/sports/ncaabasketball/11indiana1-img/11indiana1-img-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/11/sports/ncaabasketball/11indiana1-img/11indiana1-img-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/11/sports/ncaabasketball/11indiana1-img/11indiana1-img-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/11/sports/ncaabasketball/11indiana1-img/11indiana1-img-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail'