hts-of-hype-leading-off.html', 'snippet': 'Before the Masters golf tournament and the N.C.A.A. basketball tournament, an onslaught of talk about both.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Now that we are well into March, it’s time to brace for the coming onslaught. No, we’re not talking about college basketball tournament madness. That is actually the enjoyable part, so fun we manage to block out reality and overlook the whole N.C.A.A. morass for a few minutes. No, the onslaught comes courtesy of CBS, which broadcasts both the N.C.A.A. tournament and the Masters golf tournament, a fact drilled into our heads so often by Jim Nantz every year that mental health counselors should consider setting up a hot line. Mute buttons everywhere quiver in anticipation of angry thumbs.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/12/sports/ncaabasketball/12leadingpic/12leadingpic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 406, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/12/sports/ncaabasketball/12leadingpic/12leadingpic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 406}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/12/sports/ncaabasketball/12leadingpic/12leadingpic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 692, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/12/sports/ncaabasketball/12leadingpic/12leadingpic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1384, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/12/sports/ncaabasketball/12leadingpic/12leadingpic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thum