resilience-seen-in-norther-and-tropical-flora-in-a-warming-climate/', 'snippet': 'From the Arctic to the tropics, studies find resilience in plants facing global warming.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Separate comprehensive studies published in the last couple of days in Nature Climate Change and Nature Geoscience find that from the northern tundra to the tropical forests, plant communities are showing substantial capacity to tolerate global warming.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/11/blogs/dotplantsnorth/dotplantsnorth-articleLarge.png', 'height': 522, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/11/blogs/dotplantsnorth/dotplantsnorth-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 522}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/11/blogs/dotplantsnorth/dotplantsnorth-jumbo.png', 'height': 890, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/11/blogs/dotplantsnorth/dotplantsnorth-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1716, 'width': 1974, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/11/blogs/dotplantsnorth/dotplantsnorth-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/11/blogs/dotplantsnorth/dotplantsnorth-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/11/blogs/dotplantsnorth/dotplantsnorth-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'c