os-for-quinn/', 'snippet': 'The videos for Christine C. Quinn, who officially announced her candidacy for mayor on Sunday and does not speak Spanish, are dissimilar in length and details.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Christine C. Quinn, the City Council speaker, is a granddaughter of Irish immigrants, according to a splashy video released Sunday officially announcing her mayoral campaign.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Slip-Up Is Just One Difference Between English and Spanish Videos for Quinn', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Mayors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Spanish Language', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Quinn, Christine C', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-11T21:19:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By David W. Chen and Frances Robles', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Chen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Frances', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Robles', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7c6f5e98-f615-5eb1-b9b0-cbbaf4333654', 'word_count': 460, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7c6f5e98-f615-5eb1-b9b0-cbbaf4333654'}, {'abstract': 'Republicans still think that they lost the election because they failed to communicate their ideas.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/11/its-not-the-rhetoric/', 'snippet': 'Republicans still think that they lost the election because they failed to communicate their ideas.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In his Monday morning column, Greg Sargent of the Washington Post wondered rhetorically whether we had actually had an election last November, since the Republicans are still putting forward the ideas that voters rejected in 2012. Representative Paul Ryan, who was on the G.O.P.’s losing presidential ticket, is about to issue yet another draconian budget plan that would start the process of killing Medicaid and turning Medicare into a voucher program.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'It’s Not the Rhetoric', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boehner, John A', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ryan, Paul D Jr', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-11T21:19:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Rosenthal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rosenthal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b6761099-8d21-594e-9de6-c96d0905c2e7', 'word_count': 384, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b6761099-8d21-594e-9de6-c96d0905c2e7'}, {'abstract': 'BlackBerry is hoping to achieve a comeback with the arrival of its new phone in the United States later this month.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/11/new-blackberry-phone-nears-a-united-states-debut/', 'snippet': 'BlackBerry is hoping to achieve a comeback with the arrival of its new phone in the United States later this month.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Just over six weeks after the BlackBerry Z10 phone went on sale in Britain, the handset, which will very likely determine the fate of the company formerly known as Research In Motion, will start arriving in the hands of American customers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multime