”', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’M a 24-year-old entrepreneur in mobile technologies. I haven’t been flying for business all that long, but it’s really important to my company’s growth. I almost always leave home without doing much in terms of checking on my flight, having ground transportation or a hotel reserved. That may sound irresponsible, but I’ve found that mobile apps can do almost everything for me when I’m on the road. \xa0', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/12/business/Flier/Flier-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 472, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/12/business/Flier/Flier-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 472}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/12/business/Flier/Flier-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 806, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/12/business/Flier/Flier-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1612, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/12/business/Flier/Flier-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/12/business/Flier/Flier-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/12/business/Flier/Flier-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Trapped Next to a