act': 'Wharton made a mistake in rescinding an invitation to Narendra Modi, professor argues.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/12/why-wharton-made-a-mistake-in-rescinding-narendra-modis-invite/', 'snippet': 'Wharton made a mistake in rescinding an invitation to Narendra Modi, professor argues.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The University of Pennsylvania recently withdrew an invitation to Gujarat’s chief minister, Narendra Modi, who was to deliver a keynote address at the Wharton School’s India Economic Forum via video link later this month. The withdrawal, based on questions raised about Mr. Modi’s human rights record, has spurred an animated debate about freedom of speech and Mr. Modi’s leadership credentials in India and among the Indian diaspora. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/12/world/asia/12-Penn-prof-Indiaink/12-Penn-prof-Indiaink-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 766, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/12/world/asia/12-Penn-prof-Indiaink/12-Penn-prof-Indiaink-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 766}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/12/world/asia/12-Penn-prof-Indiaink/12-Penn-prof-Indiaink-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 803, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/12/world/asia/12-Penn-prof-Indiaink/12-Penn-prof-Indiaink-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1570, 'width': 1230, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/12/world/asia/12-Penn-prof-Indiaink/12-Penn-prof-Indiaink-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 