armed America.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the weeks since Newtown, I had been repeatedly told that anti-gun rallies were being cancelled because of threatened gun violence, and that individual gun control advocates, especially state legislators, were being intimidated and harassed. No place is this more evident than in Oregon, where Ginny Burdick, a long-time supporter of sensible gun regulation, has been the victim of a series of small but menacing dirty tricks. The latest one is the subject of my column today. Here is today’s sampling of gun violence.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Gun Report: March 12, 2013', 'kicker': 'Joe Nocera', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Newtown, Conn, Shooting (2012)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chicago (Ill)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Florida', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Houston (Tex)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Indiana', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Newark (NJ)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Oregon', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tennessee', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Washington (State)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-12T14:35:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joe Nocera', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joe', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nocera', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e094482a-5297-5db7-bd88-36581f685e29', 'word_count': 602, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e094482a-5297-5db7-bd88-36581f685e29'}, {'abstract': 'Monks are known to mak