torious ’60s flop.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The topic was work and its instability – chasing jobs, landing jobs, losing jobs. It’s a common enough subject, especially these days. But the patois of the people sitting behind me at the Charing Cross Theater the other afternoon instantly identified them as members of an ancient and eternal tribe.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/12/arts/12artsbeat-buckley/12artsbeat-buckley-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 962, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/12/arts/12artsbeat-buckley/12artsbeat-buckley-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 962}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/12/arts/12artsbeat-buckley/12artsbeat-buckley-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 639, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/12/arts/12artsbeat-buckley/12artsbeat-buckley-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1170, 'width': 730, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/12/arts/12artsbeat-buckley/12artsbeat-buckley-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/12/arts/12artsbeat-buckley/12artsbeat-buckley-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/12/arts/12artsbeat-buckley/12artsbeat-buckley-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'ma