y, and a worthwhile investment.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/12/spicy-whiskey-from-a-usual-source/', 'snippet': 'Aged a minimum of 12 years, Powers John’s Lane Irish whiskey is full-bodied, earthy and spicy, and a worthwhile investment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Powers John’s Lane Irish whiskey, which arrived in the United States this month, is named after the John’s Lane Distillery, established in Dublin in 1791. The new quaff is very much an attempt to evoke the origins of Powers Whiskey as a single-pot-still whiskey. (Powers Gold Label, the distillery’s benchmark whiskey — and, until recently, the best-selling whiskey in Ireland — is today a blend.) ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/13/dining/13BURNER7/13BURNER7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 347, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/13/dining/13BURNER7/13BURNER7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1444, 'width': 488, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/13/dining/13BURNER7/13BURNER7-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/13/dining/13BURNER7/13BURNER7-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/13/dining/13BURNER7/13BURNER7-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Spicy Whiskey From a Usual Source', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Drink: Spicy Whiskey From a Usual Source', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Whiskey', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-12T17:46:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Simonson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Simonson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c00b9c66-591b-5af8-bf2f-e58d852143fb', 'word_count': 98, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c00b9c66-591b-5af8-bf2f-e58d852143fb'}, {'abstract': 'It’s fitting that Mr. Roth dominates the screen in the new documentary “Philip Roth: Unmasked,” given that his great subject has always been himself.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/13/movies/philip-roth-unmasked-at-film-forum.html', 'snippet': 'It’s fitting that Mr. Roth dominates the screen in the new documentary “Philip Roth: Unmasked,” given that his great subject has always been himself.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Philip Roth, having recently announced his retirement from writing — news that not everyone takes entirely at face value — turns 80 next week. Celebration, and maybe valediction, are certainly the order of the day. Visitors to Newark can take a bus tour past his old high school and pause at the intersection of Summit and Keer Avenues, now designated Philip Roth Plaza, an honor that will have to suffice until the Swedish Academy gets its act together. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/13/movies/13philip-1/13philip-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 393, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/13/movies/13philip-1/1