n everything, including elections, oil prices and even its own demise, was abruptly shuttered on Sunday. While Intrade’s predictive record was good, it didn’t foresee the rising controversy over under-regulated speculation. It’s a cautionary tale for others operating in a somewhat shadowed zone.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Intrade Sheds Light on How Gray Markets Can Go Dark', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Futures and Options Trading', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Intrade', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-12T18:21:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Cyran', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cyran', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ef6b8745-88ba-55c3-aa1b-93be75f83792', 'word_count': 375, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ef6b8745-88ba-55c3-aa1b-93be75f83792'}, {'abstract': 'Republicans are out of sync with public opinion.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/12/the-people-versus-the-party/', 'snippet': 'Republicans are out of sync with public opinion.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Republicans have hit a sour spot in politics — they are 180 degrees opposed to what most Americans want on just about any issue you care to name.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The People Versus the Party', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Budget (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name