 in the lead role.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/13/arts/music/otello-at-the-metropolitan-opera.html', 'snippet': 'Elijah Moshinsky’s production of “Otello” returns to the Met with a new cast, including an impulsive José Cura in the lead role.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Elijah Moshinsky’s striking 1994 production of Verdi’s “Otello” played at the Met last October with the tenor Johan Botha in the title role and Renée Fleming as Desdemona. Illness gave Mr. Botha a shaky opening night and forced him to miss most of the run, although he rallied for the final performance, a live HD broadcast. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/12/arts/20130313OTELLO/20130313OTELLO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/12/arts/20130313OTELLO/20130313OTELLO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/12/arts/20130313OTELLO/20130313OTELLO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/12/arts/20130313OTELLO/20130313OTELLO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/12/arts/20130313OTELLO/20130313OTELLO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/12/arts/20130313OTELLO/20130313OTELLO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'th