, will they get a useful result, or an “amen” from the choir?', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/12/for-boy-scouts-parents-a-chance-to-weigh-in-on-ban-on-gays/', 'snippet': 'When the Scouts survey current members regarding their policies on gays and lesbians, will they get a useful result, or an “amen” from the choir?', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Boy Scouts, who are considering lifting the ban on openly gay scout leaders and scouts, have taken the next step toward making a decision: they are surveying volunteers and member parents on how they feel about the ban. Surveys arrived in e-mail in-boxes over the weekend (and can be viewed in full on the Dallas Voice Web site). ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For Boy Scouts’ Parents, a Chance to Weigh In on Ban on Gays', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Boy Scouts', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-12T19:56:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': "By Kj Dell'Antonia", 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kj', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': "Dell'Antonia", 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cf114a3f-f906-5da1-906c-56cf1b3dae4a', 'word_count': 465, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cf114a3f-f906-5da1-906c-56cf1b3dae4a'}, {'abstract': 'Inside two Asian restaurants that have many things in common.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2013/03/13/dining/20130313-REST.html', 'snippet': 'Inside two Asian restaurants that have many things in common.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Inside two Asian restaurants that have many things i