hours of hand embroidery went into transforming a design by the French artist Pierre Péron into a giant silk chiffon scarf for Hermès.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Eleven hundred glass beads and 290 hours of hand embroidery went into transforming a design by the French artist Pierre Péron into this giant silk chiffon scarf for Hermès. This piece and seven other couture “carrés” are now on view at the Madison Avenue boutique. While more art than accessory, these works are available by special order. Hermès, 691 Madison Avenue; (212) 751-3181.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'High Horse', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Scarves', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hermes International SA', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-12T20:45:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By T Magazine', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/02115fea-352f-51b7-9a8d-bbeceab8bcd2', 'word_count': 63, 'uri': 'nyt://article/02115fea-352f-51b7-9a8d-bbeceab8bcd2'}, {'abstract': 'Lt. Gov. Bill Bolling, who seemed to be positioning himself as a moderate alternative to the Republican nominee, Kenneth T. Cuccinelli II, said he would not run as an independent.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/12/bolling-declines-independent-bid-for-virginia-governor/', 'snippet': 'Lt. Gov. Bill Bolling, who seemed to be positioning himself as a moderate alternative to the Republican nominee, Kenneth T. Cuccinelli II, said he would not run as an independent.', 'lead_paragraph': 'B