stival that runs for five nights in Austin, gathering musicians who want to be heard along with the businesspeople who hope to profit from them. Each year, it sprawls wider, with unofficial events, day and night, surrounding the official showcases that already offer more than 2,000 acts this year. It also moves higher up the pop food chain — gathering not just baby bands hoping for their chance and international visitors dreaming of American exposure — but also big names rolling out their latest efforts — and, inevitably, stealing attention from the underdogs.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'SXSW Music: A Chance at Serendipity Amid the Glut', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-03-12T21:37:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jon Pareles', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pareles', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/be4ff5b5-469e-5a87-85c9-181b9cff4c4c', 'word_count': 430, 'uri': 'nyt://article/be4ff5b5-469e-5a87-85c9-181b9cff4c4c'}, {'abstract': 'Chicken dishes from different parts of the country make liberal use of a variety of spices.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/13/dining/a-seder-spiced-with-flavors-from-india.html', 'snippet': 'Chicken dishes from different parts of the country make liberal use of a variety of spices.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KOCHI, India — Dreaming of spices described in the Book of Kings, I came to this southern port city built in the 14th century to learn about its longstanding but tiny Jewish presence and its food, which some believe dates back to the time of the Bible.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Seder Spiced With Indian Flavors', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Seder Spiced With Indian Flavors', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nathan, Joan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Passover', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Spices', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jews and Judaism', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cochin (India)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-12T21:40:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joan Nathan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nathan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e5e291ea-e704-5d15-a97d-fb540c426867', 'word_count': 670, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e5e291ea-e704-5d15-a97d-fb540c426867'}, {'abstract': 'Spinning off its magazine unit may be a good move for Time Warner, but spinoffs have a dark side, serving as a convenient dumping ground for unwanted businesses.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/03/12/in-spinoffs-a-chance-to-jettison-undesirable-liabilities/', 'snippet': 'Spinning off its magazine unit may be a good move for Time Warner, but spinoffs have a dark side, serving as a convenient dumping ground for unwanted businesses.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A spinoff is a product of Wall Street math that says one plus one can equal three. Yet as shareholders of Time Warner may be about to find out, it can also be all about subtraction, as a company ditches an unwanted business, in this case, magazines.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Spinoffs, a Chance to Jettison Liabilities', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Spinoffs, a Chance to Jettison Undesirable Liabilities', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Initial Public Offerings', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Time Inc.', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Time Warner Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-12T21:44:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Davidoff Solomon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': 'Davidoff', 'lastname': 'Solomon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/af08cb10-bcdf-546a-8dc7-ca9792a964f9', 'word_count': 1253, 'uri': 'nyt://article/af08cb10-bcdf-546a-8dc7-ca9792a964f9'}, {'abstract': 'This is the first in a new series of posts, in which NYT developers pass along their recommendations from around the web.', 'web_url': 'https://open.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/12/this-weeks-links/', 'snippet': 'This is the first in a new series of posts, in which NYT developers pass along their recommendations from around the web.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This is the first in a new series of posts, in which NYT developers share their recommendations from around the web.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'This Week’s Links', 'kicker': 'Open', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-03-12T21:45:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original