, {'abstract': 'Activities that mix strength-building and cardiovascular, or aerobic, exercise, can help older people meet physical activity guidelines.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/13/business/retirementspecial/exercise-programs-for-older-adults-combine-aerobics-strength-and-balance.html', 'snippet': 'Activities that mix strength-building and cardiovascular, or aerobic, exercise, can help older people meet physical activity guidelines.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BY 9:30 a.m., the early crowd at Metro Fitness in Montgomery, Ala., has thinned. Those who must be at work are gone. Those who remain are generally retirees. At that time, every Monday, Wednesday and Friday, 15 to 20 of them gather in the club’s first-floor studio for a class called Fitness Fusion.', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/13/business/retirementspecial/EXERCISE/EXERCISE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 433, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/13/business/retirementspecial/EXERCISE/EXERCISE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 433}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/13/business/retirementspecial/EXERCISE/EXERCISE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 739, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/13/business/retirementspecial/EXERCISE/EXERCISE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1478, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/13/business/retirementspecial/EXERCISE/EXERCISE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'su