 an oath on the Bible, pledging secrecy. And then the 115 cardinals were sealed inside to choose from among them the next leader of the Roman Catholic Church. It was a ritual, solemn and ancient, that underscored the continuity of a 2,000-year-old institution. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'With Ancient Rites, Cardinals Make First Attempt to Choose a Pope', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'With Ancient Rites, Cardinals Make First Attempt to Choose a Pope', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Donadio, Rachel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Roman Catholic Church', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Benedict XVI', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Popes', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-13T00:45:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rachel Donadio and Jim Yardley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rachel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Donadio', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Jim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yardley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a043c31f-0f12-56e1-899d-1bb1ed6a5868', 'word_count': 1370, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a043c31f-0f12-56e1-899d-1bb1ed6a5868'}, {'abstract': 'A doctor’s appraisal of David Tarloff came to him as he was lying not far from a dead or dying colleague, looking up at his former patient, who was wielding a bloody meat cleaver.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/13/nyregion/psychiatrist-also-a-victim-recalls-david-tarloffs-actions-on-night-of-therapists-murder.html', 'snippet': 'A doctor’s appraisal of David Tarloff came to him as he was lying not far from a dead or dying colleague, looking up at his former patient, who was wielding a bloody meat cleaver.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At the murder trial of a man accused of killing an Upper East Side psychologist, several mental health experts are expected to testify about the defendant’s state of mind on the night of the slaying. But one of those experts, Dr. Kent D. Shinbach, did not come to his conclusions from the comfort of his desk.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Psychiatrist, Also Victimized, Tells of Attack by Defendant ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Psychiatrist, Also Victimized, Tells of Attack by Defendant', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Faughey, Kathryn', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tarloff, David', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shinbach, Kent D', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mental Health and Disorders', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-13T00:45:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Russ Buettner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Russ', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Buettner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bb038ba7-3c8e-54b4-bc0b-eccee6361ef0', 'word_count': 730, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bb038ba7-3c8e-54b4-bc0b-eccee6361ef0'}, {'abstract': 'The Senate Banking Committee is expected to approve Mary Jo White, who provided few details of her plans for the S.E.C.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/03/12/mary-jo-white-says-her-s-e-c-would-be-tough-on-wall-st/', 'snippet': 'The Senate Banking Committee is expected to approve Mary Jo White, who provided few details of her plans for the S.E.C.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Mary Jo White moved closer to becoming a top Wall Street regulator on Tuesday as she sailed through a Congressional confirmation hearing. But even her supporters on Capitol Hill pointed to significant challenges awaiting the next leader of the Securities and Exchange Commission.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'White Says Her S.E.C. Would Be Tough on Wall St.', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'At Hearing, Nominee for S.E.C. Chief Vows to Be a Tough Wall St. Regulator', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'White, Mary Jo', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Securities and Exchange Commission', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-13T00:50:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Protess', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Protess', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dd0bda0a-3308-551b-9e14-231280136e48', 'word_count': 928, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dd0bda0a-3308-551b-9e14-231280136e48'}, {'abstract': 'Cornerback Nnamdi Asomugha was released by the Philadelphia Eagles after two disappointing seasons.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/13/sports/football/nfl-football-roundup.html', 'snippet': 'Cornerback Nnamdi Asomugha was released by the Philadelphia Eagles after two disappointing seasons.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The interior of the Jets’ defensive line disappeared Tuesday, when Sione Po’uha was released and the free agent Mike DeVito left for the Kansas