0841-31ca-59c2-84cd-117c9371a2b6'}, {'abstract': 'A day after a dismal performance in defeat to Philadelphia, the Nets rebounded Tuesday with a rout of another last-place team, the New Orleans Hornets.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/13/sports/basketball/this-time-nets-beat-a-lowly-opponent.html', 'snippet': 'A day after a dismal performance in defeat to Philadelphia, the Nets rebounded Tuesday with a rout of another last-place team, the New Orleans Hornets.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With the Atlantic Division-leading Knicks slogging through a Western trip, the second-place Nets are in Brooklyn with a chance to cut the Knicks’ lead in the standings before they begin their own long Western swing next week. On Tuesday, one day after a dismal defeat to lowly Philadelphia, the short-handed Nets rebounded with a thorough and systematic 108-98 victory over another last-place team, the New Orleans Hornets.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/13/sports/NETS/NETS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 662, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/13/sports/NETS/NETS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 662}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/13/sports/NETS/NETS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 929, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/13/sports/NETS/NETS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1995, 'width': 1809, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/13/sports/NETS/NETS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75,