 a crowded tenement three years ago that killed five other Guatemalan immigrants in one of the deadliest New York City blazes in years. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jury Finds Tenant Guilty of Setting Deadly Fire at a Crowded Brooklyn Tenement in 2010', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jury Finds Tenant Guilty of Setting Deadly Fire at a Crowded Brooklyn Tenement in 2010', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARSON', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Secret, Mosi', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gerazounis, Argyrios', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ignacio, Daniel', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bensonhurst (Brooklyn, NY)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fires and Firefighters', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-13T03:07:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mosi Secret', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mosi', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Secret', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3bc57a9c-52e6-5e61-ba92-6be6a278d9c4', 'word_count': 732, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3bc57a9c-52e6-5e61-ba92-6be6a278d9c4'}, {'abstract': 'Disagreements were rare as Gabriel Gomez, Michael Sullivan and Daniel B. Winslow made their cases for filling John Kerry’s seat.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/12/senate-debate-introduces-3-republica