region/brooklyn-man-held-in-killing-of-2-and-dumping-of-guns.html', 'snippet': 'Rogelio Rodriguez was charged in the murders of two men whose burned bodies were found March 6 in a Queens marsh.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A Brooklyn man has been charged with murder in the killings of two men whose bodies were found badly burned in a Queens marsh last week, officials said Tuesday night.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Brooklyn Man Charged With Killing 2 and Dumping Guns', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Brooklyn Man Charged With Killing 2 and Dumping Guns', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bushwick (Brooklyn, NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rodriguez, Rogelio', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Howard Beach (Queens, NY)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-13T03:29:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Emma G. Fitzsimmons', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Emma', 'middlename': 'G.', 'lastname': 'Fitzsimmons', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/29b9c3c5-d450-5b19-88d9-1ad83b0f03d7', 'word_count': 352, 'uri': 'nyt://article/29b9c3c5-d450-5b19-88d9-1ad83b0f03d7'}, {'abstract': 'Does the stress of being, in effect, forced to exercise, perhaps because your doctor or worried spouse has ordered it, cancel out the otherwise sturdy emotional benefits of physical activity?', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/13/when-exercise-stresses-you-out/', 'snippet': 'Does the stress of being, in effect, forced to exercise, perhaps because your doctor or worried spouse has ordered it, cancel out the otherwise sturdy emotional benefits of physical activity?', 'lead_paragraph': 'For most people, exercise elevates mood. Repeated studies with humans and animals have shown that regular workouts can increase stress resistance, decrease anxiety, lessen symptoms of depression and generally leave people cheerful. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/13/health/13well_running/13well_running-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/13/health/13well_running/13well_running-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/13/health/13well_running/13well_running-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/13/health/13well_running/13well_running-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/13/health/13well_running/13well_running-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/13/health/13well_running/13well_running-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/13/health/13well_running/13well_running-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': 