3/03/13/commerzbank-to-raise-more-capital-and-repay-taxpayer-money/', 'snippet': 'Commerzbank plans to repay a taxpayer bailout and ask shareholders for more capital, moves that would reduce the German government’s influence over the bank but also dilute current shareholders.', 'lead_paragraph': '11:41 a.m. | Updated ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Commerzbank to Raise Capital and Repay Taxpayer Money', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Commerzbank', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-13T14:08:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jack Ewing', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jack', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ewing', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1c3bbb88-c791-5e69-bab9-f1a47ad7d87d', 'word_count': 650, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1c3bbb88-c791-5e69-bab9-f1a47ad7d87d'}, {'abstract': 'A five-woman group from South Korea, f(x) brought a glossy performance to what is mostly a gritty festival.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/13/sxsw-music-korean-pop-with-its-own-special-fx/', 'snippet': 'A five-woman group from South Korea, f(x) brought a glossy performance to what is mostly a gritty festival.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mystique does not thrive at South by Southwest. It is very rarely a festival where the polished pop star bestows a slick, remote performance on distant fans and then disappears back behind the veil of celebrity. The clubs where most gigs take place are too small and the stages are too low for that; audience members are close enough to see musicians eye to eye. They can probably run into them backstage, too, loading their own equipment into the van. Even at larger places, the stars don’t get to bring their custom-built stages, lights and sound systems; they play in the existing setups, like the big, bumpy backyard of a barbecue place or a generic temporary stage in a warehouse or a vacant lot. Performers also experience the same Texas weather — summery even in March — that audiences do. It’s a kind of leveler; who are you without your gimmicks, and how do your songs really hold up?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/13/arts/13artsbeat-sxsw/13artsbeat-sxsw-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 355, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/13/arts/13artsbeat-sxsw/13artsbeat-sxsw-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 355}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/13/arts/13artsbeat-sxsw/13artsbeat-sxsw-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 605, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/13/arts/13artsbeat-sxsw/13artsbeat-sxsw-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1210, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/13/arts/13artsbeat-sxsw/13artsbeat-sxsw-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/13/arts/13artsbeat-sxsw/13artsbeat-sxsw-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, '