ictable news conference and Tuesday night became the latest installment in that long-running series. After the Rangers lost, 3-1, to the Sabres in Buffalo, Tortorella unleashed his thoughts about a loss he found particularly disturbing. It was not the garden-variety blame-the-media rant. It was directed toward his own team.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tortorella’s (Latest) Greatest Rant', 'kicker': 'Slap Shot', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tortorella, John', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-13T18:48:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lynn Zinser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lynn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zinser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f0ab3c65-4177-5b3b-b4b7-6130024488f7', 'word_count': 81, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f0ab3c65-4177-5b3b-b4b7-6130024488f7'}, {'abstract': 'Four decades after his death, a collection of unreleased Hendrix recordings, “People, Hell and Angels,” hit No. 2 on the album chart. Luke Bryan was No. 1.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/13/new-hendrix-album-hits-no-2/', 'snippet': 'Four decades after his death, a collection of unreleased Hendrix recordings, “People, Hell and Angels,” hit No. 2 on the album chart. Luke Bryan was No. 1.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jimi Hendrix is dead but not forgotten. His posthumous album “People, Hell and Angels,” opened at No. 2 on the Billboard album chart this week, selling 72,000 copies more than four decades after he died. The last time one of Hendrix’s albums charted so high was back in 1968, when “Electric Ladyland” spent two weeks at No. 1.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/13/arts/13artsbeat-hendrix/13artsbeat-hendrix-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/13/arts/13artsbeat-hendrix/13artsbeat-hendrix-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/13/arts/13artsbeat-hendrix/13artsbeat-hendrix-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/13/arts/13artsbeat-hendrix/13artsbeat-hendrix-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1500, 'width': 1500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/13/arts/13artsbeat-hendrix/13artsbeat-hendrix-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/13/arts/13artsbeat-hendrix/13artsbeat-hendrix-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/13/arts/13artsbeat-hendrix/13artsbeat-hendrix-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'New Hendrix Album Hits No. 2', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hendrix, Jimi', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-13T