 {'abstract': 'The process would be easier with an inventory of items in a home. Some apps to help.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/14/technology/personaltech/apps-to-keep-an-inventory-of-items-in-your-home.html', 'snippet': 'The process would be easier with an inventory of items in a home. Some apps to help.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I am not a hoarder. In fact, I’m exactly the opposite: I would love to live in a minimalist house, and have strong opinions about disposing of or recycling old things. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/14/business/SMART1/SMART1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1033, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/14/business/SMART1/SMART1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1033}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/14/business/SMART1/SMART1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 595, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/14/business/SMART1/SMART1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1093, 'width': 635, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/14/business/SMART1/SMART1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/14/business/SMART1/SMART1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/14/business/SMART1/SMART1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subTy