in Contemporary Art, Craft and Design” opens at the Museum of Arts and Design.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/14/garden/against-the-grain-exhibition-opens-at-museum-of-arts-and-design.html', 'snippet': '“Against the Grain: Wood in Contemporary Art, Craft and Design” opens at the Museum of Arts and Design.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Against the Grain: Wood in Contemporary Art, Craft and Design,” which opens Tuesday at the Museum of Arts and Design in Manhattan, is an exhibition of 80 contemporary wood pieces, some decorative, some functional and some in between.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/14/garden/14SHOWS/14CURR4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 543, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/14/garden/14SHOWS/14CURR4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 543}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/14/garden/14SHOWS/14CURR4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 926, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/14/garden/14SHOWS/14CURR4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1155, 'width': 1277, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/14/garden/14SHOWS/14CURR4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/14/garden/14SHOWS/14CURR4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/14/garden/14SHOWS