_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/23b8bb68-95c2-51dd-86fb-f68c13916dfa', 'word_count': 845, 'uri': 'nyt://article/23b8bb68-95c2-51dd-86fb-f68c13916dfa'}, {'abstract': 'Carmelo Anthony scored only 9 points in his homecoming before booing fans and left in the third quarter, and now Tyson Chandler is also nursing a knee injury.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/14/sports/basketball/anthony-struggles-as-knicks-fall-to-nuggets.html', 'snippet': 'Carmelo Anthony scored only 9 points in his homecoming before booing fans and left in the third quarter, and now Tyson Chandler is also nursing a knee injury.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DENVER — As it turns out, there are far worse things than being jeered mercilessly by 19,000 people who used to worship your every dribble, dunk and fadeaway. The boos and taunts? That much, Carmelo Anthony expected and perhaps even embraced in his first return to the city he rejected. That much was tolerable.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/14/sports/14knicks-1/14knicks-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 378, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/14/sports/14knicks-1/14knicks-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 378}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/14/sports/14knicks-1/14knicks-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 644, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/14/sports/14knicks-1/14knicks-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1289, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/14/sports/1