es about family life, and it takes even more when that partner pulls a stunt like monthly “This Life” Styles columnist Bruce Feiler’s latest.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'When Your Partner Writes the Book on ‘Happy Families’', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Childhood', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Families and Family Life', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Feiler, Bruce', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-14T13:31:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': "By Kj Dell'Antonia", 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kj', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': "Dell'Antonia", 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/21e5da36-6f04-5473-ab25-b520fac42229', 'word_count': 286, 'uri': 'nyt://article/21e5da36-6f04-5473-ab25-b520fac42229'}, {'abstract': 'Join the cookbook author Nigella Lawson, Julia Moskin of The Times and three home cooks for a live video chat about a recipe from Ms. Lawson’s new cookbook, “Nigellissima.”', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/14/recipe-lab-video-chat-with-nigella-lawson/', 'snippet': 'Join the cookbook author Nigella Lawson, Julia Moskin of The Times and three home cooks for a live video chat about a recipe from Ms. Lawson’s new cookbook, “Nigellissima.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Attention home cooks: It’s time to take your dish out of the oven and join us for a chat with Dining’s own Julia Moskin and the cookbook author Nigella Lawson. We selected three Times readers to join the chat via Google+ Hangout after making the first Recipe Lab dish, Ms. Lawson’s whole wheat pasta with brussels sprouts, cheese and potato. Ms. Moskin and Ms. Lawson, speaking from their kitchens in New York and London, respectively, discussed the recipe, Ms. Lawson’s new cookbook, “Nigellissima,” and food in general with our three home cooks.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/05/dining/nigelissima/nigelissima-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 697, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/05/dining/nigelissima/nigelissima-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 697}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/05/dining/nigelissima/nigelissima-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 882, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/05/dining/nigelissima/nigelissima-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1763, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/05/dining/nigelissima/nigelissima-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/05/dining/nigelissima/nigelissima-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/05/dining/nigelissima/nigelissima-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Recipe Lab Video Chat With Nigella Lawson', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo'