ww.nytimes.com/2013/03/15/arts/dance/via-katlehong-at-montclair-state-university.html', 'snippet': 'The Via Katlehong dance troupe from South Africa performs “Katlehong Cabaret” at Montclair State University.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Striking miners killed by the police. High-profile murder and rape. South Africa has been much in the news in the last few weeks, for particularly distressing reasons. So it’s perhaps useful to have a counterbalance in the shape of Via Katlehong, the vibrant South African dance troupe that returns Friday night, with “Katlehong Cabaret,” to the Peak Performances series at the Alexander Kasser Theater at Montclair State University in New Jersey, where it was first seen in 2009. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/15/arts/15KATLEHONG_SPAN/JPKATLEHONG-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 347, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/15/arts/15KATLEHONG_SPAN/JPKATLEHONG-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 347}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/15/arts/15KATLEHONG_SPAN/JPKATLEHONG-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 593, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/15/arts/15KATLEHONG_SPAN/JPKATLEHONG-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1186, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/15/arts/15KATLEHONG_SPAN/JPKATLEHONG-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/15/arts/15KATLEHONG_SPAN/JPKATL