oversial rule that helped launch the New England Patriots’ dynasty and has haunted the Oakland Raiders for nearly a dozen years may finally be struck down.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'N.F.L. Ponders Changing the Tuck Rule', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Years After Controversy, N.F.L. May Change Tuck Rule', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Officiating (Sports)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Football League', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New England Patriots', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-14T21:29:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Judy Battista', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Judy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Battista', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/04e96ccb-6b47-5f7c-9a2d-91fcf42fd614', 'word_count': 622, 'uri': 'nyt://article/04e96ccb-6b47-5f7c-9a2d-91fcf42fd614'}, {'abstract': 'Travis Wear’s late jumpers shunted Arizona State’s upset bid, and top-seeded and 21st-ranked U.C.L.A. escaped with a victory in a Pac-12 tournament quarterfinal in Las Vegas.', 'web_url': 'https://thequad.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/14/u-c-l-a-escapes-against-arizona-state/', 'snippet': 'Travis Wear’s late jumpers shunted Arizona State’s upset bid, and top-seeded and 21st-ranked U.C.L.A. escaped with a victory in a Pac-12 tournament quarterfinal in Las Vegas.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LAS VEGAS – U.C.L.A., virtually unrecognizable in new tournament uniforms with gray-camouflage shorts and shirt sleeves, barely looked itself for most of the Bruins’ Pac-12 quarterfinal game with ninth-seeded Arizona State.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.C.L.A. Needs Rally to Get Past Arizona State', 'kicker': 'The Quad', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.C.L.A. Needs Rally to Win', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'College Athletics', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Muhammad, Shabazz', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ARIZONA STATE UNIVERSITY', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pacific-12 Conference', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Stanford University', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of California, Los Angeles', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-14T21:32:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Branch', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Branch', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fbf8dead-d626-5471-8e76-198dbc938118', 'word_count': 248, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fbf8dead-d626-5471-8e76-198dbc938118'}, {'abstract': 'Scientists at CERN, the European Organization for Nuclear Research, say they need more data to understand how the particle works and what it means for the universe.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/15/science/physicists-see-higgs-boson-in-new-particle-but-more-study-is-needed.html', 'snippet': 'Scientists at CERN, the European Organization for Nuclear Research, say they need more data to understand how the particle works and what it means for the universe.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Physicists at CERN, the European Organization for Nuclear Research, said Thursday that the new particle discovered with enormous fanfare last summer definitely looks like a Higgs boson, the particle famously predicted by Peter Higgs and others to imbue elementary particles with mass. But they said they still needed more data to understand how it works and what it means for the universe.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'CERN Physicists See Higgs Boson in New Particle', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Particle Appears To Be a Higgs', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Overbye, Dennis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Higgs Boson', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CERN', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Physics', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Large Hadron Collider', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Particle Accelerators', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Science and Technology', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of California, Santa Barbara', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Higgs, Peter Ware', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Incandela, Joe', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Geneva (Switzerland)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Italy', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-14T21:33:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Science', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dennis Overbye', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dennis', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Overbye', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/81db6606-91c8-5115-bd71-5cc44849b239', 'word_count': 300, 'uri': 'nyt://article/81db6606-91c8-5115-bd71-5cc44849b239'}, {'abstract': 'The sweater Edward I. Koch traditionally wore in the St. Patrick’s Day Parade on Fifth Avenue wasn’t green, but it was direct from County Clare.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/14/kochs-touch-of-the-irish/', 'snippet': 'The sweater Edward I. Koch traditionally wore in the St. Patrick’s Day Parade on Fifth Avenue wasn’t green, but it was direct from County Clare.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For nearly 50 years, since he was a city councilman, Edward I. Koch proudly marched in the St. Patrick’s Day Parade, typically in his Aran Islands fisherman’s sweater. Now, the story can be told of how that tradition began.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/15/nyregion/14cityroom-sweater/14cityroom-sweater-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 410, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/15/nyregion/14cityroom-sweater/14cityroom-sweater-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 410}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/15/nyregion/14cityroom-sweater/14cityroom-sweater-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 700, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/15/nyregion/14cityroom-sweater/14cityroom-sweater-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1400, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/15/nyregion/14cityroom-sweater/14cityroom-sweater-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013