ex., hope that data will show that centralized coordination improves the quality of health care while cutting costs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/15/health/in-coordination-of-care-a-partner-in-childrens-health.html', 'snippet': 'Founders of a pilot program to aid medically needy children in Austin, Tex., hope that data will show that centralized coordination improves the quality of health care while cutting costs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It takes a team of medical specialists to care for Anna Barkhuizen, a 9-year-old with epilepsy, cerebral palsy and significant developmental delays. Her mother, Rebecca, recalls waiting for hours in exam rooms and leaving before seeing the doctor, because Anna had grown too impatient.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21A', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/15/us/15ttChild/15ttChild-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/15/us/15ttChild/15ttChild-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 396}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/15/us/15ttChild/15ttChild-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 676, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/15/us/15ttChild/15ttChild-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1351, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/15/us/15ttChild/15ttChild-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/15/us/15ttChild/15ttChild-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbna