rterfinals on Friday in Nyon, Switzerland.', 'web_url': 'https://goal.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/15/champions-league-draw-separation-of-powers/', 'snippet': 'The Spanish rivals Real Madrid and Barcelona and the German giants Bayern Munich and Borussia Dortmund avoided each other when the matchups were drawn for the Champions League quarterfinals on Friday in Nyon, Switzerland.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Spanish rivals Real Madrid and Barcelona and the German giants Bayern Munich and Borussia Dortmund avoided each other when the matchups were drawn for the Champions League quarterfinals on Friday in Nyon, Switzerland.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Champions League Draw: Separation of Powers', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Champions League Draw', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-15T11:28:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Das', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Das', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/86146192-290c-5aa4-8ccb-bbcd789fc8ff', 'word_count': 423, 'uri': 'nyt://article/86146192-290c-5aa4-8ccb-bbcd789fc8ff'}, {'abstract': 'Bergoglio’s tense relations with the Argentine government suggest the new pope may be unafraid to ruffle a few feathers in the Vatican.', 'web_url': 'https://latitude.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/15/bergoglio-stood-up-to-kirchner-will-he-to-the-vaticans-bureaucracy/', 'snippet': 'Bergoglio’s tense relations with the Argentine government suggest the new pope may be unafraid to ruffle a few feathers in the Vatican.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BUENOS AIRES — When the French cardinal Jean-Louis Tauran uttered the name “Bergoglio” in the middle of his Latin habemus papam announcement, I thought I had misheard. I wasn’t the only one in Argentina to think that. News anchors on the local cable channel went silent. The disbelief cleared only when Cardinal Jorge Mario Bergoglio, the archbishop of Buenos Aires, appeared on the balcony of St. Peter’s: An Argentine had just become pope.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Argentinian Pastoral', 'kicker': 'Latitude', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cardinals (Roman Catholic Prelates)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kirchner, Nestor', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tauran, Jean-Louis', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Roman Catholic Church', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Buenos Aires (Argentina)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-15T11:30:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Daniel Politi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Daniel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Politi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8375b7ba-6330-5474-b7f5-e80bff54c7fd', 'word_count': 506, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8375b7ba-6330-5474-b7f5-e80bff54c7fd'}, {'abstract': 'Goldman Sachs has named Steven Barg, the co-head of investment banking in South East Asia, to head mergers and acquisitions capital markets in New York.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/03/15/goldman-names-m-a-capital-markets-head/', 'snippet': 'Goldman Sachs has named Steven Barg, the co-head of investment banking in South East Asia, to head mergers and acquisitions capital markets in New York.', 'lead_p