ee an Oscar-winning performer in his days of apprenticeship.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/17/arts/television/daniel-day-lewiss-1980s-bbc-dramas.html', 'snippet': 'The BBC this week is releasing samples of Daniel Day-Lewis’s 1980s television work, a chance to see an Oscar-winning performer in his days of apprenticeship.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As Daniel Day-Lewis cracked jokes on the Oscars stage last month two related thoughts came to mind. First, why wasn’t any of this wit evident in his disconnected, oddly timid performance in “Lincoln,” for which he had just won the best actor award?', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/17/arts/17DAYLEWIS1_SPAN/17DAYLEWIS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 385, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/17/arts/17DAYLEWIS1_SPAN/17DAYLEWIS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 385}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/17/arts/17DAYLEWIS1_SPAN/17DAYLEWIS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 656, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/17/arts/17DAYLEWIS1_SPAN/17DAYLEWIS1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1313, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/17/arts/17DAYLEWIS1_SPAN/17DAYLEWIS1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/17/arts/17DAYLEWIS1_SPAN/17DAYLEWIS1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtyp