gs.nytimes.com/2013/03/15/weekend-fare-133/', 'snippet': 'Food-related events around New York.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Counter Culture Coffee, a roaster based in Durham, N.C., is hosting its 2013 Cup Tasters Challenge on Friday at its regional training centers across the country. At each, competitors will taste three coffees and identify their differences. At the New York center, at 37 West 26th Street in Chelsea, it’s $5 per person to attend and $10 to compete.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Weekend Fare', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-03-15T16:55:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bao Ong', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bao', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ong', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c7cefc0f-31f6-5957-9c86-ab61a7a54187', 'word_count': 402, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c7cefc0f-31f6-5957-9c86-ab61a7a54187'}, {'abstract': 'Each team is allowed three assistant coaches, but when support staffers are added in, there seem to be more. Way more.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/16/sports/ncaabasketball/theyre-here-there-and-everywhere-college-basketball-assistants.html', 'snippet': 'Each team is allowed three assistant coaches, but when support staffers are added in, there seem to be more. Way more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LAS VEGAS — In college basketball, they are blurred backdrops to the back and forth of the game and the tight close-ups of the leading man. Like movie extras, they get screen time but barely any credit.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'im