o a one-year deal with the Miami Dolphins on Friday. Keller’s departure is the latest in a string of defections to strike the Jets, who have already lost three starters on defense and two on offense as free agents, with more likely to leave.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Keller Agrees to Deal With Dolphins', 'kicker': 'The Fifth Down', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jets Lose Steady Keller and Gain a Veteran Guard', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Keller, Dustin', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-15T17:50:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Shpigel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shpigel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f7c83322-b106-5238-8f7a-e4f5411d2b08', 'word_count': 264, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f7c83322-b106-5238-8f7a-e4f5411d2b08'}, {'abstract': 'With wines easily found in stores, plan a Seder with one sparkling, one white, one red and one fortified without straying from the kosher path.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/20/dining/reviews/kosher-wines-for-the-seder-table.html', 'snippet': 'With wines easily found in stores, plan a Seder with one sparkling, one white, one red and one fortified without straying from the kosher path.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TO THE FOUR QUESTIONS that form the basis of the Seder, wine lovers habitually add a fifth: where is it written that kosher wine must be sweet, thick and unpalatable? Though some Jews retain a sentimental attachment to the jamlike pleasures of Concord grape wines, many desire something better. Much better.