eb_url': 'https://bucks.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/15/volatile-income-conservative-investments/', 'snippet': 'Bucks readers who face fluctuations in income discuss their investment strategies.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Paul Sullivan’s Wealth Matters column this week is about two groups of people — in very different occupations — who are similar in the potential for ups and downs in their income. They are real estate investors and people who work for social media companies.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Volatile Income, Conservative Investments', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-15T18:54:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bucks Editors', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bucks', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Editors', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c0c7fe77-f80d-52c7-8616-3a45e555d5d9', 'word_count': 92, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c0c7fe77-f80d-52c7-8616-3a45e555d5d9'}, {'abstract': 'New Rules for Building Registration; Vetting a Potential Buyer; Succession Rights for Stabilized Apartments.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/17/realestate/new-york-real-estate-questions-and-answers.html', 'snippet': 'New Rules for Building Registration; Vetting a Potential Buyer; Succession Rights for Stabilized Apartments.', 'lead_paragraph': 'New Rules for Building Registration', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Q & A', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Q & A', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Renting and Leasing (Real Estate)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rent Control and Stabilization', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-15T18:55:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'RealEstate', 'section_name': 'Real Estate', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jay Romano', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jay', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Romano', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2352c61c-fd87-58e8-927b-72030316f1a4', 'word_count': 588, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2352c61c-fd87-58e8-927b-72030316f1a4'}, {'abstract': 'Unfazed by the mix of sleet and winds in winter, the Swedes keep their cool, often in a functional but sleek coat.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/15/sleek-storm-style/', 'snippet': 'Unfazed by the mix of sleet and winds in winter, the Swedes keep their cool, often in a functional but sleek coat.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On a recent trip to Stockholm, I learned that the Swedes never stop looking cool. Unfazed by the mix of face-piercing sleet and blustery winds in winter, the guys maintain that enviable minimal style, often in a functional but sleek coat, like the one pictured here by Stutterheim. Based on the founder Alexander Stutterheim’s grandfather’s old fishing coat, the Arholma style is cut from rubberized cotton and hand-sewn (and signed) by a seamstress in the small town of Boras. Available in black, forest green, yellow and dusty white, $735; barneys.com. Jil Sander shirt; jilsander.com. Hermès pants; hermes.com.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sleek Storm Style', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sleek Storm Style', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weather', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hermes International SA', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Jil Sander AG', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Stockholm (Sweden)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-15T19:00:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jason Rider', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jason', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rider', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/33607ca9-7fa3-51d2-89ac-a63ff41d448d', 'word_count': 97, 'uri': 'nyt://article/33607ca9-7fa3-51d2-89ac-a63ff41d448d'}, {'abstract': 'Global festivals worth traveling for.', 'web_url': 'https://intransit.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/15/calendar-coming-events-in-thailand-india-singapore/', 'snippet': 'Global festivals worth traveling for.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Songkran Water Festival, ThailandA nation takes to the streets with squirt guns, super-soakers, buckets and hoses in a no-holds-barred water fight. It sounds like a child’s fantasy, but it’s a description of Songkran, the Thai New Year celebration, from April 13 to April 15. The tradition takes place because Buddhists consider this time of year a period of cleansing and renewal, symbolized by water. But the country-wide water festival is also a way to get soaked and cool off during peak hot season. One way to stay dry: Centara Hotels & Resorts is offering a package that includes a Songkran survival kit (two water shooters and plastic waterproof covers for valuables) and one-night stay from 2,907 baht, $101, for two people. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Calendar: Coming Events in Thailand, India, Singapore', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Singapore', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Thailand', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-15T19:00:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0d9a3ab3-0c7c-50bd-8661-28480d145638', 'word_count': 223, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0d9a3ab3-0c7c-50bd-8661-28480d145638'}, {'abstract': 'The Times critic A. O. Scott reviews "Ginger & Rosa."', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/movies/100000002120034/movie-review-ginger-rosa.html', 'snippet': 'The Times critic A. O. Scott reviews "Ginger & Rosa."', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Times critic A. O. Scott reviews "Ginger & Rosa."', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/15/arts/video-movies-gingerrosa-031513/video-movies-gingerrosa-031513-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/15/arts/video-movies-gingerrosa-031513/video-movies-gingerrosa-031513-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/15/arts/video-movies-gingerrosa-031513/video-movies-gingerrosa-031513-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/15/arts/video-movies-gingerrosa-031513/video-movies-gingerrosa-031513-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 7