 response to a lawsuit by the American Civil Liberties Union.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/16/us/court-says-cia-must-yield-some-data-on-drones.html', 'snippet': 'A federal appeals court held that the agency must disclose, at least to a judge, a description of its records on drone strikes in response to a lawsuit by the American Civil Liberties Union.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — A federal appeals court held Friday that the Central Intelligence Agency must disclose, at least to a judge, a description of its records on drone strikes in response to a Freedom of Information Act lawsuit filed by the American Civil Liberties Union.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Court Orders the C.I.A. to Disclose Drone Data', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Court Orders The C.I.A. To Disclose Drone Data', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drones (Pilotless Planes)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Savage, Charlie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Courts (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Central Intelligence Agency', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'American Civil Liberties Union', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civil Rights and Liberties', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-15T19:38:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Charlie Savage', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Charlie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Savage', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/08d67ba8-00f0-524c-b0cb-1fccc9f17033', 'word_count': 741, 'uri': 'nyt://article/08d67ba8-00f0-524c-b0cb-1fccc9f17033'}, {'abstract': 'Investors will need to keep a sharp eye on their cost basis statements from brokers and banks, lest they invite an I.R.S. inquiry.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/16/your-money/new-tax-laws-cover-cost-basis-of-investments.html', 'snippet': 'Investors will need to keep a sharp eye on their cost basis statements from brokers and banks, lest they invite an I.R.S. inquiry.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Until recently, the tax man rarely held you accountable for how much you profited — or lost — when you sold stocks or mutual funds.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/16/your-money/16money/16money-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 651, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/16/your-money/16money/16money-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 651}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/16/your-money/16money/16money-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 944, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/16/your-money/16money/16money-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1888, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/16/your-money/16money/16money-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/16/your-money/16money/16money-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/16/your-money/16money/16money-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'New Laws Take Guesswork Out of Investment Tax Liability', 'kicker': 'Your Money', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New Laws Take Guesswork Out of Investment Tax Liability', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bernard, Tara Siegel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Personal Finances', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income Tax', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Taxes (US)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Capital Gains Tax', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-15T19:39:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tara Siegel Bernard', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tara', 'middlename': 'Siegel', 'lastname': 'Bernard', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/eb710b8f-53f4-5677-8da8-84b22cd50184', 'word_count': 1558, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eb710b8f-53f4-5677-8da8-84b22cd50184'}, {'abstract': 'Real estate brokers and analysts report a significant uptick in the number of people seeking fixer-uppers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/17/realestate/home-buyers-seek-manhattan-fixer-uppers.html', 'snippet': 'Real estate brokers and analysts report a significant uptick in the number of people seeking fixer-uppers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For people scrambling to make their way in the real estate market, there are many routes, and one of the most adventurous involves buying what brokers often describe as wrecks (fixer-upper is the more diplomatic term). An anemic inventory combined with increasing reluctance to shell out huge sums of money for other people’s taste is sending a growing number of buyers to places they can redo to their own liking, right down to the shape of the kitchen island and the color of the bathroom tile.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/17/realestate/17COVER1_SPAN/17COVER1_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 442, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/17/realestate/17COVER1_SPAN/17COVER1_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 442}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/17/realestate/17COVER1_SPAN/17COVER1_SPAN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 754, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/17/realestate/17COVER1_SPAN/17COVER1_SPAN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1508, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/17/realestate/17COVER1_SPAN/cover-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/17/realestate/17COVER1_SPAN/cover-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/17/realestate/17COVER1_SPAN/cover-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Home Buyers Seek Manhattan Wrecks', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': Non