lideshow/56f38cd3-dc4b-56c9-bea1-c311cb06c0fc'}, {'abstract': 'Her death late last year at the age of 56 was one more puzzling turn in a life that had more than its share of drama.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/17/fashion/her-fathers-daughter-the-turbulent-life-of-lisa-de-kooning.html', 'snippet': 'Her death late last year at the age of 56 was one more puzzling turn in a life that had more than its share of drama.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Dec. 15, 2012, a mild early-winter day, some 250 guests filed into St. Luke’s Episcopal, a Gothic-style stone church in East Hampton, N.Y., for the memorial service of Lisa de Kooning, the only child and sole heir of Willem de Kooning, the Dutch-born Abstract Expressionist. She had died three weeks earlier, on Nov. 23, at her vacation home on St. John in the United States Virgin Islands. She was 56.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/17/fashion/17DEKOONING_SPAN/17SUB2DEKOONING-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/17/fashion/17DEKOONING_SPAN/17SUB2DEKOONING-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/17/fashion/17DEKOONING_SPAN/17SUB2DEKOONING-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/17/fashion/17DEKOONING_SPAN/17SUB2DEKOONING-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/17/fashion/17DEKOONING_SPAN/17