//article/e47fdd5e-e69e-5d2f-a495-4a01b3cca52c'}, {'abstract': 'The pay levels at Ford and General Motors far exceed what the companies were paying their executives a few years ago, when the automakers were losing billions of dollars.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/16/business/another-lucrative-year-for-car-executives.html', 'snippet': 'The pay levels at Ford and General Motors far exceed what the companies were paying their executives a few years ago, when the automakers were losing billions of dollars.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The turnaround of the American auto industry is paying off for senior management, particularly at the Ford Motor Company, even with a 29 percent reduction in compensation for its chief executive. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/16/business/Ford/Ford-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 864, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/16/business/Ford/Ford-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 864}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/16/business/Ford/Ford-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 712, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/16/business/Ford/Ford-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1423, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/16/business/Ford/Ford-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/16/business/Ford/Ford-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thum