es when their beekeeper died.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Busy Bees Need Death Notices, Too, to Move on to the Next Keeper', 'kicker': 'Dance Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Busy Bees Need Death Notices, Too, to Move On to the Next Keeper', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Garfield, Keely', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chocolate Factory, The', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-15T22:02:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gia Kourlas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kourlas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/47a4ebbc-9755-5c81-a8b0-853b788c83d0', 'word_count': 455, 'uri': 'nyt://article/47a4ebbc-9755-5c81-a8b0-853b788c83d0'}, {'abstract': 'The first batch of 2012 releases offered aromatic, flavorful whites that delivered charm and balance and will accompany a variety of dishes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/17/nyregion/a-pleasing-debut-for-2012-whites.html', 'snippet': 'The first batch of 2012 releases offered aromatic, flavorful whites that delivered charm and balance and will accompany a variety of dishes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After tasting six food-friendly whites recently, I wished that more than half of them had been bottled with screw caps. It is easy to store such bottles on their sides in the refrigerator, making it more likely that they will be consumed promptly, capturing their freshness.', 'print_section': 'LI', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Pleasing Debut for 2012 Whites', 'kicker': 'Long Island Vines', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Pleasing Debut For 2012 Whites', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wines', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Long Island (NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-15T22:04:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Howard G. Goldberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Howard', 'middlename': 'G.', 'lastname': 'Goldberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/03294857-796b-5526-8d70-7653d14f0c5d', 'word_count': 302, 'uri': 'nyt://article/03294857-796b-5526-8d70-7653d14f0c5d'}, {'abstract': 'The movie has already been panned by Mr. Spector’s wife and the family of Lana Clarkson, an actress for whose 2003 murder he is currently serving 19 years to life in prison.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/15/harsh-words-for-hbos-phil-spector-biopic/', 'snippet': 'The movie has already been panned by Mr. Spector’s wife and the family of Lana Clarkson, an actress for whose 2003 murder he is currently serving 19 years to life in prison.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The new HBO biopic “Phil Spector” doesn’t make it debut until March 24, but it has already been panned both by Mr. Spector’s wife and the family of Lana Clarkson, an actress for whose 2003 murder he is currently serving 19 years to life in prison.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Harsh Words for HBO’s Phil Spector Biopic', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clarkson, Lana', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mamet, David', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'per