n agent from Brooklyn is on a mission to find new acts at South by Southwest.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AUSTIN, Tex. — When the South by Southwest music festival started here 26 years ago, it was known as a place to discover new bands, a fertile hunting ground for booking agents and scouts for labels. These days indie labels and booking agents generally use the festival to promote the artists they have already signed, like vendors at a trade show. The major labels do too, often booking several shows for musicians they have just signed to contracts in hopes of generating excitement for debut albums. Every year a few major stars who have new releases out also make appearances. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/16/arts/16SXSW/16SXSW-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 506, 'width': 401, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/16/arts/16SXSW/16SXSW-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 506, 'width': 401, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/16/arts/16SXSW/16SXSW-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/16/arts/16SXSW/16SXSW-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/16/arts/16SXSW/16SXSW-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'On the Prowl for New Acts at Southwest', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'On the Prowl For New Acts At Southwest', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'South by Southwest Music and Media Conference', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Austin (Tex)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rock Music', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bohannon, John', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-15T23:28:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By James C. McKinley Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'McKinley', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fc303632-26ba-5525-9835-f3434d13fc61', 'word_count': 1102, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fc303632-26ba-5525-9835-f3434d13fc61'}, {'abstract': 'Subjects include a surfer in Astoria, mourners in East Flatbush and the faithful at St. Patrick’s Cathedral.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/15/week-in-pictures-for-march-15/', 'snippet': 'Subjects include a surfer in Astoria, mourners in East Flatbush and the faithful at St. Patrick’s Cathedral.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Here is a slide show of photographs from the past week in New York City and the region. Subjects include a surfer in Astoria, mourners in East Flatbush and the faithful at St. Patrick’s Cathedral.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Week in Pictures for March 15', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Popes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Traffic Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 3, 'major':