0-102b5a265942'}, {'abstract': 'Newly released data show that many commercial stocks depleted by overfishing are returning in abundance since a 1996 law that effectively ordered limits on catches.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/16/science/earth/fish-populations-in-us-rebound-since-1996-catch-limits-law.html', 'snippet': 'Newly released data show that many commercial stocks depleted by overfishing are returning in abundance since a 1996 law that effectively ordered limits on catches.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Many commercial fishing stocks off the United States coast that were depleted by decades of overfishing are returning to abundance, thanks largely to a 1996 law that effectively ordered limits on catches until the fish populations had rebounded, a newly released analysis of federal data on fish populations states.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Fish Populations in the United States Rebound', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Populations Of U.S. Fish Rebound', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fishing, Commercial', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Natural Resources Defense Council', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fish and Other Marine Life', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Marine Fisheries Service', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-16T00:02:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Science', 'subsection_name': 'Environment', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Wines', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wines', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d1d67a9b-a80d-5c79-a841-557187f9e054', 'word_count': 471, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d1d67a9b-a80d-5c79-a841-557187f9e054'}, {'abstract': 'With a name that conveys enthusiastic ambition, Carpe Diem is a newcomer to Locust Avenue in New Canaan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/17/nyregion/a-review-of-carpe-diem-in-new-canaan.html', 'snippet': 'With a name that conveys enthusiastic ambition, Carpe Diem is a newcomer to Locust Avenue in New Canaan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With a name that conveys enthusiastic ambition, Carpe Diem (“Seize the day!”) is a newcomer to Locust Avenue in New Canaan. It’s a handsome, romantically lighted place, with charcoal-gray banquettes, and cream-colored walls decorated with photographs and racks of wine bottles. The cuisine is high-end Northern Italian.', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/17/nyregion/17DINECT3/17DINECT3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/17/nyregion/17DINECT3/17DINECT3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/17/nyregion/17DINECT3/17DINECT3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/17/nyregion/17DINECT3/17DINECT3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/17/nyregion/17DINECT3/17DINECT3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/17/nyregion/17DINECT3/