ormer governor, who was convicted in 2007, was pardoned this week.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/16/world/africa/us-embassy-criticizes-pardons-in-nigeria-corruption-cases.html', 'snippet': 'The United States Embassy said it was “deeply disappointed” after a former governor, who was convicted in 2007, was pardoned this week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ABUJA, Nigeria — Convictions for corruption by top officials in Nigeria are so rare that they are treated as national milestones. So when the government rolled back one of the most prominent of them this week, the shock was commensurate.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Embassy Criticizes Pardons in Nigerian Corruption Cases', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Embassy Criticizes Pardons In Nigerian Corruption Cases', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ALAMIEYESEIGHA, DIEPREYE', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Nigeria', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ribadu, Nuhu', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corruption (Institutional)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Amnesties, Commutations and Pardons', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-16T01:50:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam Nossiter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nossiter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/49e9be27-99d0-579e-a124-f50a91376567', 'word_count': 675, 'uri': 'nyt://article/49e9be27-99d0-579e-a124-f50a91376567'}, {'abstract': 'Atsuko Tanaka’s high standards have made her the stylist of choice for some well-off ultra-Orthodox Jewish women, who often invest thousands in a wig.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/17/nyregion/for-ultra-orthodox-clients-atsuko-tanaka-puts-every-wig-hair-in-place.html', 'snippet': 'Atsuko Tanaka’s high standards have made her the stylist of choice for some well-off ultra-Orthodox Jewish women, who often invest thousands in a wig.', 'lead_paragraph': '“If life was fair, I’d be 5 foot 5,” Atsuko Tanaka said as she fondled a thick strand of hair and worked it over with a comb and blow dryer. Even with the stylist chair set to its lowest level, and standing on tiptoes, Ms. Tanaka had trouble styling the higher regions of the client’s head.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/17/nyregion/17CHARACTER_SPAN/17CHARACTER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/17/nyregion/17CHARACTER_SPAN/17CHARACTER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/17/nyregion/17CHARACTER_SPAN/17CHARACTER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/17/nyregion/17CHARACTER_SPAN/17CHARACTER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/17/nyregion/17CHARACTER_SPAN/17CHARACTER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thu