nts-seek-a-home/', 'snippet': 'On the crowded fourth floor of a Manhattan building, residents’ lives were upended when officials ordered occupants to leave because of safety violations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The accommodations on the fourth floor of 81 Bowery were meager and tight: dozens of people, mostly new Chinese immigrants ranging in age from 19 to 88, crammed into small cubicles, sharing a bathroom. But for people with little money and nowhere to stay, like Zhu Benjin, 52, a construction worker, the closet-size cubicles were home.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ousted by the City, Tenants Seek a Home', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ousted by the City, Tenants Seek a Home', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bowery (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-16T11:00:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeffrey E. Singer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeffrey', 'middlename': 'E.', 'lastname': 'Singer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f1780e1c-22c2-5a52-b8cd-61b4b3488bfb', 'word_count': 376, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f1780e1c-22c2-5a52-b8cd-61b4b3488bfb'}, {'abstract': 'How one New York City high school was split into nine in the same building.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2013/03/17/nyregion/from-one-school-nine-experiments.html', 'snippet': 'How one New York City high school was split into nine in the same building.', 'lead_paragraph': 'How one New York City high school was split into nine in the same building