igns to avoid what it calls “adverse consequences in times of emergency.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/16/blogs/16rdv-apostophe/16rdv-apostophe-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 223, 'width': 329, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/16/blogs/16rdv-apostophe/16rdv-apostophe-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 223, 'width': 329, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/16/blogs/16rdv-apostophe/16rdv-apostophe-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/16/blogs/16rdv-apostophe/16rdv-apostophe-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Dropped Apostrophes Spark Grammar War in Britain', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Grammar', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shaw, George Bernard', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'England', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-16T14:32:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Harvey Morris', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Harvey', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Morris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9388c06e-44cb-5cf8-b73d-925eb5e9aae2', 'word_count': 540, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9388c06e-44cb-5cf8-b73d-925eb5e9aae2'}, {'abstract': 'Marc Staal, who is recovering from being hit in the eye with a puck, will not play when the Rangers host the Hurricanes and his brothers Eric and Jordan on Monday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/17/sports/hockey/with-marc-staal-injured-brothers-reunion-on-ice-will-have-to-wait.html', 'snippet': 'Marc Staal, who is recovering from being hit in the eye with a puck, will not play when the Rangers host the Hurricanes and his brothers Eric and Jordan on Monday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'RALEIGH, N.C. — Eric Staal noticed the date as soon as the N.H.L. schedule was released in January. On March 18, the Carolina Hurricanes were set to play the Rangers at Madison Square Garden.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/17/sports/dog-staal-3/dog-staal-3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/17/sports/dog-staal-3/dog-staal-3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 800}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/17/sports/dog-staal-3/dog-staal-3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/17/sports/dog-staal-3/dog-staal-3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1536, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/17/sports/dog-staal-3/dog-staal-3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/17/sports/dog-staal-3/dog-staal-3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 7