es.com/2013/03/18/movies/108-cuchillo-de-palo-directed-by-renate-costa.html', 'snippet': 'In “108 (Cuchillo de Palo)” Renate Costa investigates the secret life of her gay uncle, who had mysteriously amassed a fortune in Paraguay.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The style is simple but the emotions highly sophisticated in “108 (Cuchillo de Palo),” Renate Costa’s insistently prodding documentary about the secret life of her gay uncle, Rodolfo Costa, under the oppressive government of the Paraguayan dictator Alfredo Stroessner.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/18/arts/oneoeight/oneoeight-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 757, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/18/arts/oneoeight/oneoeight-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 757}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/18/arts/oneoeight/oneoeight-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 858, 'width': 680, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/18/arts/oneoeight/oneoeight-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 858, 'width': 680, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/18/arts/oneoeight/oneoeight-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/18/arts/oneoeight/oneoeight-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/18/arts/oneoeight/oneoeight-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width