, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e11c8701-7ba0-50e1-bcdc-799e0de81b68'}, {'abstract': 'The Clippers did not re-sign Kenyon Martin after last season, and despite their 93-80 win Sunday, he says their style still is not made for the playoffs.', 'web_url': 'https://offthedribble.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/17/clippers-whip-knicks-but-martin-remains-unimpressed/', 'snippet': 'The Clippers did not re-sign Kenyon Martin after last season, and despite their 93-80 win Sunday, he says their style still is not made for the playoffs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — In a three-minute postgame interview Sunday, Knicks forward Kenyon Martin indicated his bitterness toward the Los Angeles Clippers, his former team. And he did not give the Clippers much credit for their 93-80 win over the Knicks at the Staples Center.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Clippers Whip Knicks, but Martin Remains Unimpressed', 'kicker': 'Off the Dribble', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Martin, Kenyon', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Los Angeles Clippers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Knicks', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-18T01:30:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nate Taylor', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Taylor', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6988b8e3-5bfd-5fa1-ad10-51f09a64e7a3', 'word_count': 468, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6988b8e3-5bfd-5fa1-ad10-51f09a64e7a3'}, {'abstract': 'Lt. Gov. Jennifer Carroll’s ties to Gov. Rick Scott were seen as strained well before news broke that she had been caught up in a criminal investigation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/18/us/jennifer-carroll-resignation-preceded-by-tensions-with-rick-scott.html', 'snippet': 'Lt. Gov. Jennifer Carroll’s ties to Gov. Rick Scott were seen as strained well before news broke that she had been caught up in a criminal investigation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TALLAHASSEE, Fla. — As the annual press corps political roast unfolded here on Tuesday evening, Gov. Rick Scott stared stone-faced, holding a secret, while he watched a reporter spoof his strained relationship with his lieutenant governor, Jennifer Carroll.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/18/us/CARROLL/CARROLL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 782, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/18/us/CARROLL/CARROLL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 782}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/18/us/CARROLL/CARROLL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 787, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/18/us/CARROLL/CARROLL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1573, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/18/us/CARROLL/CARROLL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/18/us/CARROLL/CARROLL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'typ