perbole, was at it again this month when he fumed that New York State’s guarantee to shelter the homeless means “you can arrive in your private jet at Kennedy Airport, take a private limousine and go straight to the shelter system, and walk in the door and we’ve got to give you shelter.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'City’s Sheltering of Out-of-Town Homeless, and Mayor’s Remark, Stir Debate', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'City’s Sheltering of Out-of-Town Homeless, and Mayor’s Remark, Stir Debate', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homeless Persons', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Coalition for the Homeless', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Homeless Services Department (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-18T02:07:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Roberts', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Roberts', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/44311295-afd5-5989-a68e-83b7a42ea109', 'word_count': 854, 'uri': 'nyt://article/44311295-afd5-5989-a68e-83b7a42ea109'}, {'abstract': 'If the ups and downs in the rankings during the regular season foreshadow the next three weeks, the N.C.A.A. tournament will be full of upsets and uncertainty.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/18/sports/ncaabasketball/field-is-wide-open-in-ncaa-basketball-tournament.html', 'snippet': 'If the ups and downs in the rankings during the regular season foreshadow the nex