ring after 40 seasons as coach of Boston University’s men’s hockey team, got his 895th victory at B.U. in his final home game.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/18/sports/hockey/coach-jack-parker-nears-finish-line-at-boston-university.html', 'snippet': 'Jack Parker, who is retiring after 40 seasons as coach of Boston University’s men’s hockey team, got his 895th victory at B.U. in his final home game.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BOSTON — The man at the wake for the father of the future Boston University hockey coach Jack Parker quietly approached Parker’s mother to offer his condolences. He also offered something more: cash.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/18/sports/PARKER2/PARKER2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 301, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/18/sports/PARKER2/PARKER2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 301}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/18/sports/PARKER2/PARKER2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 514, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/18/sports/PARKER2/PARKER2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1028, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/18/sports/PARKER2/PARKER2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/18/sports/PARKER2/PARKER2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': Non