 {'abstract': 'Lessons from a 12-year-old boy who took in the world by his own measure.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/18/up-here-on-this-island/', 'snippet': 'Lessons from a 12-year-old boy who took in the world by his own measure.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The boy banged his thigh into the corner of the table, stopped mid-stride, grimaced, and the way you’d say godDAMmit, he said: johnHANcock! Then, because he knew that in the special school there was an expectation of a show of normality, he said: You’re probably wondering why I said that, but you wouldn’t understand.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Up Here on This Island', 'kicker': 'Anxiety', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Anxiety and Stress', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Autism', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-12)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-18T11:00:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Dow', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dow', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c93c0d1f-9b75-5cef-8fd5-c4bffe009e6b', 'word_count': 1482, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c93c0d1f-9b75-5cef-8fd5-c4bffe009e6b'}, {'abstract': 'Kenya needs to end a political culture that treats state resources as a winner’s preserve rather than national assets benefitting all citizens equally.', 'web_url': 'https://latitude.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/18/kenyans-try-to-move-on-from-another-election-debacle/', 'snippet': 'Kenya needs to end a political culture that treats state resources as a winner’s preserve rather than national assets benefitting all citizens equally.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NAIROBI — For a ringside seat on the spectacle of Kenyan democracy’s turbulent workings, I’d recommend Dormans on Mama Ngina Street. I had just ordered an espresso at the café, around the corner from the Supreme Court, on Saturday when the mood on this normally bustling street suddenly turned.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'How the Other Half Thinks', 'kicker': 'Latitude', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kenyatta, Uhuru Muigai', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Odinga, Raila', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kenya', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-18T11:10:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michela Wrong', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michela', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wrong', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8bea0b73-1e98-5267-93d5-a6c2856ace92', 'word_count': 717, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8bea0b73-1e98-5267-93d5-a6c2856ace92'}, {'abstract': 'A review of the Republican Party’s 2012 election efforts called for improving the way the party talks about its ideas, turns out potential voters and raises money.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/19/us/politics/republicans-plan-overhaul-for-2016-primary-season.html', 'snippet': 'A review of the Republican Party’s 2012 election efforts called for improving the way the party talks about its ideas, turns out potential voters and raises money.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Republican leaders on Monday offered a sweeping self-critique of a party they said was in an “ideological cul-de-sac” and needed better outreach and a new brand of conservatism to appeal to younger voters, ethnic minorities and women.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/19/us/REPUBS/REPUBS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 537, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/19/us/REPUBS/REPUBS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 537}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/19/us/REPUBS/REPUBS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 916, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/19/us/REPUBS/REPUBS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1832, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/19/us/REPUBS/REPUBS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/19/us/REPUBS/REPUBS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/19/us/REPUBS/REPUBS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Blunt Report Says G.O.P. Needs to Regroup for ’16', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Blunt Report Says G.O.P. Needs to Regroup for ’16', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wheaton, Sarah', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizat