e web site JewelMint brings high-end designers to a lower price point.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/18/philip-crangi-for-jewelmint/', 'snippet': 'A new series by the web site JewelMint brings high-end designers to a lower price point.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For its inaugural Studio Series, JewelMint tapped the CFDA designer Philip Crangi to create a limited-edition collection, which makes its debut online today. Though Crangi says that all of the pieces are original and exclusive to JewelMint, G&B x JM looks like it was plucked right from his classic collection of Giles & Brother. “I work from this group of references that I think keeps the continuum going with Giles & Brother,” he says about the tribal and equestrian influences on his etched brass and rose gold designs.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Philip Crangi for JewelMint', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Favorite Themes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Design', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Council of Fashion Designers of America', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'JewelMint.com', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-18T17:45:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alainna Lexie Beddie', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alainna', 'middlename': 'Lexie', 'lastname': 'Beddie', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ac32759c-3d3d-507f-af39-90f95687c7be', 'word_count': 152, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ac32759c-3d3d-507f-af39-90f95687c7be'}, {'abstract': 'Hundreds of arrests planned in Indian police crackdown.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/18/tamil