', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Boys’ Club: Spring’s New Haircut', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hair', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-18T18:48:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bee-Shyuan Chang', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bee-shyuan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Chang', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7f98eec0-fe53-5a67-aa43-de2e63184f95', 'word_count': 533, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7f98eec0-fe53-5a67-aa43-de2e63184f95'}, {'abstract': 'The Nets could have pulled into a virtual tie with the Knicks for the division lead with a win on Sunday night. They now have to try to gain ground on the road.', 'web_url': 'https://offthedribble.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/18/no-time-to-lament-as-nets-face-8-game-trip/', 'snippet': 'The Nets could have pulled into a virtual tie with the Knicks for the division lead with a win on Sunday night. They now have to try to gain ground on the road.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There is no shame in dropping a game to the Atlanta Hawks, even at home, but the Nets projected disappointment in the way they competed Sunday night in a puzzling 105-93 loss that bore a number of implications for playoff seeding.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'No Time to Lament as Nets Face 8-Game Trip', 'kicker': 'Off the Dribble', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Joe', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wallace, Gerald', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, De