bin Pogrebin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pogrebin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/89bc1c51-6fe6-578c-b114-253cd9233e84', 'word_count': 208, 'uri': 'nyt://article/89bc1c51-6fe6-578c-b114-253cd9233e84'}, {'abstract': 'A randomized trial suggests that vitamin D supplements may help lower blood pressure in African-Americans, a group with high rates of hypertension.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/18/vitamin-d-may-lower-blood-pressure-in-blacks/', 'snippet': 'A randomized trial suggests that vitamin D supplements may help lower blood pressure in African-Americans, a group with high rates of hypertension.', 'lead_paragraph': 'African-Americans have significantly higher rates of hypertension, and lower blood levels of vitamin D, than the rest of the population. Now a randomized trial suggests that vitamin D supplements may help lower blood pressure.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/04/26/health/well-regimens/well-regimens-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 233, 'width': 225, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/04/26/health/well-regimens/well-regimens-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 233, 'width': 225, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/04/26/health/well-regimens/well-regimens-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/04/26/health/well-regimens/well-regimens-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/04/26/health/well-regimens/well-regimens-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Vitamin D May Lower Blood Pressure in Blacks', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blood Pressure', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hypertension', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vitamin D', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vitamins', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-18T19:24:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas Bakalar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bakalar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/28d16f5b-c64d-5cae-ab0f-e7e0ee795a3f', 'word_count': 206, 'uri': 'nyt://article/28d16f5b-c64d-5cae-ab0f-e7e0ee795a3f'}, {'abstract': 'Transferring loan balances to a zero percent interest credit card may seem to be a good idea, but it may come at a cost.', 'web_url': 'https://bucks.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/18/the-risks-of-transferring-a-car-loan-to-a-credit-card/', 'snippet': 'Transferring loan balances to a zero percent interest credit card may seem to be a good idea, but it may come at a cost.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The credit card site CardHub.com recently reviewed current zero-balance credit card transfer offers and found that many cards let consumers transfer all sorts of debt — not just credit card debt — onto the new