signed by Philippe Starck, the $400 Parrot Zik is a luxurious combination of sleek chrome and soft, synthetic leather. But the headphones are not just visually appealing. They also come with a host of smart features to adjust the volume, make ha...', 'lead_paragraph': 'The French technology company Parrot is known primarily for its hands-free systems for cars, but it has added to its lineup a pair of wireless headphones that blend design and comfort with some very clever features.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Elegant Headphones, Crammed With Features', 'kicker': 'Gadgetwise', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Headphones Mix Style, Comfort and Features', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Headphones and Headsets', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Parrot SA', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-18T21:15:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gregory Schmidt', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gregory', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schmidt', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3bc3a4e0-22df-5d4f-96fa-2026b452289d', 'word_count': 382, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3bc3a4e0-22df-5d4f-96fa-2026b452289d'}, {'abstract': 'Cavalli’s “Eliogabalo” turns a debauched Roman emperor into a glam-rock idol in Gotham Chamber Opera’s production at the Box.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/19/arts/music/cavallis-eliogabalo-by-gotham-chamber-opera-at-the-box.html', 'snippet': 'Cavalli’s “Eliogabalo” turns a debauched Roman emperor into a glam-rock idol in Gotham Chamber Opera’s production at the Box.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A maniacal, lecherous, cross-dressing emperor hosts a b