/asia/un-rights-council-to-vote-on-resolution-on-sri-lanka.html', 'snippet': 'The resolution urges Sri Lanka to investigate allegations of mass civilian slaughter in the army campaign that crushed a rebel group in May 2009.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GENEVA — The United Nations Human Rights Council is preparing to vote this week on a resolution that urges Sri Lanka to deliver on its promises to investigate allegations of mass civilian slaughter in the army campaign that crushed a rebel group in May 2009, and expresses growing international concern over a lengthy catalog of continuing atrocities. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.N. Rights Council to Vote on Resolution on Sri Lanka', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.N. Rights Council to Vote on Resolution on Sri Lanka', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations Human Rights Council', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sri Lanka', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civilian Casualties', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Liberation Tigers of Tamil Eelam', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rajapaksa, Mahinda', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-18T22:34:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nick Cumming-Bruce', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cumming-Bruce', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d95aebdf-e65a-5293-9110-f17a62907715', 'word_count': 985, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d95aebdf-e65a-5293-9110-f17a62907715'}, {'abstract': 'Tw