One Vote (or Was That One Voter One Vote?)', 'kicker': 'Sidebar', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'One Person One Vote (or Was That One Voter One Vote?)', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voting and Voters', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Court', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Irving (Tex)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Texas', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voter Registration and Requirements', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-19T03:33:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam Liptak', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Liptak', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2d2abe34-4b3c-500f-9470-241950fd9b4e', 'word_count': 902, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2d2abe34-4b3c-500f-9470-241950fd9b4e'}, {'abstract': 'A boomer who baby-sits for a 5-year-old finds that playing “Egypt” is fun, but that it is also common ground for secular and religious Jews.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/19/booming/in-the-song-of-egypt-a-chord-for-both-secular-and-religious-jews.html', 'snippet': 'A boomer who baby-sits for a 5-year-old finds that playing “Egypt” is fun, but that it is also common ground for secular and religious Jews.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hanina, the 5-year-old I baby-sit, loves to play “pretend.” When we come up with a story he enjoys, we play it over and over. Small children love repetition — if it’s fun the first time, it’ll be fun the second! (And the 22nd!) Hanina’s favorite books inspire many of our games. I can’t count the number of times we’ve ridden the Magic School Bus as it made its interminable, fact-filled way through the local water works or blasted into outer space. Other games, like a recent one featuring a marauding army of killer cannibal princesses, Hanina dreams up on his own.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/19/booming/19mystory-booming-passover/19mystory-booming-passover-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/19/booming/19mystory-booming-passover/19mystory-booming-passover-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 396}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/19/booming/19mystory-booming-passover/19mystory-booming-passover-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 676, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/19/booming/19mystory-booming-passover/19mystory-booming-passover-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 984, 'width': 1491, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/19/booming/19mystory-booming-passover/19mystory-booming-passover-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/19/booming/19mystory-booming-passover/19mystory-booming-passover-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/19/booming/19mystory-booming-passover/19mystory-booming-passover-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In the Song of Egypt,  a Chord for Both Secu