itics-had-prevailed/', 'snippet': 'Defending Britain’s participation in the American-led invasion of Iraq, former Prime Minister Tony Blair told the BBC that Iraq “would look a lot more like Syria, and probably a lot worse than Syria,” today if the war had not taken place.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Defending Britain’s participation in the American-led invasion of Iraq, former Prime Minister Tony Blair told the BBC that Iraq “would look a lot more like Syria, and probably a lot worse than Syria,” today if the war had not taken place. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Blair Says Iraq Would Be ‘Worse Than Syria’ Now, if Antiwar Critics Had Prevailed', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Iraq War (2003-11)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Blair, Tony', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hussein, Saddam', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-19T17:21:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Mackey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mackey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/780fdc06-4088-5608-b6dd-5dd3a2e6473e', 'word_count': 494, 'uri': 'nyt://article/780fdc06-4088-5608-b6dd-5dd3a2e6473e'}, {'abstract': 'Spam texts can be both annoying and misdirected.', 'web_url': 'https://bucks.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/19/spam-texts-vex-me-and-make-me-feel-old/', 'snippet': 'Spam texts can be both annoying and misdirected.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I haven’t lived in Atlanta for several years. But my cellphone, which still has an Atlanta phone number, apparently maintains a very active social life there. Every weekend it gets invitations to wild parties throughout the city, including a hip place called “The Mansion Elan.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Spam Texts Vex Me and Make Me Feel Old', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cellular Telephones', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parties (Social)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Spam (Electronic)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Text Messaging', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-19T17:22:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ann Carrns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ann', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carrns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3b8bfc83-97a7-57e6-8107-d1e4e5afe616', 'word_count': 546, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3b8bfc83-97a7-57e6-8107-d1e4e5afe616'}, {'abstract': 'Though there is a verdict in the Steubenville case, we’re a long way from the end of the culture that allowed it to happen.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/19/raising-children-who-will-speak-up-to-prevent-rape-not-defend-it/', 'snippet': 'Though there is a verdict in the Steubenville case, we’re a long way from the end of the culture that allowed it to happen.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I spent Sunday morning at a birthday party for one of my son’s classmates. As the kids gathered around a paper-covered table to begin an art project, I stood off to the side, furiously typing away on my phone as I scoured my Twitter feed for news of the verdict in the Steubenville rape case.', 'source': 'The New York 