resemble the ones that melted down in Japan two years ago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Nuclear Regulatory Commission voted 3 to 2 on Tuesday to require improvements to the emergency vents at 31 American reactors that share design similarities with the Japanese reactors that melted down two years ago. The agency stopped short, however, of requiring filters to scrub out radioactive particles coming through those vents. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'N.R.C. Votes for Upgrades to Some Reactor Vents', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'N.R.C. Votes for Upgrades To Reactors Like Japan’s', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fukushima Daiichi Nuclear Power Plant (Japan)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Energy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Filters', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nuclear Regulatory Commission', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Japan Earthquake and Tsunami (2011)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-20T00:25:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Energy & Environment ', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matthew L. Wald', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matthew', 'middlename': 'L.', 'lastname': 'Wald', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8407d2a8-3fcf-564f-87cf-34bb32a28e2a', 'word_count': 290, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8407d2a8-3fcf-564f-87cf-34bb32a28e2a'}, {'abstract': 'Center Brittney Griner, who has improved her technique and composure, is the star attraction on a Baylor team that is confident it will return to the Final Four.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/20/sports/ncaabasketball/brittney-griners-final-season-draws-applause-and-crowds.html', 'snippet': 'Center Brittney Griner, who has improved her technique and composure, is the star attraction on a Baylor team that is confident it will return to the Final Four.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WACO, Tex. — Just in case anyone doubted Baylor’s confident intent to reach the women’s Final Four in New Orleans, Coach Kim Mulkey wore a fleur-de-lis on her T-shirt as she watched the tournament pairings, while some fans wore Mardi Gras beads and sang, “When the Saints Go Marching In.”', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/20/sports/SUB-JPGRINER/SUB-JPGRINER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 381, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/20/sports/SUB-JPGRINER/SUB-JPGRINER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 381}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/20/sports/SUB-JPGRINER/SUB-JPGRINER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 650, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/20/sports/SUB-JPGRINER/SUB-JPGRINER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1300, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/20/sports/SUB-JPGRINER/SUB-JPGRINER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/20/sports/SUB-JPGRINER/SUB-JPGRINER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailhe