ine': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ca06ddb0-dbbd-5ea1-ab00-8efe8cb38cec', 'word_count': 415, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ca06ddb0-dbbd-5ea1-ab00-8efe8cb38cec'}, {'abstract': 'Would you pay $2.2 million for this business?', 'web_url': 'https://boss.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/20/business-for-sale-a-long-haul-trucking-company/', 'snippet': 'Would you pay $2.2 million for this business?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Let’s take a look at another business for sale. And once again, we’ll consider the business from the point of view of a potential buyer, but we will also see what lessons this business might hold for owners of other businesses.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Business for Sale: A Long-Haul Trucking Company', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Trucks and Trucking', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Small Business Administration', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-20T11:00:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Josh Patrick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Josh', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Patrick', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/52a863b1-6f24-5166-ba78-5182e39ad914', 'word_count': 962, 'uri': 'nyt://article/52a863b1-6f24-5166-ba78-5182e39ad914'}, {'abstract': 'For Kilian Jornet, running across the Pyrenees is like a jog in the park. What one elite endurance athlete can tell us about the human body’s potential.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/24/magazine/creating-the-all-terrain-human.html', 'snippet': 'For Kilian Jornet, running across the Pyrenees is like a jog in the park. What one elite endurance athlete can tell us about the human body’s potential.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Kilian Jornet Burgada is the most dominating endurance athlete of his generation. In just eight years, Jornet has won more than 80 races, claimed some 16 titles and set at least a dozen speed records, many of them in distances that would require the rest of us to purchase an airplane ticket. He has run across entire landmasses\xad (Corsica) and mountain ranges (the Pyrenees), nearly without pause. He regularly runs all day eating only wild berries and drinking only from streams. On summer mornings he will set off from his apartment door at the foot of Mont Blanc and run nearly two and a half vertical miles up to Europe’s roof — over cracked glaciers, past Gore-Tex’d climbers, into the thin air at 15,781 feet — and back home again in less than seven hours, a trip that mountaineers can spend days to complete. A few years ago Jornet ran the 165-mile Tahoe Rim Trail and stopped just twice to sleep on the ground for a total of about 90 minutes. In the middle of the night he took a wrong turn, which added perhaps six miles to his run. He still finished in 38 hours 32 minutes, beating the record of Tim Twietmeyer, a legend in the world of ultrarunning, by more than seven hours. When he reached the finish line, he looked as if he’d just won the local turkey trot.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '42', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/magazine/24jornet3/24jornet3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/24/magazine/24jornet3/24jornet3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/magazine/24jornet3/24jornet3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/magazine/24jornet3/24jornet3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1500, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/magazine/24jornet3/24jornet3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/24/magazine/24jornet3/24jornet3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/magazine/24jornet3/24jornet3-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Becoming the All-Terrain Human', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'All-Terrain Human', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jornet Burgada, Kilian', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Solomon, Christopher', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Running', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Skiing', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chamonix-Mont-Blanc (France)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Athletics and Sports', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-20T11:01:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christopher Solomon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christopher', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Solomon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8b1d9bf2-44cb-5543-b886-8e9628f401b2', 'word_count': 3250, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8b1d9bf2-44cb-5543-b886-8e9628f401b2'}, {'abstract': 'The United Nations is marking March 20 as a day on which to highlight the links between happiness and world development. Does that make you happy, or do you think the U.N. has better things to do?', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/20/happy-international-happiness-day/', 'snippet': 'The United Nations is marking March 20 as a day on which to highlight the links between happiness and world development. Does that make you happy, or do you think the U.N. has better things to do?', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON – If you want to avoid the risk of being accosted by total strangers urging you to “be happy,” you should probably stay home on Wednesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/20/blogs/20rdv-happiness/20rdv-happiness-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 317, 'width': 313, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/20/blogs/20rdv-happiness/20rdv-happiness-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 317, 'width': 313, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/20/blogs/20rdv-happiness/20rdv-happiness-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/20/blogs/20rdv-happiness/