d Collins on the R.N.C.’s candid report, the philosophy of Ted Cruz and the emergence of Rand Paul.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gail Collins: David, I recall that during the presidential primaries, you worried that the Republicans would nominate Mitt Romney, that Romney would lose and then the Tea Party would beat its chest and say that the only road to victory was through the far right. Last weekend, Senator Ted Cruz told a convention of conservatives: “We’re winning!” It made me think about what a good predictor you are.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Republicans Ask Themselves What Went Wrong', 'kicker': 'The Conversation', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2016', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cotton, Tom', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cruz, Ted', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Palin, Sarah', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Paul, Rand', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican National Committee', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-20T17:12:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Brooks and Gail Collins', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Brooks', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Gail', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Collins', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a962c19a-b9fa-5fc5-b87f-d89338ddd434', 'w