and physics is to be announced by the University of California at San Diego this week. The new network is part of a move toward an era when networks will move trillions of bits per second.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/20/a-big-data-freeway-for-scientists/', 'snippet': 'A “Big Data freeway system” for future science projects in fields including genomic sequencing, climate science and physics is to be announced by the University of California at San Diego this week. The new network is part of a move toward an era ...', 'lead_paragraph': 'The University of California, San Diego, this week plans to announce that it has installed an advanced optical computer network that is intended to serve as a “Big Data freeway system” for next-generation science projects in fields including genomic sequencing, climate science, electron microscopy, oceanography and physics.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A ‘Big Data’ Freeway for Scientists', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A ‘Freeway’\r\nFor Big Data', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Laboratories and Scientific Equipment', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Science and Technology', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Arista Networks', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of California, San Diego', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'San Diego (Calif)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-20T17:29:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Markoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Markoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', '