, {'abstract': 'Pictures of Azzedine Alaïa’s latest collection don’t adequately capture the three-dimensional quality of the knitting.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/20/azzedine-alaa-longer-and-shaping-up-for-a-big-year/', 'snippet': 'Pictures of Azzedine Alaïa’s latest collection don’t adequately capture the three-dimensional quality of the knitting.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Pictures of Azzedine Alaïa’s latest collection don’t adequately capture the three-dimensional quality of the knitting. Polka dots on a baby-doll dress, shown with matched leggings, are actually raised, like embroidery, and a series of vertically striped dresses are in fact ribbons of lacework backed by a shimmery knit. Other sophisticated techniques include honeycomb pleating, and most of the garments have a minimum number of seams. It’s remarkable what Mr. Alaïa is able to express through one form.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Azzedine Alaïa: Longer, and Shaping Up for a Big Year', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Alaia, Azzedine', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Musee Galliera', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-20T17:52:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cathy Horyn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cathy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Horyn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8f758dc7-2dff-58b6-885e-db5413c0bacf', 'word_count': 273, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8f758dc7-2dff-58b6-885e-db5413c0bacf'}, {'abstract': 'President Obama’s remarks represented both an effort to warn Syria’s government of the consequences of using its chemical arsenal and to signal support for Israel, the main point of his trip there.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/21/world/middleeast/syria-developments.html', 'snippet': 'President Obama’s remarks represented both an effort to warn Syria’s government of the consequences of using its chemical arsenal and to signal support for Israel, the main point of his trip there.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JERUSALEM — Showing solidarity with Israel’s growing concern about chemical weapons in neighboring Syria, President Obama stated bluntly on Wednesday that if an investigation he had ordered found proof that the Syrian military had used such weapons it would be a “game changer” in American involvement in the civil war there.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/21/world/Syria/Syria-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 373, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/21/world/Syria/Syria-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 373}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/21/world/Syria/Syria-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 636, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/21/world/Syria/Syria-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1272, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/21/world/Syria/Syria-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 