in era.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/21/books/its-no-good-by-kirill-medvedev.html', 'snippet': 'In “It’s No Good,” Kirill Medvedev turns a pitiless lens on intellectual corruption in Russia in the Putin era.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The feminist Russian punk band Pussy Riot, some of its members recently imprisoned, stands for many things, notably opposition to the policies of Vladimir Putin. One of its best-known songs contains the line “Virgin birth-giver of God, drive away Putin!” Another is titled, depending on the translation, “Putin Is Wetting Himself.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/21/arts/book/book-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 624, 'width': 511, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/21/arts/book/book-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 624, 'width': 511, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/21/arts/book/book-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/21/arts/book/book-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/21/arts/book/book-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Litany of Betrayals, Petty Yet Terrifying', 'kicker': 'Books of The Times', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Litany of Betrayals, Petty Yet Terrifying', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Garner, Dwight', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'n+1', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Medvedev, Kirill', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-20T20:16:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Books', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dwight Garner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dwight', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Garner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/78aed231-4d6d-545d-8715-f1b4d7278c6e', 'word_count': 871, 'uri': 'nyt://article/78aed231-4d6d-545d-8715-f1b4d7278c6e'}, {'abstract': 'The Devils may not be doing so well on the ice recently, but their ticket sales are on the upswing.', 'web_url': 'https://slapshot.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/20/devils-enjoying-surge-in-attendance/', 'snippet': 'The Devils may not be doing so well on the ice recently, but their ticket sales are on the upswing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Devils have won only three of their last 10 games, but they are on a more successful run at the box office. Including Wednesday night’s game against the Rangers at the Prudential Center in Newark, the Devils have sold out 14 of their last 16 home games this season and 25 of the last 27 games stretching back to last season’s playoffs.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Devils Enjoying Surge in Attendance', 'kicker': 'Slap Shot', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vanderbeek, Jeffrey', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New Jersey Devils', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Newark (NJ)', 'rank': 4, 'major':