-clashing items. Next month in the United States, it will introduce a 50-piece collection of china in four motifs. The tableware, made by Vista Alegre in Portugal, features polychromatic butterflies, roughly painted black stripes, a floral mosaic and a 19th-century engraving of the ancient Roman arena in Arles. The bold consumer is encouraged to combine any or all of these patterns.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/21/garden/21GOODS/Curr-4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 590, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/21/garden/21GOODS/Curr-4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 590}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/21/garden/21GOODS/Curr-4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1006, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/21/garden/21GOODS/Curr-4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1992, 'width': 2027, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/21/garden/21GOODS/Curr-4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/21/garden/21GOODS/Curr-4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/21/garden/21GOODS/Curr-4-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'At the Table, a Touch of Couture', 'kicker': 'Current