eyes/', 'snippet': 'The Yankees are considering signing former pitcher Chien-Ming Wang, while their current pitcher, C. C. Sabathia, pitched in a minor league game.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TAMPA, Fla. — Away from the spotlight that is always there when the Yankees play the Red Sox, even if it is a spring training game, the team’s former and current pitching aces toiled under watchful eyes at the Yankees’ minor league training center Wednesday.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Yankees’ Aces Under Watchful Eyes', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Pair Of Aces', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sabathia, C C', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wang, Chien-Ming', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-21T01:12:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Kerasotis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kerasotis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e5dfbab1-e189-5a08-9052-04c33ce22f1b', 'word_count': 368, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e5dfbab1-e189-5a08-9052-04c33ce22f1b'}, {'abstract': 'Quarterback Eli Manning is willing to help the Giants reach a new contract with Victor Cruz, who had 10 touchdown catches last season.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/21/sports/football/giants-manning-open-to-redoing-his-deal-to-keep-cruz.html', 'snippet': 'Quarterback Eli Manning is willing to help the Giants reach a new contract with Victor Cruz, who had 10 touchdown catches last season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Eli Manning compiled roughly a quarter of his 3,948 passing yards last season on completions to Victor Cruz. Manning tossed 10 of his 26 touchdown passes to the salsa-dancing Cruz, too. Now, as Cruz’s status with the Giants remains at a contractual impasse, Manning has said he would be willing to sacrifice to keep Cruz as one of his top targets.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Manning Open to Redoing His Deal to Keep Cruz', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Manning Open to Redoing His Deal to Keep Cruz', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Borden, Sam', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Free Agents (Sports)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Manning, Eli', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cruz, Victor', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-21T01:16:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Borden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Borden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3e8806f2-bdc9-5fe5-9af7-b3724a09c00b', 'word_count': 311, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3e8806f2-bdc9-5fe5-9af7-b3724a09c00b'}, {'abstract': 'A foreigner accused of conspiring to attack American facilities in Nigeria is the latest example of defendants apprehended overseas and being extradited to federal courts in New York.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/21/nyregion/man-accused-of-plotting-terrorism-abroad.html', 'snippet': 'A foreigner a