imon & Garfunkel meant by “Sounds of Silence,” those sounds will now reverberate in perpetuity — whether silently or otherwise — along with works by Van Cliburn, Pink Floyd, the Ramones and many other artists whose musical creations will be added to the National Recording Registry of the Library of Congress.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Library of Congress Makes Room for Simon & Garfunkel, Van Cliburn and the Ramones', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cliburn, Van', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Library of Congress', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pink Floyd', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ramones', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-21T07:00:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/75859992-df08-54e0-9b42-c29a2c4cd0ce', 'word_count': 246, 'uri': 'nyt://article/75859992-df08-54e0-9b42-c29a2c4cd0ce'}, {'abstract': 'The troubled drug giant will pay a record initial payment of $240 million for access to Moderna Therapeutics’ new RNA technology.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/21/business/astrazeneca-to-pay-240-million-to-moderna-therapeutics.html', 'snippet': 'The troubled drug giant will pay a record initial payment of $240 million for access to Moderna Therapeutics’ new RNA technology.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The troubled drug giant AstraZeneca, which is overhauling its research operations, is betting at least $240 million that a novel but untested technology from a small biotechnology company can provide it with a huge array of new drugs. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'AstraZeneca Makes a Bet on an Untested Technique', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'AstraZeneca Makes a Bet On an Untested Technique', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pollack, Andrew', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Genetics and Heredity', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Clinical Trials', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AstraZeneca PLC', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Moderna Therapeutics', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-21T07:00:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Pollack', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pollack', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d4fcd944-0c41-5008-8f2d-a33da5e69eb5', 'word_count': 613, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d4fcd944-0c41-5008-8f2d-a33da5e69eb5'}, {'abstract': 'A decade after Iraq, the American foreign policy debate has devolved into an “invade or not invade” dichotomy and the news media is one-third the size of the public-relations industry.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/21/the-legacies-of-iraq-an-ailing-press-and-an-invade-or-nothing-foreign-policy/', 'snippet': 'A decade after Iraq, the American foreign policy debate has devolved into an “invade or not invade” dichotomy and the news media is one-third the size of the public-relations industry.', 'lead_paragraph': 'American households will be blanketed this week by a torrent of coverage, commentary and regret about the 10th anniversary of the Iraq war. Liberals claim that Twitter — if it had existed — could have stopped the invasion. Conservatives argue that the links between Saddam Hussein and terrorism have, in fact, been underplayed.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/21/blogs/21rdv-iraq-anniversary-rohde/21rdv-iraq-anniversary-rohde-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 368, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/21/blogs/21rdv-iraq-anniversary-rohde/21rdv-iraq-anniversary-rohde-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 368}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/21/blogs/21rdv-iraq-anniversary-rohde/21rdv-iraq-anniversary-rohde-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 628, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/21/blogs/21rdv-iraq-anniversary-rohde/21rdv-iraq-anniversary-rohde-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1257, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/21/blogs/21rdv-iraq-anniversary-rohde/21rdv-iraq-anniversary-rohde-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/21/blogs/21rdv-iraq-anniversary-rohde/21rdv-iraq-anniversary-rohde-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/21/blogs/21rdv-iraq-anniversary-rohde/21rdv