of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/971a12fd-d561-5e2f-82d1-dd0fc300de62', 'word_count': 1137, 'uri': 'nyt://article/971a12fd-d561-5e2f-82d1-dd0fc300de62'}, {'abstract': 'India’s normally slow-moving Parliament passed the bill just three months after the Delhi gang rape that sparked widespread protests.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/21/india-passes-sweeping-bill-on-crimes-against-women/', 'snippet': 'India’s normally slow-moving Parliament passed the bill just three months after the Delhi gang rape that sparked widespread protests.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW DELHI — Less than three months after a New Delhi woman who was gang raped on a moving bus died from her injuries, India’s Parliament passed a comprehensive bill that imposes stronger penalties on men who attack women and criminalizes offenses like stalking and voyeurism.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'India Passes Sweeping Bill on Crimes Against Women', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sexual Harassment', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stalking (Crime)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mukherjee, Pranab', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bharatiya Janata Party', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Human Rights Watch', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Indian National Congress', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Delhi (India)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'va