agraph': 'When Central Magnet High School opened in Bridgeport, Conn., almost 30 years ago, few of its students thought about applying to selective colleges. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Changing the Culture of College Application', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADMISSIONS STANDARDS', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-21T14:00:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Leonhardt', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Leonhardt', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f868bb8e-1ae8-5109-87e0-0399bb622aea', 'word_count': 642, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f868bb8e-1ae8-5109-87e0-0399bb622aea'}, {'abstract': 'A collection of links from the reporters and editors of the Dining section.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/21/what-were-reading-654/', 'snippet': 'A collection of links from the reporters and editors of the Dining section.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NPR: Parents worried about their children’s weight often give them low-fat milk. But studies show that preschoolers who drank it were heavier than those who consumed whole milk. – Patrick Farrell', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What We’re Reading', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-03-21T14:00:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person':