– the first warship sunk by an underwater explosive.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Rise of the ‘Infernal Machines’', 'kicker': 'Disunion', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civil War (US) (1861-65)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rivers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ships and Shipping', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Submarines and Submersibles', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Torpedoes', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-21T16:30:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Devin Poore', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Devin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Poore', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/12ec72f1-594d-57fc-a069-fabe4e5d4ad1', 'word_count': 1557, 'uri': 'nyt://article/12ec72f1-594d-57fc-a069-fabe4e5d4ad1'}, {'abstract': 'The Times’s Jodi Rudoren discusses President Obama’s visits with Israeli and Palestinian leaders.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/world/middleeast/100000002130059/face-to-face-talks.html', 'snippet': 'The Times’s Jodi Rudoren discusses President Obama’s visits with Israeli and Palestinian leaders.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Times’s Jodi Rudoren discusses President Obama’s visits with Israeli and Palestinian leaders.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/22/world/middleeast/22obama-speech/22obama-speech-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 337, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/22/world/middleeast/22obama-speech/22