Crave Fishbar, with its becalmed nautical décor and shipwreck theme, evokes the surprising pleasures of being marooned in Midtown.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/27/dining/reviews/hungry-city-crave-fishbar-in-midtown.html', 'snippet': 'Crave Fishbar, with its becalmed nautical décor and shipwreck theme, evokes the surprising pleasures of being marooned in Midtown.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE MENU AT Crave Fishbar reads like a come-on. First there is nori powder, a nutty dust with a fizz of brine; then vinegar made from fermented plantains; black garlic, syrupy and sour-sweet; burned lemon peel, a bartender’s trick, applying flame to make the oils caramelize; and schmaltz, rendered chicken fat, at once motherly and wanton.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/20/dining/20HUNGRY_SPAN/20HUNGRY_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 471, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/20/dining/20HUNGRY_SPAN/20HUNGRY_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 471}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/20/dining/20HUNGRY_SPAN/20HUNGRY_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 805, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/20/dining/20HUNGRY_SPAN/20HUNGRY_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1609, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/20/dining/20HUNGRY_SPAN/20HUNGRY_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/20