 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/fashion/24MODERNLOVE/0324MODERNLOVE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 848, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/fashion/24MODERNLOVE/0324MODERNLOVE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1696, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/fashion/24MODERNLOVE/0324MODERNLOVE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/24/fashion/24MODERNLOVE/0324MODERNLOVE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/fashion/24MODERNLOVE/0324MODERNLOVE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ready in Case the Other Shoe Should Drop', 'kicker': 'Modern Love', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ready in Case the Other Shoe Should Drop', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dating and Courtship', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Miller, Julia Anne', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Single Persons', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Love (Emotion)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Modern Love (Times Column)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-21T21:41:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julia Anne Miller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julia', 'middlename': 'Anne', 'lastname': 'Miller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2e86ad94-4366-5e51-9360-d42572ed45bf', 'word_count': 1475, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2e86ad94-4366-5e51-9360-d42572ed45bf'}, {'abstract': 'Many of the stories in this collection pursue the theme of infidelity.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/24/books/review/i-want-to-show-you-more-by-jamie-quatro.html', 'snippet': 'Many of the stories in this collection pursue the theme of infidelity.', 'lead_paragraph': 'First story collections, even good ones, tend to fall into two broad categories. On the one hand, there is the energetic but diffuse hodgepodge, the result, perhaps, of an eager mind fussing with the newly discovered tools of literary culture. Such books often contain a few terrific stories interspersed with failed experiments. On the other hand is the imitative, overly mannered matched set, wherein the author behaves like a traveler in a new country, trying to do as the natives do. Such a book may be skillfully made, but can feel staid or too careful.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/books/review/24LENNON/24LENNON-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 740, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/24/books/review/24LENNON/24LENNON-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 740}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/books/review/24LENNON/24LENNON-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 830, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/books/review/24LENNON/24LENNON-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1660,