 Congress has decided to keep the prison open indefinitely. That brings the potential taxpayer bill for upgrading the deteriorating complex to $195.7 million, a spokesman for the command said Thursday. That is notably higher than an estimate of $150 million to $170 million provided by Gen. John F. Kelly, the command’s leader, in Congressional testimony on Wednesday. The special facility was not included in a list of projects released by the Southern Command on Wednesday. The military has not given specifics about the facility, but it appears to be a replacement for Camp 7, which houses so-called high-value detainees like Khalid Shaikh Mohammed, the self-described architect of the Sept. 11 attacks. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Funds Sought for New Guantánamo Jail', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | Washington', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Funds Sought For New Guantánamo Jail', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Savage, Charlie', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Guantanamo Bay Naval Base (Cuba)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Detainees', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Southern Command', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kelly, John F (1950- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-22T03:06:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Charlie Savage', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Charlie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Savage', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/a2bb3ffa-8dd3-5c22-9b67-7cea618a982a', 'word_count': 142, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a2bb3ffa-8dd3-5c22-9b67-7cea618a982a'}, {'abstract': 'The No. 14-seeded Demons, averaging 81 points a game, face the third-seeded Florida Gators, who have allowed 53.7 points per game, third best in the nation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/22/sports/ncaabasketball/northwestern-state-to-face-florida-gators.html', 'snippet': 'The No. 14-seeded Demons, averaging 81 points a game, face the third-seeded Florida Gators, who have allowed 53.7 points per game, third best in the nation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AUSTIN, Tex. — For a window into Northwestern State’s soul, look at Coach Mike McConathy as a player. He was a high school star in Bossier Parish, La., and was such a potent scorer at Louisiana Tech that his name remains scattered throughout the university record book.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/22/sports/ncaabasketball/22austin1-img/22austin1-img-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 422, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/22/sports/ncaabasketball/22austin1-img/22austin1-img-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 422}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/22/sports/ncaabasketball/22austin1-img/22austin1-img-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 720, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/22/sports/ncaabasketball/22austin1-img/22austin1-img-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1439, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/22/sports/ncaabasketball/22au