 talent agent and a chief executive of William Morris Endeavor; Rahm, the mayor of Chicago; and Zeke, a bioethicist, fellow at the Hastings Center and the author of “Brothers Emanuel: A Memoir of an American Family.” Ted Koppel investigates children who are kept in solitary confinement in adult prisons. And Kiran Chetry visits with 15 sets of twins in Lebanon, Tenn., and wonders if there’s something in the water.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s On Friday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What’s On Today', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-03-22T05:00:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kathryn Shattuck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kathryn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shattuck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/f83e5a03-2134-5314-8cf3-4145565c5d8b', 'word_count': 736, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f83e5a03-2134-5314-8cf3-4145565c5d8b'}, {'abstract': 'Ten seasons after leaving Kansas, the North Carolina coach could face the Jayhawks in the Sprint Center pod.', 'web_url': 'https://thequad.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/22/roy-williams-is-ready-for-the-questions/', 'snippet': 'Ten seasons after leaving Kansas, the North Carolina coach could face the Jayhawks in the Sprint Center pod.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Roy Williams had his lines down. Ten seasons after leaving Kansas for North Carolina, Williams returns to Missouri with a chance for his team to meet up with the Jayhawks in the third round of the South Region. First, the eighth-seeded Tar Heels (24-10) must get by ninth-seeded Villanova (20-13) in Friday’s second round. Top seeded Kansas (29-5) opens with a No. 16 seed, Western Kentucky (20-15).', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/23/sports/ncaabasketball/23williams/23williams-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 392, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/23/sports/ncaabasketball/23williams/23williams-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 392}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/23/sports/ncaabasketball/23williams/23williams-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 669, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/23/sports/ncaabasketball/23williams/23williams-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1337, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/23/sports/ncaabasketball/23williams/23williams-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/23/sports/ncaabasketball/23williams/23williams-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/23/sports/ncaabasketball/23williams/23williams-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Roy Williams Is Ready for the Questions', 'kicker': 'The Quad', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'College Athletics', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Kansas', 'rank': 3, 'majo