 Her vision was shaped by her many subjects.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A blind man helped Gaia Squarci find the heart of her photography project documenting the lives of the sightless and visually impaired. Dale Layne was describing to her the onset of blindness, which he said was like seeing the world on a broken screen that fragments, then eventually obliterates, reality.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Guided by Blindness', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'World of Blindness Through a Lens', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-03-22T09:00:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Gonzalez', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gonzalez', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0e419beb-3a77-5956-acdb-b6e1073d9410', 'word_count': 812, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0e419beb-3a77-5956-acdb-b6e1073d9410'}, {'abstract': 'With the Steubenville rape case and others in the news this week, tell us how you have reacted to what you have read and heard, and what you think could, or should, be done to fight sexual violence.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/22/what-should-we-do-to-fight-sexual-violence-against-young-women/', 'snippet': 'With the Steubenville rape case and others in the news this week, tell us how you have reacted to what you have read and heard, and what you think could, or should, be done to fight sexual violence.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This week the Steubenville, Ohio, rape case has been in the news, while in Connecticut arrests have been made involving claims that athletes at a high school sexually assaulted 13-year-old girls. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedi