pe_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1285462c-6cff-5fb2-8655-771886963033', 'word_count': 1184, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1285462c-6cff-5fb2-8655-771886963033'}, {'abstract': 'As the music world observes the bicentenaries of Wagner and Verdi’s births, it may be instructive to chart the influence of Beethoven’s music over both.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/24/arts/music/did-beethoven-mold-verdi-and-wagner.html', 'snippet': 'As the music world observes the bicentenaries of Wagner and Verdi’s births, it may be instructive to chart the influence of Beethoven’s music over both.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WAGNER AND VERDI are destined to be linked forever, however awkwardly, since they were both born in 1813: Wagner in Leipzig, Germany, on May 22; Verdi in little Roncole, Italy, in the Duchy of Parma, on Oct. 9 or 10. (The records are not clear.)', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/arts/24WAGNER/24WAGNER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 597, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/24/arts/24WAGNER/24WAGNER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 597}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/arts/24WAGNER/24WAGNER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1019, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/arts/24WAGNER/24WAGNER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2037, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/arts/24WAGNER/24WAGNER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbna