148ec0ab7'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Bennett said on Thursday that he is working on an album of swing tunes with the pop diva Lady Gaga.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/22/tony-bennett-to-record-with-lady-gaga/', 'snippet': 'Mr. Bennett said on Thursday that he is working on an album of swing tunes with the pop diva Lady Gaga.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tony Bennett says he plans to record an album with the pop diva Lady Gaga. Speaking after he received a lifetime achievement award on Thursday in New York from the Amy Winehouse Foundation, the veteran jazz singer said he and Lady Gaga had yet to go into the studio, but had agreed to collaborate on “a big swing album.” ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/22/arts/22artsbeat-tony/22artsbeat-tony-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 832, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/22/arts/22artsbeat-tony/22artsbeat-tony-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 832}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/22/arts/22artsbeat-tony/22artsbeat-tony-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 739, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/22/arts/22artsbeat-tony/22artsbeat-tony-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1328, 'width': 958, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/22/arts/22artsbeat-tony/22artsbeat-tony-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/22/arts/22artsbeat-tony/22artsbeat-tony-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 7