.V. market with the new Encore, a mini-Buick that is blazing an upscale trail that other brands will soon follow.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/24/automobiles/autoreviews/buick-stakes-a-claim-in-munchkinland.html', 'snippet': 'Buick, long known for its big cars, is bravely venturing into the small end of the S.U.V. market with the new Encore, a mini-Buick that is blazing an upscale trail that other brands will soon follow.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WARREN, N.H. — Buick’s image is so ingrained in the national consciousness that the name has become shorthand for an American road barge with ample proportions. That moose, someone may say, “is as big as a Buick.”', 'print_section': 'AU', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/automobiles/encore1/encore1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 343, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/24/automobiles/encore1/encore1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 343}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/automobiles/encore1/encore1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 585, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/automobiles/encore1/encore1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1170, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/automobiles/encore1/encore1-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/24/automobiles/encore1/encore1-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'th