{'abstract': 'The original popemobile was a plush sedan chair carried by 12 footmen in red uniforms. Once the Vatican went to four wheels, the cars have included Fiats, Peugeots and Fords.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/24/automobiles/the-vehicular-side-of-the-vatican.html', 'snippet': 'The original popemobile was a plush sedan chair carried by 12 footmen in red uniforms. Once the Vatican went to four wheels, the cars have included Fiats, Peugeots and Fords.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the newly installed pontiff of the Roman Catholic Church, Pope Francis will often be seen greeting the world from the back of a rather peculiar vehicle. It’s taken many shapes over the last three decades, but the classification is one we’ve become pretty accustomed to: the popemobile.', 'print_section': 'AU', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/automobiles/Pope2/Pope2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/24/automobiles/Pope2/Pope2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/automobiles/Pope2/Pope2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 597, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/automobiles/Pope2/Pope2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1156, 'width': 1982, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/automobiles/Pope2/Pope2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/24/a