n Pontiac, Mich.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/22/at-102-margaret-dunning-looks-ahead-to-next-concours/', 'snippet': 'In May, Margaret Dunning will take part in the Keels and Wheels concours in Seabrook, Tex. She hopes to attend the coming Indy 500 race and will speak this summer at the national Packard Club’s annual meeting, to be held in Pontiac, Mich.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At 102, Margaret Dunning could be living a genteel, quiet life. Instead, Ms. Dunning, who owns a 1930 Packard 740, has become a doyenne of the show-car circuit and is often away from home.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'At 102, Margaret Dunning Looks Ahead to Next Concours', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Antique and Classic Cars', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restoration and Renovation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-22T20:51:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mary M. Chapman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8c26203b-b76b-5749-a71f-5e43dda35537', 'word_count': 850, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8c26203b-b76b-5749-a71f-5e43dda35537'}, {'abstract': 'It’s taken many shapes over the last three decades, but the classification is one we’ve become pretty accustomed to: the popemobile.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2013/03/24/automobiles/24popemobile-slides.html', 'snippet': 'It’s taken many shapes over the last three decades, but the classification is one we’ve become pretty accustomed to: the popemobile.', 'lead_paragraph':