om/2013/03/22/big-ticket-baronial-show-house-sold-for-22-85-million/', 'snippet': 'A 17-room limestone mansion, 25 feet wide with over 10,000 square feet, was once the site for a fund-raising decorator show house event.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A magisterial limestone town house on one of the Upper East Side’s most moneyed blocks sold for $22.85 million and was the most expensive sale of the week, according to city records.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Big Ticket | Baronial Show House Sold for $22.85 Million', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Baronial Show House', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Upper East Side (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-22T21:02:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robin Finn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Finn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/749dcc77-f781-5851-a166-b28ea8123865', 'word_count': 464, 'uri': 'nyt://article/749dcc77-f781-5851-a166-b28ea8123865'}, {'abstract': 'The Winklevoss brothers have moved on from their battle with Mark Zuckerberg and are more active than ever.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/24/fashion/winklevoss-brothers-move-on-from-facebook.html', 'snippet': 'The Winklevoss brothers have moved on from their battle with Mark Zuckerberg and are more active than ever.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As you sit across from Tyler and Cameron Winklevoss, it is easy to lose track of whom exactly you’re talking to. Tall, blue-eyed and each built as broad-shouldered as a fridge, the twins are identical right down to their entrees: a pair of lobster rolls, with potato chips. Each has an espresso; neither eats the biscotti it comes with. And while the restaurant around them is spinning with chatter on this February night, the twins are each laser focused on getting their message across.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/fashion/24WINKLEVOSS1/24JPWINKLEVOSS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 369, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/24/fashion/24WINKLEVOSS1/24JPWINKLEVOSS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 369}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/fashion/24WINKLEVOSS1/24JPWINKLEVOSS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 630, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/fashion/24WINKLEVOSS1/24JPWINKLEVOSS1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1259, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/fashion/24WINKLEVOSS1/24JPWINKLEVOSS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/24/fashion/24WINKLEVOSS1/24JPWINKLEVOSS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/fashion/24WINKLEVOSS1/24JPWINKLEVOSS1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Finding Their Next Facebook', '