s in Israel on Thursday during his first presidential trip to the country. Some of the students shared their views of the speech with The Times.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Obama gave a fervent address to students from universities in Israel on Thursday during his first presidential trip to the country. Some of the students shared their views of the speech with The Times.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Israeli Students Reflect on Obama’s Speech', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-22T22:28:06+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'World', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/8c2ed02e-2519-5084-9ef8-551232af118e', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/8c2ed02e-2519-5084-9ef8-551232af118e'}, {'abstract': 'Yoko Ono explains her antigun message on Twitter and why she shared a photo of the blood-spattered spectacles her husband was wearing when he was killed in 1980.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/22/yoko-ono-details-why-she-posted-lennons-bloodied-glasses-on-twitter/', 'snippet': 'Yoko Ono explains her antigun message on Twitter and why she shared a photo of the blood-spattered spectacles her husband was wearing when he was killed in 1980.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On what would have been her 44th wedding anniversary Wednesday, Yoko Ono said, she walked through a park, remembering how much she and her husband, John Lennon, had laughed and smiled on their wedding day. “Then I felt the emptiness more acutely because of the beautiful memory,” she said. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Yoko Ono Details Why She Posted Lennon’s Bloodied Glasses on Twitter', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gun Control', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lennon, John', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ono, Yoko', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Twitter', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-22T22:32:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Preston', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Preston', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f1fe0606-dc69-51d7-82f3-05e5faa19158', 'word_count': 941, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f1fe0606-dc69-51d7-82f3-05e5faa19158'}, {'abstract': 'A look back at a David Bowie career retrospective at the Victoria and Albert Museum in London in 2013.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/arts/music/100000002131066/bowie-on-display.html', 'snippet': 'A look back at a David Bowie career retrospective at the Victoria and Albert Museum in London in 2013.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A look back at a David Bowie career retrospective at the Victoria and Albert Museum in London in 2013.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/21/arts/video-bowie/video-bowie-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/21/arts/video-bowie/video-bowie-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 396}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'capti