 to apply his approach to the New York Philharmonic’s Bach Variations festival at Avery Fisher Hall.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/23/arts/music/philharmonics-bach-festival-with-bernard-labadie.html', 'snippet': 'Bernard Labadie was one of four conductors to apply his approach to the New York Philharmonic’s Bach Variations festival at Avery Fisher Hall.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Bach Variations festival, which the New York Philharmonic is presenting through April 6, is built on a question: Should large symphony orchestras still play Bach, now that there are so many ensembles specializing in the historically informed performance of Baroque music? With four conductors from different backgrounds — Alan Gilbert, Andras Schiff, Masaaki Suzuki and Bernard Labadie — the Philharmonic also looks at the question of how. What they failed to address is the where.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/23/arts/SUB-23PHIL/SUB-23PHIL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/23/arts/SUB-23PHIL/SUB-23PHIL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/23/arts/SUB-23PHIL/SUB-23PHIL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/23/arts/SUB-23PHIL/SUB-23PHIL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/23/arts/SUB-23PHIL/SUB-23PHIL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width