 an investigation into a cheating scandal. They say they’re happy for the team, which won on Thursday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Plenty of college basketball fans across the country were rooting for Harvard on Thursday night when it upset third-seeded New Mexico, 68-62, in the N.C.A.A. tournament’s Round of 64. There was no bigger supporter than Brandyn Curry, who was watching the game with his family in Charlotte, N.C.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'After Withdrawing, Harvard Star Roots From Afar', 'kicker': 'West Region', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'After Withdrawing, Harvard Star Roots From Afar', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'NCAA Basketball Championships (Men)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cheating', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Harvard University', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Casey, Kyle', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Curry, Brandyn', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball (College)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-22T23:49:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'College Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dan Duggan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Duggan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8e19487a-1d56-53ec-94b1-06d7e59397da', 'word_count': 590, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8e19487a-1d56-53ec-94b1-06d7e59397da'}, {'abstract': 'The Rockwell Mixed Pairs in St. Louis on Wednesday evening were won by a married couple, Paul and Linda Lewis of Las Vegas.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/23/crosswords/bridge/bridge-vanderbilt-knockout-teams-quarterfinals.html', 'snippet': 'The Rockwell Mixed Pairs in St. Louis on Wednesday evening were won by a married couple, Paul and Linda Lewis of Las Vegas.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ST. LOUIS — The Rockwell Mixed Pairs here on Wednesday evening were won by a married couple, Paul and Linda Lewis of Las Vegas. They finished one-third of a board ahead of Barbara Lehman of Glenview, Ill., and Craig Jacobson of Skokie, Ill. Third were Jenni Carmichael of Kennesaw, Ga., and Greg Humphreys of Charlottesville, Va.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/23/crosswords/bridge/23card-img/23card-img-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 563, 'width': 282, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/23/crosswords/bridge/23card-img/23card-img-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 563, 'width': 282, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/23/crosswords/bridge/23card-img/23card-img-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/23/crosswords/bridge/23card-img/23card-img-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/23/crosswords/bridge/23card-img/23card-img-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Vanderbilt Knockout Teams Quarterfinals', 'kicker': 'Bridge', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'va