rescue Lebanon from deepening divisions over the war in Syria, which threatens to spill over the border.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIRUT, Lebanon — Lebanon’s prime minister resigned on Friday and called for a national unity government to rescue the country from deepening sectarian divisions over the war in neighboring Syria, which threatens to spill over the border. Lebanon’s most powerful political factions back opposite sides in the Syrian conflict.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/23/world/0323LEBANON/0323LEBANON-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 448, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/23/world/0323LEBANON/0323LEBANON-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 448}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/23/world/0323LEBANON/0323LEBANON-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 765, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/23/world/0323LEBANON/0323LEBANON-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1529, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/23/world/0323LEBANON/0323LEBANON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/23/world/0323LEBANON/0323LEBANON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/23/world/0323LEBANON/0323LEBANON-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge