anist George Cables seemed intent on reinvigorating some lesser-known tunes in his repertory.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/23/arts/music/george-cables-at-the-iridium.html', 'snippet': 'At the Iridium on Wednesday, the pianist George Cables seemed intent on reinvigorating some lesser-known tunes in his repertory.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The pianist George Cables ended his first set at the Iridium on Wednesday night with “My Muse,” a compact tune with the kind of crisp, sunny melody that might have made it a staple in the age of jukeboxes and roller rinks. Over a percolating rock beat, he played the theme jauntily, saving all his flash for a cascading solo that started fast and never flagged. If the song carried a burden of sentiment, he wasn’t about to let it show.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Rare Dive Into His Own Songbook', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Rare Dive Into His Own Songbook', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cables, George', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Iridium Jazz Club', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jazz', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-23T01:29:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nate Chinen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Chinen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/426ff6ac-dda6-5205-9200-6e43be953c6d', 'word_count': 481, 'uri': 'nyt://article/426ff6ac-dda6-5205-9200-6e43be953c6d'}, {'abstract': 'Lottery Numbers for New York, New Jersey and Connecticut.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03