 under a long-term care policy. Her son-in-law asks the Haggler to intervene.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/24/your-money/a-winding-road-to-benefits-from-long-term-care-insurance.html', 'snippet': 'After months of exchanges of information, a woman who had a stroke is denied benefits under a long-term care policy. Her son-in-law asks the Haggler to intervene.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OUR episode about Whirlpool’s grudging approach to customer service, as illuminated by the tale of a faulty microwave, prompted more than a dozen e-mails of the oh-you-think-that’s-bad? variety. Most were mundane variations on a theme of Whirlpool indifference, incompetence or both. But one stood out. It came from Shira London, a librarian in Baltimore, and the owner of a Whirlpool refrigerator that makes a very loud buzzing noise. ', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/business/24-HAGGLER/24-HAGGLER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 1520, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/24/business/24-HAGGLER/24-HAGGLER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 1520}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/business/24-HAGGLER/24-HAGGLER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 405, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/business/24-HAGGLER/24-HAGGLER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 809, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/business/24-HAGGLER/24-HAGGLER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thu