': 'The Natural (Movie)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-23T21:34:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bruce Weber', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bruce', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weber', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/2bc3d6e8-0f40-56cb-9934-9321d391a330', 'word_count': 1170, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2bc3d6e8-0f40-56cb-9934-9321d391a330'}, {'abstract': 'Some believe that this year’s N.H.L. trade deadline, April 3, might not be as active as in years past.', 'web_url': 'https://slapshot.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/23/excitement-of-deadline-day-has-potential-to-end-with-a-thud/', 'snippet': 'Some believe that this year’s N.H.L. trade deadline, April 3, might not be as active as in years past.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As with all things in this shrunken N.H.L. season, which began slightly more than two months ago, the April 3 trade deadline is coming fast. Canada’s all-sports television networks like TSN began showing specials on it 30 days before the deadline, have dedicated Web pages to it and will, as always, devote at least nine hours of live programming on deadline day for an audience that includes viewers of the NHL Network in the United States.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Excitement of Deadline Day Has Potential to End With a Thud', 'kicker': 'Slap Shot', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Excitement of Trade Deadline Has Potential to End With Thud', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Hockey League', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-23T21:43:00+0000', 'document_type