://article/93d7b8df-fd6d-5e74-bf93-f7047275ca62', 'word_count': 323, 'uri': 'nyt://article/93d7b8df-fd6d-5e74-bf93-f7047275ca62'}, {'abstract': 'Chris Stroud was planning to take a few days off to dote on his two young daughters. But then he got a call from Arnold Palmer’s tournament.', 'web_url': 'https://onpar.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/23/so-much-for-that-week-of-rest/', 'snippet': 'Chris Stroud was planning to take a few days off to dote on his two young daughters. But then he got a call from Arnold Palmer’s tournament.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ORLANDO, Fla. — This was going to be the week Chris Stroud recharged his batteries and doted on his two young daughters. Instead, a single phone call set into motion one of the more exhausting weeks of Stroud’s seven-year PGA Tour career.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'So Much for That Week of Rest', 'kicker': 'On Par', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Palmer, Arnold', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stroud, Chris', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Orlando (Fla)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-24T00:16:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Golf', 'byline': {'original': 'By Karen Crouse', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Karen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Crouse', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/96bfbc39-c6db-558d-b291-3e19a1faa34f', 'word_count': 406, 'uri': 'nyt://article/96bfbc39-c6db-558d-b291-3e19a1faa34f'}, {'abstract': 'Dr. Perry earned attention for her work in analyzing the human gait, which she broke down into eight motion patterns governed by 28 major muscles in each leg.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/24/health/dr-jacquelin-perry-who-aided-polio-victims-dies-at-94.html', 'snippet': 'Dr. Perry earned attention for her work in analyzing the human gait, which she broke down into eight motion patterns governed by 28 major muscles in each leg.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dr. Jacquelin Perry, a physician and researcher who shed light on the complexities of walking, and was a leader in treating polio victims in the 1950s and again in the ’80s when the symptoms of some returned, died on March 11 at her home in Downey, Calif. She was 94.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/us/dog-PERRY-obit/dog-PERRY-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 368, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/24/us/dog-PERRY-obit/dog-PERRY-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 368}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/us/dog-PERRY-obit/dog-PERRY-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 628, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/us/dog-PERRY-obit/dog-PERRY-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1256, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/us/dog-PERRY-obit/dog-PERRY-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/24/us/dog-PERRY-obit/dog-PERRY-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'cred