ate Athletics (N.A.I.A.) Division I national championship and other events. On Saturday, it hosted a cheerleading competition. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Long Shots and Long Road Converge at Site of Long-Ago Title', 'kicker': 'West: Mississippi vs. La Salle', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Long Shots and Long Road Converge at the Site of a Long-Ago Title', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball (College)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'NCAA Basketball Championships (Men)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'La Salle University (Philadelphia)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Mississippi', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Simmons, Lionel', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-24T00:26:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'College Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Pat Borzi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Pat', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Borzi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5c613d7b-1db1-551d-a568-5b422f949fea', 'word_count': 836, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5c613d7b-1db1-551d-a568-5b422f949fea'}, {'abstract': 'More than 100 physicians have been killed and hundreds more have disappeared into Syrian jails in the last two years.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/24/world/middleeast/on-both-sides-in-syrian-war-doctors-are-often-the-target.html', 'snippet': 'More than 100 physicians have been killed and hundreds more have disappeared into Syrian jails in the last two years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GAZIANTEP, Turkey — Six months after Syrian secret police officers led Dr. M. Nour Maktabi away from his Aleppo clinic, the mor