'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-24T03:31:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ian Urbina and Catherine Rentz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Urbina', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Catherine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rentz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/93023fb9-6637-5111-885b-85d74d10eaeb', 'word_count': 1831, 'uri': 'nyt://article/93023fb9-6637-5111-885b-85d74d10eaeb'}, {'abstract': 'A first-half run by the Ducks left the Billikens too far behind to extend their emotional season. St. Louis wore patches that read “coach” to honor Coach Rick Majerus, who died in December.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/24/sports/ncaabasketball/oregon-ends-emotional-run-by-st-louis.html', 'snippet': 'A first-half run by the Ducks left the Billikens too far behind to extend their emotional season. St. Louis wore patches that read “coach” to honor Coach Rick Majerus, who died in December.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN JOSE, Calif. — The end for St. Louis started simply, with one 3-pointer, then another, bombs to break apart a game clogged by tight defense. And when Oregon made another to bookend a 20-4 run to end the first half, the highly regarded Billikens, wearing patches on their uniforms to commemorate the December death of their coach, finally found themselves in a situation they could not overcome.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/sports/stlouis/stlouis-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 390, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/24/sports/stlouis/stlouis-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 390}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/sports/stlouis/stlouis-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 666, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/sports/stlouis/stlouis-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1331, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/sports/stlouis/stlouis-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/24/sports/stlouis/stlouis-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/24/sports/stlouis/stlouis-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Oregon Ends Emotional Run by St. Louis', 'kicker': 'Midwest: Oregon 74, St. Louis 57', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'NCAA Basketball Championships (Men)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'St Louis University', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Oregon', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Majerus, Rick', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball (College)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-24T03:36:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'College Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Branch'