-52a1-91e4-d0a17d348e90', 'word_count': 488, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9f4e250e-bb95-52a1-91e4-d0a17d348e90'}, {'abstract': 'Lil Wayne’s new album, “I Am Not a Human Being II,” is consistent with music from his sober period: slapdash, a mix of blustering boasts, spiteful sex, warm sex and flashes of self-realization.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/25/arts/music/lil-waynes-new-album-is-i-am-not-a-human-being-ii.html', 'snippet': 'Lil Wayne’s new album, “I Am Not a Human Being II,” is consistent with music from his sober period: slapdash, a mix of blustering boasts, spiteful sex, warm sex and flashes of self-realization.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Lil Wayne has long been one of hip-hop’s loosest cannons, but his narrative changed dramatically in 2010 after his release from Rikers Island jail, where he spent eight months on a weapons charge. For three years at least, sobriety was to be his sidekick. As part of a plea agreement in a separate drug possession case, he consented to regular drug tests.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/25/arts/SUBLILWAYNE/SUBLILWAYNE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 357, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/25/arts/SUBLILWAYNE/SUBLILWAYNE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 357}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/25/arts/SUBLILWAYNE/SUBLILWAYNE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 610, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/25/arts/SUBLILWAYNE/SUBLILWAYNE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1219, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail',