ated. The Eagles beat No. 7 San Diego State on Sunday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/25/sports/ncaabasketball/florida-gulf-coast-beats-san-diego-state.html', 'snippet': 'In only its second season eligible for the N.C.A.A. tournament, Florida Gulf Coast has gone from an unknown team to perhaps the most celebrated. The Eagles beat No. 7 San Diego State on Sunday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PHILADELPHIA — After pregame player introductions, Florida Gulf Coast’s Sherwood Brown began to dance as his teammates, their arms interlocked, spun in a circle around him, their speed building and building until they broke apart and scattered.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/25/sports/ncaabasketball/25sandiegost/25sandiegost-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/25/sports/ncaabasketball/25sandiegost/25sandiegost-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/25/sports/ncaabasketball/25sandiegost/25sandiegost-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/25/sports/ncaabasketball/25sandiegost/25sandiegost-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/25/sports/ncaabasketball/25sandiegost/25sandiegost-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/25/sports/ncaabasketball/25