y throw preposterous passes for alley-oop dunks in the tense moments of games. They celebrate like this moment is all that matters, the only one guaranteed them, or any of us. And we laugh along with them. Because we can. And we should. It’s as if they were dialed up by the sporting gods for this N.C.A.A. tournament to remind us this is supposed to be fun. This is what joy looks like.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/sports/ncaabasketball/26leadingpicsub/26leadingpicsub-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/26/sports/ncaabasketball/26leadingpicsub/26leadingpicsub-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/sports/ncaabasketball/26leadingpicsub/26leadingpicsub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/sports/ncaabasketball/26leadingpicsub/26leadingpicsub-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/sports/ncaabasketball/26leadingpicsub/26leadingpicsub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/26/sports/ncaabasketball/26leadingpicsub/26leadingpicsub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/sports/ncaabasketball/26leadingpicsub/26leadingpicsub-thumb