e, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/66cce514-571f-52c2-b5b1-46eb4f9e8ef1', 'word_count': 904, 'uri': 'nyt://article/66cce514-571f-52c2-b5b1-46eb4f9e8ef1'}, {'abstract': 'Beatrice Mtetwa had been held on a charge of obstruction of justice after demanding a search warrant at a client’s home.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/26/world/africa/zimbabwe-human-rights-lawyer-beatrice-mtetwa-released-from-jail.html', 'snippet': 'Beatrice Mtetwa had been held on a charge of obstruction of justice after demanding a search warrant at a client’s home.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JOHANNESBURG — After more than a week in jail, the human rights lawyer Beatrice Mtetwa was released Monday after a high court judge overruled a lower court’s decision that she be held without bail on a charge of obstruction of justice.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Zimbabwe: Human Rights Lawyer Released From Jail', 'kicker': 'World Briefing | Africa', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Zimbabwe: Judge’s Order Frees Lawyer', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Polgreen, Lydia', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Zimbabwe', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mtetwa, Beatrice', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mpofu, Thabani', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-25T15:55:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lydia Polgreen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lydia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Polgreen'