nt': 1178, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f38b5ce5-246d-5cd0-9d0e-762fbf55083c'}, {'abstract': 'Gerard Way, the singer of My Chemical Romance, tried to explain the band’s split in a 2,200-word letter posted online.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/25/a-breakup-letter-from-my-chemical-romance/', 'snippet': 'Gerard Way, the singer of My Chemical Romance, tried to explain the band’s split in a 2,200-word letter posted online.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My Chemical Romance — a band known for its dense, intensely strained instrumental textures, darkly poetic if often mysterious lyrics and elaborately theatrical performance style — announced its breakup on Friday evening after a 12-year career that produced four highly regarded studio albums (most notably “The Black Parade”) as well as two live discs and a handful of EPs.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/25/arts/25artsbeat-chem/25artsbeat-chem-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/25/arts/25artsbeat-chem/25artsbeat-chem-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/25/arts/25artsbeat-chem/25artsbeat-chem-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/25/arts/25artsbeat-chem/25artsbeat-chem-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/25/arts/25artsbeat-chem/25artsbeat-chem-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'c