5/first-hint-of-spring-links/', 'snippet': 'Some links while waiting for spring to kick in.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Diet News: The Mediterranean diet is not just good for your health, but also improves food security. Is there nothing this way of eating can’t do? Less encouraging is that Mississippi, the most obese state in the nation, is banning Bloomberg-style portion control. No, really\xa0— the bill is called the “The Anti-Bloomberg Bill.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'First Hint of Spring Links', 'kicker': 'Mark Bittman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Agriculture and Farming', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diet and Nutrition', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Obesity', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kerry, John', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Slaughter, Louise M', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "McDonald's Corporation", 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Wall Street Journal', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Whole Foods Market Inc', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Greece', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Idaho', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Japan', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mississippi', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-25T17:35:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Bittman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bittman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/59c7f5e5-e06e-5678-82d9-69a