treat immigrants with dangerous illnesses.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Australia’s first death from XDR-TB — extensively drug-resistant tuberculosis, which is nearly incurable — has alarmed health officials and added new heat to a debate over how to treat immigrants with dangerous diseases. That debate echoes one on the United States’ southern border.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Drug-Resistant Tuberculosis Knocks at Australia’s Door', 'kicker': 'Global Health', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McNeil, Donald G Jr', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tuberculosis', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Australia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-25T18:07:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Donald G. McNeil Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Donald', 'middlename': 'G.', 'lastname': 'McNeil', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9a4e654f-8d77-5d00-94da-0473468192b7', 'word_count': 275, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9a4e654f-8d77-5d00-94da-0473468192b7'}, {'abstract': 'Residents of the Greek island of Ikaria have remarkably long life expectancies, and researchers say one factor could be the coffee they drink.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/26/science/on-one-greek-island-a-caffeinated-secret-to-long-life.html', 'snippet': 'Residents of the Greek island of Ikaria have remarkably long life expectancies, and researchers say one factor could be the coffee they drink.', 'lead_paragrap