a-on-salome/', 'snippet': 'The Philadelphia Orchestra will work with Opera Philadelphia to create a semistaged version of Strauss’s “Salome” in 2014.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Philadelphia Orchestra has programmed a concert performance of the Strauss opera “Salome” for next season. Now, they are calling in the experts. The orchestra said on Monday it would be collaborating with Opera Philadelphia to create a semistaged version of the work, to be performed in May 2014. Kevin Newbury is to direct and Vita Tzykun will design the production, to be performed in the orchestra’s home, Verizon Hall at the Kimmel Center, which has no proscenium. “It’s a bit of a feat to try to imagine a theatrical mash-up, if you will,” said Allison Vulgamore, the orchestra’s chief executive and president.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Philadelphia Orchestra to Collaborate With Opera on ‘Salome’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Opera', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Opera Philadelphia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Philadelphia Orchestra', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-25T19:55:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Daniel J. Wakin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Daniel', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'Wakin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/063fff03-2cde-5d56-ab13-71555fd5a9ad', 'word_count': 175, 'uri': 'nyt://article/063fff03-2cde-5d56-ab13-71555fd5a9ad'}, {'abstract': 'The Minnesota women’s hockey team completed their season undefeated in winning the N.C.A.A. title on Sunday, and have won 49 straight games stretching back to last season.', 'web_url': 'https://thequad.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/25/streaks-alive-minnesota-womens-hockey-win-49-in-a-row-to-win-title/', 'snippet': 'The Minnesota women’s hockey team completed their season undefeated in winning the N.C.A.A. title on Sunday, and have won 49 straight games stretching back to last season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Pittsburgh Penguins have won 12 games in a row. The Miami Heat have won 26 in a row. The Baylor women’s basketball team has won 31 in a row. But they have a ways to go to catch the University of Minnesota women’s hockey team. The Gophers completed a 41-0 season Sunday by winning their second straight national championship with a 6-3 victory over Boston University.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/sports/hockey/26gophers/26gophers-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 424, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/26/sports/hockey/26gophers/26gophers-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 424}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/sports/hockey/26gophers/26gophers-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 724, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/sports/hockey/26gophers/26gophers-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1449, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/sports/hockey/26gophers/26gophers-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail'