://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/26/science/fig-wasps-crucial-tropical-pollinators-face-a-climate-threat.html', 'snippet': 'New research indicates that hot weather shortens the life span of some wasps in the tropics — ominous news for the wild fig plants.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are more than 700 species of wild fig in the tropics. Remarkably, most can be pollinated only by a unique species of fig wasp. In turn, the wasps rely on fig plants as hosts for their eggs. Neither species can survive without the other, a relationship known as obligate mutualism. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'When Fig Wasps Can’t Take the Heat', 'kicker': 'Observatory', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Climate Change: When Fig Wasps Can’t Take the Heat', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Figs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Research', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wasps (Insects)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weather', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Biology Letters (Journal)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Trees and Shrubs', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-25T20:03:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Science', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sindya N. Bhanoo', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sindya', 'middlename': 'N.', 'lastname': 'Bhanoo', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d4c35aad-a861-55c3-8bcd-42a7b87b815d', 'word_count': 228, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d4c35aad-a861-55c3-8bcd-42a7b87b815d'}, {'abstract': 'A spring snowstorm did not deter a few dozen people from waiting outside the Supreme Court for one of the few coveted tickets for two same-sex marriage cases to be heard this week.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/26/us/cold-wet-wait-to-hear-same-sex-marriage-cases.html', 'snippet': 'A spring snowstorm did not deter a few dozen people from waiting outside the Supreme Court for one of the few coveted tickets for two same-sex marriage cases to be heard this week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Being a witness to history can be messy business. And for those waiting outside the Supreme Court on Monday for one of the few coveted tickets to hear oral arguments in a pair of same-sex marriage cases this week, it was also cold, wet and tedious.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/us/SCENE/SCENE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 369, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/26/us/SCENE/SCENE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 369}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/us/SCENE/SCENE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 630, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/us/SCENE/SCENE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1259, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/us/SCENE/SCENE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/26/us/SCENE/SCENE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'cred