/audio/f44bb86a-01f0-5b40-9eb2-70e3a8b7532a'}, {'abstract': 'Airports, particularly those in Europe and Asia, are responding to travelers’ needs by offering an increasing array of services, like hair salons, medical clinics and dry cleaners.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/26/business/airport-services-go-beyond-newsstands-and-ready-made-sandwiches.html', 'snippet': 'Airports, particularly those in Europe and Asia, are responding to travelers’ needs by offering an increasing array of services, like hair salons, medical clinics and dry cleaners.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jim Rosenberg, the head of online and social media for the World Bank, can vouch that some airports offer a lot more than places to eat and newsstands filled with gossipy magazines.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/business/26airports-web/26airports-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/26/business/26airports-web/26airports-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/business/26airports-web/26airports-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/business/26airports-web/26airports-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/business/26airports-web/26airports-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbSt