2', 'word_count': 375, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8b775fe1-016c-5bae-85b0-59684bdf66d2'}, {'abstract': 'The pianist Richard Goode was soloist on Saturday with the Orpheus Chamber Orchestra at Carnegie Hall.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/26/arts/music/orpheus-chamber-orchestra-with-the-pianist-richard-goode.html', 'snippet': 'The pianist Richard Goode was soloist on Saturday with the Orpheus Chamber Orchestra at Carnegie Hall.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Orpheus Chamber Orchestra is celebrating its 40th anniversary this season with a roster of new collaborators, including the jazz greats Wayne Shorter and Brad Mehldau, and the contemporary composer-performers Timothy Andres and Gabriel Kahane. But on Saturday evening at Carnegie Hall this conductorless orchestra teamed up with an old friend, the pianist Richard Goode, who joined the players in a lucid performance of Schumann’s Piano Concerto. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/arts/ORPHEUS/ORPHEUS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 347, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/26/arts/ORPHEUS/ORPHEUS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 347}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/arts/ORPHEUS/ORPHEUS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 593, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/arts/ORPHEUS/ORPHEUS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1186, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/arts/ORPHEUS/ORPHEUS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, '