ype_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3eb63a6b-ed31-5244-9ddc-73b3c9b250a7', 'word_count': 1589, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3eb63a6b-ed31-5244-9ddc-73b3c9b250a7'}, {'abstract': 'Among those who receive inheritances, a small subset — call them trust-fund progressives — want to give all or most of the money away while they are young.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/26/your-money/inheriting-a-large-trust-fund-and-giving-the-money-away.html', 'snippet': 'Among those who receive inheritances, a small subset — call them trust-fund progressives — want to give all or most of the money away while they are young.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOST people would probably be quite happy to receive an inheritance. They would pay off debt, maybe their mortgage; save for retirement; take a trip or two. It would be blissful, and it would make their lives easier.', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/your-money/WEALTH/WEALTH-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/26/your-money/WEALTH/WEALTH-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/your-money/WEALTH/WEALTH-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/your-money/WEALTH/WEALTH-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/your-money/WEALTH/WEALTH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'th