e-d14175934045'}, {'abstract': 'In two combat tours in Iraq, Jason Davis learned that in war, there are no days off.', 'web_url': 'https://atwar.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/25/still-bleeding-10-years-later/', 'snippet': 'In two combat tours in Iraq, Jason Davis learned that in war, there are no days off.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Chasing WarThe blades wore a darkened silver sheen, dulled at the edge. Bits of hair, dried salt-sweat and dung-powdered dirt clogged the head so that with each firm scrape, tiny beads of crimson and pus dried into little scab islands in the crease of my neck. There was no water, no cream, no electrical outlets — just a cracked Humvee mirror and the light from the rising sun. My Mach3 wouldn’t skive the glaze from a stick of butter, but still I bled.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Still Bleeding, 10 Years Later', 'kicker': 'At War', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Iraq War (2003-11)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bush, George W', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Baghdad (Iraq)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Najaf (Iraq)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-25T22:44:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jason Davis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jason', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Davis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1393355c-53b3-576d-a94a-536cc1bb6de2', 'word_count': 1136, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1393355c-53b3-576d-a94a-536cc1bb6de2'}, {'abstract': 'European powers used the crisis in Cyprus to establish more punitive rules for countries needing emergency aid, but some critics said the bailout showed chaotic decision making.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/26/world/europe/cyprus-bailout-shows-strictness-but-signs-of-disarray.html', 'snippet': 'European powers used the crisis in Cyprus to establish more punitive rules for countries needing emergency aid, but some critics said the bailout showed chaotic decision making.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — The Cyprus deal announced Sunday, another late-night showdown in Brussels that looked like a shambles, laid down some important new markers for the future of the European Union and the countries that use the euro. The big European powers used the crisis to establish some new, more punitive rules for countries needing emergency aid.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/world/ASSESS/ASSESS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 367, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/26/world/ASSESS/ASSESS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 367}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/world/ASSESS/ASSESS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 626, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/world/ASSESS/ASSESS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1251, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/world/ASSESS/ASSESS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'leg