}, {'abstract': 'The members of Generation Y have developed an obsession with money — partly because they don’t have any.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/31/magazine/do-millennials-stand-a-chance-in-the-real-world.html', 'snippet': 'The members of Generation Y have developed an obsession with money — partly because they don’t have any.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When I was a kid, my grandmother used to spirit packets of oyster crackers from restaurants. She unwrapped gifts meticulously, peeling back the tape with her nails so that she could reuse the paper. She also stockpiled so many coupon-bought cans that she probably could have had her own show on TLC.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/magazine/31subeconomy/31subeconomy-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 439, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/31/magazine/31subeconomy/31subeconomy-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 439}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/magazine/31subeconomy/31subeconomy-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 749, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/magazine/31subeconomy/31subeconomy-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1317, 'width': 1800, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/magazine/31subeconomy/31subeconomy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/31/magazine/31subeconomy/31subeconomy-thumbStandard