toria’s Secret may have quietly pulled its “Feeling Lucky?” thong, but it’s still on a mission to sell its cheap-lace definition of youth.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/26/does-victorias-secret-care-that-parents-hate-pink/', 'snippet': 'Victoria’s Secret may have quietly pulled its “Feeling Lucky?” thong, but it’s still on a mission to sell its cheap-lace definition of youth.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Victoria’s Secret manufactures, markets and sells clothes and lingerie intended to make women look and feel sexy. That’s its mission (if not its formal mission statement): to sell more stuff to more people.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Does Victoria’s Secret Care That Parents Hate Pink?', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Teenagers and Adolescence', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Limited Brands Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-26T19:15:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': "By Kj Dell'Antonia", 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kj', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': "Dell'Antonia", 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f5414c4e-b23b-5486-b63f-ff47569f05a7', 'word_count': 573, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f5414c4e-b23b-5486-b63f-ff47569f05a7'}, {'abstract': 'The New York Youth Symphony, celebrating its 50th anniversary, played a program at Carnegie Hall.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/27/arts/music/new-york-youth-symphony-at-carnegie-hall.html', 'snippet': 'The New York Youth Symphony, celebrating its 50th anniversary, played a program at Carnegie Hall.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It can be inspiring to hear standard repertory works played by young musicians discovering them for the first time. Whatever such performances may lack in assurance is usually compensated for by the involvement and freshness that comes through. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/27/arts/27YOUTH/27YOUTH-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/27/arts/27YOUTH/27YOUTH-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/27/arts/27YOUTH/27YOUTH-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/27/arts/27YOUTH/27YOUTH-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/27/arts/27YOUTH/27YOUTH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/27/arts/27YOUTH/27YOUTH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/27/arts/27YOUTH/27YOUTH-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Orchestra Turns 50, Its Youthful Fire Coming Through', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Orchestra Turns 50, Its Youthful Fire Coming Through', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Youth Symphony', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tommasini, Anthony', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-26T19:20:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anthony Tommasini', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anthony', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tommasini', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/86fa2d14-28c4-5896-b486-12be504e1b70', 'word_count': 461, 'uri': 'nyt://article/86fa2d14-28c4-5896-b486-12be504e1b70'}, {'abstract': 'In the southern Chinese city of Wuhan, creating a cheap tasting menu from an array of street food just takes some creative thinking and a willingness to follow the crowds.', 'web_url': 'https://frugaltraveler.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/26/in-a-chinese-alley-an-8-tasting-menu/', 'snippet': 'In the southern Chinese city of Wuhan, creating a cheap tasting menu from an array of street food just takes some creative thinking and a willingness to follow the crowds.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Even the strictest of budget should allow for occasional splurges: a modest hotel room after a string of hostel bunks; a just-this-once late-night cab; a beer upgrade from P.B.R. to I.P.A. But some luxuries never enter the frugal equation. Take, for example, the restaurant tasting menu — those drawn-out dinners of 8 or 10 or 25 courses, exquisitely designed (and sometimes served) by the chef. Or so I’ve heard.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/travel/26-frugal-combo/26-frugal-combo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/26/travel/26-frugal-combo/26-frugal-combo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/travel/26-frugal-combo/26-frugal-combo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 679, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/travel/26-frugal-combo/26-frugal-combo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1358, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/travel/26-frugal-combo/26-frugal-combo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/26/travel/26-frugal-combo/26-frugal-combo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/26/travel/26-frugal-combo/26-frugal-combo-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In a Chinese Alley, an $8 Tasting Menu', 'kicker': 'Frugal Traveler', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Budget Travel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Food', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Street Vendors', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', '