S company WifiSLAM for $20 million. That start-up, only two years old, has a handful of employees. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Yahoo’s ‘Acqui-Hiring’ and Its Tax Implications', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corporate Taxes', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hiring and Promotion', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income Tax', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Start-ups', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Yahoo! Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-26T19:39:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Victor Fleischer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Victor', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fleischer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9d70c49a-6358-599c-9573-2445c48c9797', 'word_count': 646, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9d70c49a-6358-599c-9573-2445c48c9797'}, {'abstract': 'Helen Mirren, Rupert Everett and Kristen Scott Thomas were among those nominated for Britain’s top theater honor.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/26/olivier-awards-nominations-announced/', 'snippet': 'Helen Mirren, Rupert Everett and Kristen Scott Thomas were among those nominated for Britain’s top theater honor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Olivier Awards, Britain’s equivalent of the Tonys, announced its 2013 nominations on Tuesday, a list brimming with big names: Helen Mirren in “The Audience”; Rupert Everett in “The Judas Kiss”; Kristen Scott Thomas in “Old Times”; and Mark Rylance, a two-time Olivier winner, in an all-male production of “Twelfth Night.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': 