 Red Hook.', 'lead_paragraph': 'RED HOOK IS A STRANGE PLACE to choose for a day trip. The nearest subway stop isn’t near at all, and it’s closed for repairs until next month at least. Driving to Van Brunt Street, the main drag, means a turbulent ride on 19th-century Belgian-block roads that are apt to end with no warning. None of the restaurants are on a fast track to the World’s 50 Best, and none of the food businesses, except perhaps Fairway Market, can be called a destination. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/27/dining/27REDHOOK_SPAN/27REDHOOK_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 500, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/27/dining/27REDHOOK_SPAN/27REDHOOK_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 500}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/27/dining/27REDHOOK_SPAN/27REDHOOK_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 854, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/27/dining/27REDHOOK_SPAN/27REDHOOK_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1662, 'width': 1993, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/27/dining/27REDHOOK_SPAN/27REDHOOK_SPAN-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/27/dining/27REDHOOK_SPAN/27REDHOOK_SPAN-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/27/dining/27REDHOOK