n over 10 years for the rights to technology for herbicide-resistant soybeans.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Monsanto and DuPont, which have bitterly battled for dominance in the seed business, have settled their major disputes with a broad patent-licensing deal. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Monsanto and DuPont Settle Fight Over Patent Licensing', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Monsanto and DuPont Settle Fight Over Patent Licensing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pollack, Andrew', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Monsanto Company', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'DuPont Co', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Genetic Engineering', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Inventions and Patents', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soybeans', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-27T00:18:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Pollack', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pollack', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dd597462-ed3c-5f75-b74a-c4cac5efe3ba', 'word_count': 316, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dd597462-ed3c-5f75-b74a-c4cac5efe3ba'}, {'abstract': 'Cory Conacher, listed at 5-foot-8, tried out for three minor league teams before earning a pro contract. Now he leads all N.H.L. rookies in points.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/27/sports/hockey/undrafted-and-unheralded-the-lightnings-cory-conacher-makes-an-impact.html', 'snippet': 'Cory Conacher, listed at 5-foot-8, tried out for three minor league teams before earning a pro contract. Now he leads all N.H.L. rookies in points.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Cory Conacher is a 5-foot-8 center in a league that still looks askance at small players. He played four years at Canisius College, which had never sent a player to the N.H.L. Undrafted, he tried out with three minor league teams before signing a pro contract. He has Type 1 diabetes. Yet there he is, racing all over the ice for the Tampa Bay Lightning and becoming the N.H.L.’s top rookie scorer this season. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/27/sports/yLIGHTNING/yLIGHTNING-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 441, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/27/sports/yLIGHTNING/yLIGHTNING-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 441}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/27/sports/yLIGHTNING/yLIGHTNING-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 753, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/27/sports/yLIGHTNING/yLIGHTNING-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1506, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/27/sports/yLIGHTNING/yLIGHTNING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/27/sports/yLIGHTNING/yLIGHTNING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/27/