dministration of Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo has started to caution investors that climate change poses a long-term risk to the state’s finances. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'State Tells Investors That Climate Change May Hurt Its Finances', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'State Tells Investors That Climate Change May Hurt Its Finances', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kaplan, Thomas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricanes and Tropical Storms', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Sandy (2012)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-27T01:39:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thomas Kaplan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kaplan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/063ec91b-7c46-5774-95c2-a87bd4608d52', 'word_count': 710, 'uri': 'nyt://article/063ec91b-7c46-5774-95c2-a87bd4608d52'}, {'abstract': 'It is past time for the United Nations to approve a tough international treaty intended to keep conventional weapons out of the wrong hands.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/27/opinion/down-to-the-wire-for-a-conventional-arms-treaty.html', 'snippet': 'It is past time for the United Nations to approve a tough international treaty intended to keep conventional weapons out of the wrong hands.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We are now approaching the 11th hour for an international treaty intended to keep conventional weapons out of the hands of unscrupulous regimes, militants and criminals. Negotiators at the United Nations are supposed to complete the document by Thursday, but they are still battling over what many governments and arms-control activists consider serious flaws.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Down to the Wire', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Down to the Wire', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Arms Trade', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARMS CONTROL AND LIMITATION AND DISARMAMENT', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-27T01:40:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/b2ee5af9-c743-5be2-8cab-661c82f36b7b', 'word_count': 329, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b2ee5af9-c743-5be2-8cab-661c82f36b7b'}, {'abstract': 'The Supreme Court case concerned a Labrador retriever that had detected the smell of marijuana outside a Florida house. The police found a marijuana-growing operation inside.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/27/us/justices-limit-use-of-drug-sniffing-dogs.html', 'snippet': 'The Supreme Court case concerned a Labrador retriever that had detected the smell of marijuana outside a Florida house. The police found a marijuana-growing operation inside.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Supreme Court on Tuesday limited the ability of the police to use drug-sniffing dogs outside homes.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Justices, Citing Ban on Unreasonable Searches, Limit Use of Drug-Sniffing Dogs', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Justices, Citing Ban on Unreasonable Searches, Limit Use of Drug-Sniffing Dogs', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Court', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Search and Seizure', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fourth Amendment (US Constitution)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dogs', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marijuana', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-27T01:40:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam Liptak', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Liptak', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d1610910-a743-5a6c-96d3-2e7e44bfe3f8', 'word_count': 411, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d1610910-a743-5a6c-96d3-2e7e44bfe3f8'}, {'abstract': 'On the merits, the Supreme Court should endorse basic rights for same-sex couples.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/27/opinion/the-california-marriage-case.html', 'snippet': 'On the merits, the Supreme Court should endorse basic rights for same-sex couples.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Before the Supreme Court justices turned to the merits of the case on Proposition 8, California’s ban on same-sex marriage, they seemed perplexed by a procedural issue: whether the petitioners had legal standing to appeal a lower-court ruling that struck down the ballot measure. Having taken the appeal, they cannot easily decide to avoid the substantive question of whether same-sex couples have a constitutionally protected right to marry in California and elsewhere in the country. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The California Marriage Case', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The California Marriage Case', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Court', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cooper, Charles J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Verrilli, Donald B Jr', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Olson, Theodore B', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-27T01:44:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/00333932-9306-5118-a8db-364bd6335eaf', 'word_count': 552, 'uri': 'nyt://article/00333932-9306-5118-a8db-364bd6335eaf'}, {'abstract': 'The United States and Mexico play a World Cup qualifier at the Azteca Stadium in Mexico City on March 26.', 'web_url': 'https://goal.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/26/world-cup-qualifying-u-s-vs-mexico-at-the-azteca/', 'snippet': 'The United States and Mexico play a World Cup qualifier at the Azteca Stadium in Mexico City on March 26.', 'lead_paragraph': 'United States Coach Jurgen Klinsmann made only two changes to his lineup for Tuesday night’s Wo