graph': 'In their current era, you can’t fault the Chicago Blackhawks for not making their games entertaining. From the raucous national anthem to the infectious goal song to the fast-paced playing style they employ on the ice, games at United Center are certainly feasts for the eyes.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mr. T Does Hockey', 'kicker': 'Slap Shot', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chicago Blackhawks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-27T20:28:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lynn Zinser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lynn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zinser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b8bf6cc8-f3b1-56f1-aba7-5d88cbb65289', 'word_count': 91, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b8bf6cc8-f3b1-56f1-aba7-5d88cbb65289'}, {'abstract': 'Sugar Vendil, the pianist, brings together designers and pieces usually performed on august stages.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/28/fashion/fashion-meets-classical-music-in-sugar-vendil.html', 'snippet': 'Sugar Vendil, the pianist, brings together designers and pieces usually performed on august stages.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The setting was generic Midtown office building, and possibly even less exciting was a yawning space there filled with rows of straight-back chairs. The audience’s long wait for seats was the only glimmer one evening this winter that an experience unrelated to everyday business might occur. ', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, '