 to awaken a spring wardrobe.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/28/fashion/electric-blue-is-the-spring-look-for-men.html', 'snippet': 'This shade of blue isn’t a big jolt, but just enough to awaken a spring wardrobe.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Over the last decade, shocking pink has become so popular that it has lost virtually all of its power to do just that. Once distressingly linked with racy lingerie, Barbie dolls and bad taste, the color has amped, ramped and vamped up those associations and become a tongue-in-cheek beacon of femme feminism. ', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/28/fashion/28zBLUE6_SPAN/28zBLUE6_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/28/fashion/28zBLUE6_SPAN/28zBLUE6_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/28/fashion/28zBLUE6_SPAN/28zBLUE6_SPAN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/28/fashion/28zBLUE6_SPAN/28zBLUE6_SPAN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/28/fashion/28zBLUE6_SPAN/28zBLUE6_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/28/fashion/28zBLUE6_SPAN/28zBLUE6_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': N