lp any type of gardener, whether a novice or an old hand.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The sun and the earth have revolved to the relevant positions in space and spring, ladies and gentlemen, has definitely sprung. While I have the opposite of green thumbs, I now have a handy arsenal of gardening apps to help me in my springtime garden.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/28/technology/28smart-span/28smart-span-articleLarge.png', 'height': 337, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/28/technology/28smart-span/28smart-span-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 337}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/28/technology/28smart-span/28smart-span-jumbo.png', 'height': 574, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/28/technology/28smart-span/28smart-span-superJumbo.png', 'height': 617, 'width': 1100, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/28/technology/28smart-span/28smart-span-thumbStandard-v2.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/28/technology/28smart-span/28smart-span-thumbStandard-v2.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Garden of Delights, Mapped Out in Your Hand', 'kicker': 'App Smart', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Garden of Delights, Mapped Out in Your Hand', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Eaton, Kit', 'ra