35bd6', 'word_count': 174, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3a612a47-d1b5-5226-9984-c07252635bd6'}, {'abstract': 'Werner Aisslinger’s “Bikini” furniture for Moroso disrupts convention.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/28/garden/bikini-furniture-by-werner-aisslinger-for-moroso.html', 'snippet': 'Werner Aisslinger’s “Bikini” furniture for Moroso disrupts convention.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The word “bikini” became popular referring to minimalist beachwear and to the South Pacific atoll where nuclear tests were conducted. It is also the name of two new furniture projects by Werner Aisslinger for the Italian company Moroso. This work, which is to be introduced next month at the Milan Furniture Fair, is neither lethal nor scandalous, but it does disrupt convention.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/28/garden/28CURR5/28CURR5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/28/garden/28CURR5/28CURR5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/28/garden/28CURR5/28CURR5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/28/garden/28CURR5/28CURR5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/28/garden/28CURR5/28CURR5-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/28/garden/28CURR5/28CURR5