man and an English soccer executive is behind efforts to land an M.L.S. team for Orlando, Fla.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Although Orlando is a healthy market for third-division soccer, the Florida city was in the back of the pack for an M.L.S. team until an unlikely partnership put the Orlando City Lions on the radar of Major League Soccer.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/22/sports/soccer/orlandocity/orlandocity-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/22/sports/soccer/orlandocity/orlandocity-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/22/sports/soccer/orlandocity/orlandocity-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/22/sports/soccer/orlandocity/orlandocity-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Orlando Wants to Add M.L.S. to Attractions', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Augusto, Flavio', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rawlins, Phil', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Major League Soccer', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Orlando City (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Orlando (Fla)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-28T10:00:11+0000', 'document_type': 'arti