 today’s Times, plus a look at what’s happening in Washington.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/28/the-early-word-definition-2/', 'snippet': 'Political news from today’s Times, plus a look at what’s happening in Washington.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In Today’s Times:Returning for a second day to the topic of same-sex marriage, the Supreme Court seemed poised to invalidate a central part of the federal Defense of Marriage Act that defines marriage as the union of a man and a woman, Adam Liptak reports. If the justices strike the provision, same-sex spouses in jurisdictions where their marriage is legal would start to receive federal benefits.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Early Word: Definition', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-03-28T10:00:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ashley Southall', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ashley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Southall', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7434cede-2844-52a7-8157-f2ea25e5196b', 'word_count': 408, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7434cede-2844-52a7-8157-f2ea25e5196b'}, {'abstract': 'An idea whose time should come.', 'web_url': 'https://newoldage.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/28/a-volunteer-army-of-caregivers/', 'snippet': 'An idea whose time should come.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The idea first arose in a Twitter chat about elder care. What we need, someone wrote, is a Peace Corps for caregiving.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Volunteer Army of Caregivers', 'kicker': 'The New Old Age', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keyword