It had seemed right when my life looked a certain way. But then my life changed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When I meet a young woman, sometimes one of my students, sometimes a baby sitter, always creative, a little insecure, I often think of the day I found my wedding dress. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Say No to the Dress', 'kicker': 'Townies', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dresses', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bergdorf Goodman', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-28T16:00:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joanna Hershon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joanna', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hershon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/620bbde3-bc9f-5658-831d-05ca8a28ad99', 'word_count': 1203, 'uri': 'nyt://article/620bbde3-bc9f-5658-831d-05ca8a28ad99'}, {'abstract': 'A state capital and India’s information technology hub, Bangalore also boasts craft beer, balmy weather and bowling.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/31/travel/36-hours-in-bangalore-india.html', 'snippet': 'A state capital and India’s information technology hub, Bangalore also boasts craft beer, balmy weather and bowling.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Many tourists who find themselves in Bangalore, India’s third-largest city, are merely on their way to somewhere else: Goa, for instance, or Kerala. But there is reason to linger in this lively city of some nine and a half million people. As the capital of the State of Karnataka and India’s information technology hub, Bangalore has lots to offer: lush parks and gardens, a remarkably diverse restaurant scene, a raj-era palace and several beautiful churches, temples and mosques, not to mention temperatures in the 70s and 80s year round. Yes, the suffocating traffic can cause tempers to flare, but Bangaloreans are generally friendly and fun-loving. The stylish Koramangala and Indiranagar neighborhoods offer plenty of shopping, dining and night life, including dance clubs, sports bars and a jazz club. And if you like bowling, you’ve come to the right place.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/travel/31HOURS1_SPAN-sf/31HOURS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 608, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/31/travel/31HOURS1_SPAN-sf/31HOURS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 608}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/travel/31HOURS1_SPAN-sf/31HOURS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1012, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/travel/31HOURS1_SPAN-sf/31HOURS1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2023, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/travel/31HOURS1_SPAN-sf/31HOURS1_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/31/travel/31HOURS1_SPAN-sf/31HOURS1_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': '