le/ff5289cd-8d02-59f1-9ef8-85d6b504f22b'}, {'abstract': 'Carter Brey, the principal cellist of the New York Philharmonic, is performing all six Bach cello suites at Holy Trinity Lutheran Church.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/29/arts/music/philharmonic-and-carter-brey-in-bach-cello-suites.html', 'snippet': 'Carter Brey, the principal cellist of the New York Philharmonic, is performing all six Bach cello suites at Holy Trinity Lutheran Church.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Bach Variations, a monthlong festival of the New York Philharmonic, has served mainly to show the varied results that can be achieved on massed modern instruments by four conductors with disparate approaches to the application of period performance practice. But in an inspired change of pace, the orchestra has singled out its excellent principal cellist, Carter Brey, who is immersed in his own exploration of Baroque performance practice, to play Bach’s six cello suites on an instrument appropriate to the era at Holy Trinity Lutheran Church, near Lincoln Center.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/29/arts/29CARTER/CARTER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/29/arts/29CARTER/CARTER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/29/arts/29CARTER/CARTER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/29/arts/29CARTER/CARTER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'th