'snippet': 'In “Mental” a hitchhiker helps a man raise his troubled daughters after their mother is committed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Who is crazy, and who is sane? That question nags at almost all the characters in “Mental,” a hectic, hyperkinetic farce that reunites the Australian director P.J. Hogan with Toni Collette, the star of his hit 1995 comedy, “Muriel’s Wedding.” In “Mental” Ms. Collette plays Shaz, an unkempt, bong-smoking, knife-carrying nanny hired off the street by Barry Moochmore (Anthony LaPaglia), the mayor of Dolphin Heads, a coastal town in Queensland. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/29/arts/29MENTAL/MENTAL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 902, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/29/arts/29MENTAL/MENTAL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 902}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/29/arts/29MENTAL/MENTAL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 681, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/29/arts/29MENTAL/MENTAL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1362, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/29/arts/29MENTAL/MENTAL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/29/arts/29MENTAL/MENTAL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/29/arts/29MENTAL/MENTAL-thum