 4 of a series.', 'web_url': 'https://boss.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/29/my-search-for-a-credit-card-processor-part-4/', 'snippet': 'After months of research into how credit card transactions are processed, I make a decision. Part 4 of a series.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My search for a credit card processor started last April and dragged on through the end of January. Like many small-business owners, I have plenty of things to keep me busy, so my search was an on again/off again thing. As it progressed, I found that the more carefully I looked at the terms I was agreeing to, the less I liked them.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Choosing a Credit Card Processor (and Drawing Some Conclusions)', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Credit Cards', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Paul Downs Cabinetmakers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-29T11:00:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Downs', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Downs', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8b3fa91a-dbb6-5800-bf84-9e39ec592f60', 'word_count': 1048, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8b3fa91a-dbb6-5800-bf84-9e39ec592f60'}, {'abstract': 'As spring arrives, a host of gardening apps.', 'web_url': 'https://gadgetwise.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/29/app-smart-extra-for-the-garden/', 'snippet': 'As spring arrives, a host of gardening apps.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This week, App Smart was all about gardening because spring has sprung, or is about to. There are many apps that can help you in the garden, like plant reference guides or advice about garden bugs, and even apps that can help you manage your garden and its plants over time.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'App Smart Extra: For the Garden', 'kicker': 'Gadgetwise', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gardens and Gardening', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Applications', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-29T12:00:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kit Eaton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kit', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Eaton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/59b0c92a-e5af-5944-aeb8-c06a34f79463', 'word_count': 445, 'uri': 'nyt://article/59b0c92a-e5af-5944-aeb8-c06a34f79463'}, {'abstract': 'A summary of what’s on today’s editorial page.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/29/opinion-report-tahrir-square/', 'snippet': 'A summary of what’s on today’s editorial page.', 'lead_paragraph': 'From the editorial page', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Opinion Report: Tahrir Square', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-03-29T12:05:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Rosenthal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rosenthal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8a7a9b49