nedy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Pagan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kennedy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/26e55ce8-75da-507a-9fa1-bd799084c25f', 'word_count': 648, 'uri': 'nyt://article/26e55ce8-75da-507a-9fa1-bd799084c25f'}, {'abstract': 'He has starred with Chris Rock, Al Pacino and Alec Baldwin. And now he’s getting the best parts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/31/magazine/bobby-cannavale-broadways-hottest-outsider.html', 'snippet': 'He has starred with Chris Rock, Al Pacino and Alec Baldwin. And now he’s getting the best parts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was a miserable morning, rainy, cold and Wednesday, so Barney Greengrass was mostly empty. Bobby Cannavale was there having breakfast with the actor Richard Kind. Cannavale buttered a bialy as Kind endured a vegetable omelet. “I’ve been dieting for 45 years,” he said mournfully. Cannavale took his arm. “You look great, man,” he said. The two friends share a trainer.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/magazine/31cannavale1/31cannavale1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 528, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/31/magazine/31cannavale1/31cannavale1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 528}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/magazine/31cannavale1/31cannavale1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/magazine/31cannavale1/31cannavale1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1319, 'width': 