sraeli film director travels to Santiago de Compostela for a tribute to his work.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/31/books/review/the-retrospective-by-a-b-yehoshua.html', 'snippet': 'In A. B. Yehoshua’s novel, an Israeli film director travels to Santiago de Compostela for a tribute to his work.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Narrative imagination is its own thing: the muscular yet uncanny gift of the storyteller. It is distinct from useful, more rational elements like the psychology of characters, rich details of settings, pungent dialogue, clever plots, memorable images — all remain mechanical unless animated by the pure mastery of “and then,” the mysterious, proliferating other-life of narrative conviction. In the kind of narrative I mean, incidents themselves are prolific. That teeming germ-culture thrives notably in the writing of the Israeli novelist A. B. Yehoshua.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/books/review/31PINSKY/31PINSKY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 664, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/31/books/review/31PINSKY/31PINSKY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 664}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/books/review/31PINSKY/31PINSKY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 926, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/books/review/31PINSKY/31PINSKY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1227, 'width': 1109, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/books/review/31PINSKY/31PINSKY-thumbStan