to get tested for H.I.V. and hepatitis B and C, and he is accused of being a “menace to the public health.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'The unsanitary practices of a dentist in Tulsa, Okla., may have exposed thousands of patients to H.I.V. and hepatitis, forcing him to close his offices while health officials investigate and test about 7,000 people who had visited him since 2007.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/30/us/DENTIST/DENTIST-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 284, 'width': 215, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/30/us/DENTIST/DENTIST-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 284, 'width': 215, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/30/us/DENTIST/DENTIST-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/30/us/DENTIST/DENTIST-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/30/us/DENTIST/DENTIST-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Tests Start for Patients of Dentist in Inquiry', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tests Start For Patients Of Dentist In Inquiry', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Harrington, W Scott', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fernandez, Manny', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tulsa (Okla)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N