ared to be an effort to deter Mr. Liu’s wife from defying house arrest.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Relative of Jailed Chinese Laureate Faces Fraud Charges ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Relative of Jailed Chinese Laureate Faces Fraud Charges', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Liu Xiaobo', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Communist Party of China', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Liu Xia', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Frauds and Swindling', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-29T18:50:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chris Buckley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chris', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Buckley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f5d74365-9716-52c1-a39c-a155b0cc5b48', 'word_count': 698, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f5d74365-9716-52c1-a39c-a155b0cc5b48'}, {'abstract': 'The Chicago White Sox value the hitting approach of Jeff Keppinger, whose career average of 15.64 plate appearances per strikeout is the best among active American Leaguers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/31/sports/baseball/jeff-keppinger-white-sox-contact-hitter-may-be-last-of-dying-breed.html', 'snippet': 'The Chicago White Sox value the hitting approach of Jeff Keppinger, whose career average of 15.64 plate appearances per strikeout is the best among active American Leaguers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GLENDALE, Ariz. — Jeff Keppinger is playing for his seventh major league team in 10 years. He has never reached double figures in home runs or stolen bases, has never played in the postseason and has never, until now, played on more than a one-year contract.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/sports/31keppinger1/31keppinger1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/31/sports/31keppinger1/31keppinger1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/sports/31keppinger1/31keppinger1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/sports/31keppinger1/31keppinger1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/sports/31keppinger1/31keppinger1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/31/sports/31keppinger1/31keppinger1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/sports/31keppinger1/31keppinger1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Making Big Money, Finally, for Not Striking Out', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Making Big Money, Finally, for Not Striking Out', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Keppinger, Jeff', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kepner, Tyler', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chicago White Sox', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-29T18:58:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tyler Kepner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tyler', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kepner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3e5616f7-b6e1-5e8c-b326-4313667fe2f6', 'word_count': 718, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3e5616f7-b6e1-5e8c-b326-4313667fe2f6'}, {'abstract': 'If you were about to compete in a fixed-gear bike race, in the dark, in the cold, your nerves would show, right? The photographer Benedict Evans decided to find out.', 'web_url': 'https://6thfloor.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/29/on-a-cold-night-in-brooklyn-a-daredevil-bike-race/', 'snippet': 'If you were about to compete in a fixed-gear bike race, in the dark, in the cold, your nerves would show, right? The photographer Benedict Evans decided to find out.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you were just about to compete in a fixed-gear bike race, in the dark, in the cold, on a course with some very sharp turns and 30 or so other competitors, your nerves would show, right? At the Red Hook Criterium last year, the photographer Benedict Evans decided to find out. “The idea,” Evans, an avid cyclist himself, told me, “was to set up a kind of portable studio outdoors near the track, but it rained on the day, so I ended up renting the biggest U-Haul truck I could afford, covering the inside of it with black paper, driving it up next to the finish line and coaxing people inside it to be photographed. I figured that anyone willing to ride brakeless bikes around an intricate course in the dark of night would make for an interesting subject.” You can see some of his portraits here, among them that of Dan Chabanov, a bike messenger who has won three of the five races held so far.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/29/magazine/29-bike-1/29-bike-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 750, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/29/magazine/29-bike-1/29-bike-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 750}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/29/magazine/29-bike-1/29-bike-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 820, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/29/magazine/29-bike-1/29-bike-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1639, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/29/magazine/29-bike-1/29-bike-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/29/magazine/29-bike-1/29-bike-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/29/magazine/29-bike-1/29-bike-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'On a Cold Night in Brooklyn … a Daredevil Bike Race', 'kicker': 'The 6th Floor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_head