-gay remarks at a San Francisco concert.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/03/29/her-gig-canceled-after-tirade-michelle-shocked-plays-outside-in-protest/', 'snippet': 'The punk-folk singer showed up outside a club in Santa Cruz, Calif., which had canceled her scheduled performance after she made anti-gay remarks at a San Francisco concert.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After the punk-folk singer-songwriter Michelle Shocked made remarks critical of homosexuality and same-sex marriage while performing in San Francisco two weekends ago, clubs around the country responded by canceling bookings they had made with her. But that hasn’t stopped her: Thursday night she turned up outside one such club with her face covered and her mouth taped shut to protest the way she is being treated.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/29/arts/29artsbeat-shocked1/29artsbeat-shocked1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 507, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/29/arts/29artsbeat-shocked1/29artsbeat-shocked1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 507}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/29/arts/29artsbeat-shocked1/29artsbeat-shocked1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 865, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/29/arts/29artsbeat-shocked1/29artsbeat-shocked1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1729, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/29/arts/29artsbeat-shocked1/29artsbeat-shocked1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail',