, 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/e16b27d5-e54d-54ae-9202-1141138b195f', 'word_count': 746, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e16b27d5-e54d-54ae-9202-1141138b195f'}, {'abstract': 'If confirmed, the takeover of the town, Dael, would represent a new setback to Syrian forces, who have already ceded territory in the north and east.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/30/world/middleeast/insurgents-in-syria-said-to-seize-southern-town.html', 'snippet': 'If confirmed, the takeover of the town, Dael, would represent a new setback to Syrian forces, who have already ceded territory in the north and east.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DUBAI, United Arab Emirates — Syrian antigovernment activists reported the rebel seizure of a strategically important town in southern Syria on Friday only a few miles from the Jordanian border, which if confirmed would represent a new setback for government forces, who have already ceded territory to the insurgency in the north and east.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Southern Town in Syria Is Seized by Rebel Fighters', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Southern Town in Syria Is Seized by Rebel Fighters', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Droubi, Hala', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Assad, Bashar al-', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Damascus (Syria)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Coalition of Syrian Revolutionary and Opposition Forces', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Jordan', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-29T20:29:05+0000', 'document_type