tml', 'snippet': 'The silhouette of these vintage gowns and the variety of options for accessories are the attraction.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The latest wedding fashions are inspired by a couple who didn’t work out so well and by a television series that has been a resounding success. ', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Something Borrowed From the Past', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Something Borrowed From the Past', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chang, Bee-Shyuan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dresses', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nineteen Hundred Twenties', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Great Gatsby (Book)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Downton Abbey (TV Program)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-29T20:40:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Society', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Weddings', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bee-Shyuan Chang', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bee-shyuan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Chang', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1d3d0c5e-cbef-5c80-b9ea-629941bc09d3', 'word_count': 1315, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1d3d0c5e-cbef-5c80-b9ea-629941bc09d3'}, {'abstract': 'Jeremy Piven, who plays the lead role in the eight-part PBS series “Mr. Selfridge,” says he relates to the pathbreaking department store founder.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/31/arts/television/an-interview-with-jeremy-piven-star-of-mr-selfridge.html', 'snippet': 'Jeremy Piven, who plays the lead role in the eight-part PBS series “Mr. Selfridge,” says he relates to the pathbreaking department store founder.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JEREMY PIVEN IS BEST KNOWN as the venal, tantrum-throwing superagent Ari Gold on HBO’s hit comedy “Entourage”; as an alumnus of the Piven Theater Workshop in Chicago, founded by his parents, Joyce and Byrne Piven; and as the center of a highly publicized 2009 breach-of-contract dispute after he left a Broadway production of “Speed-the-Plow” two months early, citing exhaustion and mercury poisoning. (Mr. Piven won in arbitration.) ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/arts/31PIVEN1_SPAN/31PIVEN1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/31/arts/31PIVEN1_SPAN/31PIVEN1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/arts/31PIVEN1_SPAN/31PIVEN1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/arts/31PIVEN1_SPAN/31PIVEN1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/arts/31PIVEN1_SPAN/31PIVEN1_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/31/arts/31PIVEN1_SPAN/31PIVEN1_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/arts/31PIVEN1_SPAN/31PIVEN1_SPAN-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Swagger Retooled for 1908', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Swagger Retooled for 1908', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Public Broadcasting Service', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Piven, Jeremy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-29T20:41:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Margy Rochlin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Margy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rochlin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interview', '_id': 'nyt://article/90ecaedb-c13b-532c-80bb-a59c386e3d76', 'word_count': 1064, 'uri': 'nyt://article/90ecaedb-c13b-532c-80bb-a59c386e3d76'}, {'abstract': 'A new application of so-called drive-by-wire technology, to be available on the 2014 Infiniti Q50 sedan, may attract some attention. Except during emergencies, that car’s steering wheel will have no mechanical connection to the front wheels.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/31/automobiles/drive-by-wire-an-aerospace-solution.html', 'snippet': 'A new application of so-called drive-by-wire technology, to be available on the 2014 Infiniti Q50 sedan, may attract some attention. Except during emergencies, that car’s steering wheel will have no mechanical connection to the front wheels.', 'lead_paragraph': 'So long as their car moves when the pedal is pressed, there is little reason for drivers of newer cars to care whether electronics have replaced the physical connection between the accelerator and the engine. ', 'print_section': 'AU', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Drive by Wire, an Aerospace Solution', 'kicker': 'Technology', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Drive by Wire, an Aerospace Solution', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Austen, Ian', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Infiniti Division of Nissan Motor Co', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-29T20:46:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Automobiles', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ian Austen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Austen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ca28ff8b-f82e-5971-9203-ccd7177892f9', 'word_count': 643, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ca28ff8b-f82e-5971-9203-ccd7177892f9'}, {'abstract': 'The 2014 Acura RLX, on display at the New York auto show, has a feature that Acura calls Precision All-Wheel Steer, which is intended to improve handling by adding steering capability to the rear wheels.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/31/automobiles/beyond-all-wheel-drive-all-wheel-steering.html', 'snippet': 'The 2014 Acura RLX, on display at the New York auto show, has a feature that Acura calls Precision All-Wheel Steer, which is intended to improve handling by adding steering capability to the rear wheels.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The notion of making vehicles turn better by steering all four of their wheels has inspired engineers for decades. The United States Army experimented with all-wheel-steering jeeps during World War II, and the benefits to maneuverability of rear-steering have long been known to firefighters assigned to hook-and-ladder trucks. ', 'print_section': 'AU', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/automobiles/31STEER/31STEER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 248, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/31/automobiles/31STEER/31STEER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 248}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/automobiles/31STEER/31STEER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 349, 'width': 843, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/automobiles/31STEER/31STEER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 349, 'width': 843, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/automobiles/31STEER/31STEER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/31/automobiles/31STEER/31STEER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/automobiles/31STEER/31STEER-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Beyond All-Wheel Drive, All-Wheel Steering', 'kicker': 'Technology', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Beyond All-Wheel Drive, All-Wheel Steering', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ACURA DIVISION OF HONDA MOTOR CO', 'rank': 2, 'major':