le/a3be06bf-cc24-5d65-a52c-edf920cafdeb'}, {'abstract': 'In “Boeing-Boeing,” now onstage at the Engeman Theater at Northport, one bachelor has a trio of lovers, each one thinking she is his one and only.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/31/nyregion/a-review-of-boeing-boeing-in-northport.html', 'snippet': 'In “Boeing-Boeing,” now onstage at the Engeman Theater at Northport, one bachelor has a trio of lovers, each one thinking she is his one and only.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The eight sturdy doors that surround the living room of a Paris apartment in Marc Camoletti’s “Boeing-Boeing” are a good tip-off that a farce is about to ensue. So is the setup — one bachelor, three fiancées — which is outlined early on by the bachelor, an American architect named Bernard. ', 'print_section': 'LI', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/nyregion/31ARTSLI1_SPAN/31ARTSLI1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/31/nyregion/31ARTSLI1_SPAN/31ARTSLI1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/nyregion/31ARTSLI1_SPAN/31ARTSLI1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/nyregion/31ARTSLI1_SPAN/31ARTSLI1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/31/nyregion/31ARTSLI1_SPAN/31ARTSLI1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'l