orida Derby.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/30/sports/kentucky-derby-dreams-aroused-by-itsmyluckyday.html', 'snippet': 'Eddie Plesa Jr., a little-known trainer, has a leading Kentucky Derby contender in Itsmyluckyday, a slight 2-1 favorite to win the Florida Derby.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MIAMI GARDENS, Fla. — Itsmyluckyday stops while walking the shed row in Barn 74 at Calder Race Course to gaze at his reflection in the glass door that leads into the office of Eddie Plesa Jr., his trainer. He leans his head to the right and peers intently as if to say, “Is that really me?”', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/30/sports/RACING2/RACING2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 416, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/30/sports/RACING2/RACING2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 416}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/30/sports/RACING2/RACING2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 710, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/30/sports/RACING2/RACING2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1420, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/30/sports/RACING2/RACING2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/30/sports/RACING2/RACING2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/30