eir shots at scaling the line. One by one, most of them dropped short of the top. They were already three hours behind the front-runners in their class.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/30/us/MARINES-1/MARINES-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/03/30/us/MARINES-1/MARINES-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 396}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/30/us/MARINES-1/MARINES-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 676, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/30/us/MARINES-1/MARINES-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1351, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/30/us/MARINES-1/MARINES-1-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/03/30/us/MARINES-1/MARINES-1-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/03/30/us/MARINES-1/MARINES-1-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Women (and Men) Face Big Hurdles in Training for Marine Infantry Units', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Women (and Men) Face Big Hurdles in Training for Marine Infantry Units', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'o