’s reproductive health and freedom to a shocking new low by passing a bill that they must know perfectly well is unconstitutional by any reading of the 1973 Roe v. Wade decision and others since.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Campaign to Outlaw Abortion', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Campaign to Outlaw Abortion', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ABORTION', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'State Legislatures', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'North Dakota', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ARKANSAS', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-30T01:53:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/3c6f6391-2f54-5f93-bacd-1c068dfe4f08', 'word_count': 488, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3c6f6391-2f54-5f93-bacd-1c068dfe4f08'}, {'abstract': 'Corrections appearing in print on March 30, 2013.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/30/pageoneplus/corrections-march-30-2013.html', 'snippet': 'Corrections appearing in print on March 30, 2013.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NATIONAL', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: March 30, 2013', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-03-30T02:00:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_i