', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/03/30/opinion/a-prescription-for-sick-workers.html', 'snippet': 'Finally, a bill that will help more employees enjoy a basic benefit moves to the City Council.', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York City Council Speaker Christine Quinn has finally agreed to require businesses to provide paid sick leave for as many as one million workers. This is good news, although it will take at least a year for most employees to enjoy a basic benefit widely available elsewhere. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Prescription for Sick Workers', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Prescription for Sick Workers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Paid Time Off', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Quinn, Christine C', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bloomberg, Michael R', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'City Council (NYC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-03-30T02:27:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/7cc65d8d-ddb8-5b34-b7b1-fe7896b40148', 'word_count': 329, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7cc65d8d-ddb8-5b34-b7b1-fe7896b40148'}, {'abstract': 'From the size of the crowds at more than 100 rallies this week, it’s going to take a stronger push from the public to demand that Congress not duck gun control.